      "skos:note": "Commission may extend period for complying with notices"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-55d-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "55D(2) Extending periods for complying with notices",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 30,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Commission may, by written notice given to the surcharge\nparticipant, extend the period within which the participant must\ncomply with the notice.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nPayment surcharges  Part IVC\nInformation about payment surcharges  Division 3\n\nSection 55E\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026"
    },
    {
