    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-55f",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "55F Purpose and effect of this Division",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-55f"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.32",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The purpose of this Division is to provide for the issue of an\ninfringement notice to a person for an alleged contravention of\nsection 55B as an alternative to proceedings for an order under\nsection 76 for the payment of a pecuniary penalty.\n\n(2) This Division does not:\n\n(a) require an infringement notice to be issued to a person for an\nalleged contravention of section 55B; or\n\n(b) affect the liability of a person to proceedings under\nsection 76 in relation to an alleged contravention of\nsection 55B if:\n\n(i) an infringement notice is not issued to the person for the\ncontravention; or\n\n(ii) an infringement notice issued to the person for the\ncontravention is withdrawn under section 55N; or\n\n(c) prevent a court from imposing a higher penalty than the\npenalty specified in the infringement notice if the person\ndoes not comply with the notice.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The purpose of this Division is to provide for the issue of an\ninfringement notice to a person for an alleged contravention of\nsection 55B as an alternative to proceedings for an order under\nsection 76 for the payment of a pecuniary penalty.\n\n(2) This Division does not:\n\n(a) require an infringement notice to be issued to a person for an\nalleged contravention of section 55B; or\n\n(b) affect the liability of a person to proceedings under\nsection 76 in relation to an alleged contravention of\nsection 55B if:\n\n(i) an infringement notice is not issued to the person for the\ncontravention; or\n\n(ii) an infringement notice issued to the person for the\ncontravention is withdrawn under section 55N; or\n\n(c) prevent a court from imposing a higher penalty than the\npenalty specified in the infringement notice if the person\ndoes not comply with the notice.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-55f-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-55f-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a9cef974a8f2920a0f0eca27019bf6f06508101e1f70cfd2344870bf40b49dad"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-55f",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "55F Purpose and effect of this Division",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 32,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The purpose of this Division is to provide for the issue of an\ninfringement notice to a person for an alleged contravention of\nsection 55B as an alternative to proceedings for an order under\nsection 76 for the payment of a pecuniary penalty.\n\n(2) This Division does not:\n\n(a) require an infringement notice to be issued to a person for an\nalleged contravention of section 55B; or\n\n(b) affect the liability of a person to proceedings under\nsection 76 in relation to an alleged contravention of\nsection 55B if:\n\n(i) an infringement notice is not issued to the person for the\ncontravention; or\n\n(ii) an infringement notice issued to the person for the\ncontravention is withdrawn under section 55N; or\n\n(c) prevent a court from imposing a higher penalty than the\npenalty specified in the infringement notice if the person\ndoes not comply with the notice."
    },
    {
