      "cml:premiseText": "(i) an infringement notice is not issued to the person for the contravention; or (ii) an infringement notice issued to the person for the contravention is withdrawn under section 55N;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The conditions are temporally included."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-55f-ss-2-logic-ltl-3",
