    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-55h",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "55H Matters to be included in an infringement notice",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-55h"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.33",
      "values:originalText": "(1) An infringement notice must:\n\n(a) be identified by a unique number; and\n\n(b) state the day on which it is issued; and\n\n(c) state the name and address of the person to whom it is issued;\nand\n\n(d) identify the Commission and state how it may be contacted;\nand\n\n(e) give details of the alleged contravention, including the day of\nthe alleged contravention; and\n\n(f) state the maximum pecuniary penalty that the court could\norder the person to pay under section 76 for the alleged\ncontravention; and\n\n(g) specify the penalty that is payable in relation to the alleged\ncontravention; and\n\n(h) state that the penalty is payable within the infringement\nnotice compliance period for the notice; and\n\n(i) state that the penalty is payable to the Commission on behalf\nof the Commonwealth; and\n\n(j) explain how payment of the penalty is to be made; and\n\n(k) explain the effect of sections 55K, 55L, 55M and 55N.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) An infringement notice must:\n\n(a) be identified by a unique number; and\n\n(b) state the day on which it is issued; and\n\n(c) state the name and address of the person to whom it is issued;\nand\n\n(d) identify the Commission and state how it may be contacted;\nand\n\n(e) give details of the alleged contravention, including the day of\nthe alleged contravention; and\n\n(f) state the maximum pecuniary penalty that the court could\norder the person to pay under section 76 for the alleged\ncontravention; and\n\n(g) specify the penalty that is payable in relation to the alleged\ncontravention; and\n\n(h) state that the penalty is payable within the infringement\nnotice compliance period for the notice; and\n\n(i) state that the penalty is payable to the Commission on behalf\nof the Commonwealth; and\n\n(j) explain how payment of the penalty is to be made; and\n\n(k) explain the effect of sections 55K, 55L, 55M and 55N.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-55h-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-55h-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "696a6f7aef0c042c4fb7abd0e2440fb829dffa59ec503fa8e813b7d523435758",
      "skos:note": "Infringement notice requirements",
      "dc:description": "a unique number, day of issue, name and address, Commission contact details, alleged contravention details, penalty information, payment instructions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-55h",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "55H Matters to be included in an infringement notice",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 33,
      "values:originalText": "(1) An infringement notice must:\n\n(a) be identified by a unique number; and\n\n(b) state the day on which it is issued; and\n\n(c) state the name and address of the person to whom it is issued;\nand\n\n(d) identify the Commission and state how it may be contacted;\nand\n\n(e) give details of the alleged contravention, including the day of\nthe alleged contravention; and\n\n(f) state the maximum pecuniary penalty that the court could\norder the person to pay under section 76 for the alleged\ncontravention; and\n\n(g) specify the penalty that is payable in relation to the alleged\ncontravention; and\n\n(h) state that the penalty is payable within the infringement\nnotice compliance period for the notice; and\n\n(i) state that the penalty is payable to the Commission on behalf\nof the Commonwealth; and\n\n(j) explain how payment of the penalty is to be made; and\n\n(k) explain the effect of sections 55K, 55L, 55M and 55N."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-55h-norm",
