      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.34",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Commission may extend, by notice in writing, the\ninfringement notice compliance period for the infringement notice\nif the Commission is satisfied that it is appropriate to do so.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nPayment surcharges  Part IVC\nInfringement notices  Division 4\n\nSection 55N\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
