    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56aj",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56AJ Meaning of data holder",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56aj"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.47",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person is a data holder, of CDR data, if:\n\n(a) the CDR data:\n\n(i) is information within a class of information specified, as\ndescribed in paragraph 56AC(2)(a), in an instrument\ndesignating a sector under subsection 56AC(2) (the\ndesignation instrument); or\n\n(ii) is directly or indirectly derived from information\ncovered by subparagraph (i); and\n\n(b) the CDR data is held by (or on behalf of) the person on or\nafter the earliest holding day specified in the designation\ninstrument; and\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A person is a data holder, of CDR data, if:\n\n(a) the CDR data:\n\n(i) is information within a class of information specified, as\ndescribed in paragraph 56AC(2)(a), in an instrument\ndesignating a sector under subsection 56AC(2) (the\ndesignation instrument); or\n\n(ii) is directly or indirectly derived from information\ncovered by subparagraph (i); and\n\n(b) the CDR data is held by (or on behalf of) the person on or\nafter the earliest holding day specified in the designation\ninstrument; and\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56aj-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c1987573301408fe791309f9dec635d32825a4d977926c25fc36400356ff7a55",
      "skos:note": "A person is a data holder if they hold CDR data within a specified class and on or after the earliest holding day."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56aj",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56AJ Meaning of data holder",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 47,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person is a data holder, of CDR data, if:\n\n(a) the CDR data:\n\n(i) is information within a class of information specified, as\ndescribed in paragraph 56AC(2)(a), in an instrument\ndesignating a sector under subsection 56AC(2) (the\ndesignation instrument); or\n\n(ii) is directly or indirectly derived from information\ncovered by subparagraph (i); and\n\n(b) the CDR data is held by (or on behalf of) the person on or\nafter the earliest holding day specified in the designation\ninstrument; and\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc."
    },
