      "values:originalText": "(1) A person is an accredited data recipient, of CDR data, if:\n\n(a) the person is an accredited person; and\n\n(b) the CDR data is held by (or on behalf of) the person; and\n\n(c) the CDR data, or any other CDR data from which it was\ndirectly or indirectly derived, either:\n\n(i) was disclosed to the person under the consumer data\nrules; or\n\n(ii) is covered by subsection (2) for the person; and\n\n(d) the person is neither a data holder, nor a designated gateway,\nfor the first-mentioned CDR data; and\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nConsumer data right  Part IVD\nPreliminary  Division 1\n\nSection 56AL\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(e) the first-mentioned CDR data is not being held by (or on\nbehalf of) the person as an action service provider for a type\nof CDR action.\nNote:\nFor paragraph (d), the person will be a data holder of that CDR data if\nsubsection 56AJ(4) applies.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A person is an accredited data recipient, of CDR data, if:\n\n(a) the person is an accredited person; and\n\n(b) the CDR data is held by (or on behalf of) the person; and\n\n(c) the CDR data, or any other CDR data from which it was\ndirectly or indirectly derived, either:\n\n(i) was disclosed to the person under the consumer data\nrules; or\n\n(ii) is covered by subsection (2) for the person; and\n\n(d) the person is neither a data holder, nor a designated gateway,\nfor the first-mentioned CDR data; and\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nConsumer data right  Part IVD\nPreliminary  Division 1\n\nSection 56AL\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(e) the first-mentioned CDR data is not being held by (or on\nbehalf of) the person as an action service provider for a type\nof CDR action.\nNote:\nFor paragraph (d), the person will be a data holder of that CDR data if\nsubsection 56AJ(4) applies.",
