      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The CDR data is not being held by or on behalf of the person as an action service provider for a type of CDR action.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "There is a temporal interval between when the CDR data was disclosed to the person and when it was held by or on behalf of them."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ak-ss-1-logic-deontic-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "<",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibition on being a data holder",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The person is neither a data holder nor a designated gateway for the first-mentioned CDR data.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The person cannot be a data holder."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ak-ss-1-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": ">",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Right to hold CDR data",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The CDR data is held by or on behalf of the person.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The person has a right to hold the CDR data."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ak-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56AK(2) Meaning of accredited data recipient",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56ak-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.50",
      "values:originalText": "(2) This subsection covers CDR data for a person if:\n\n(a) the CDR data is information that relates to a CDR consumer\nfor a CDR action; and\n\n(b) the person is authorised by the consumer data rules to use or\ndisclose that information to prepare or give a valid\ninstruction for the performance of the CDR action on behalf\nof the CDR consumer.\nNote:\nThis CDR data is information that is CDR data because of\nparagraph 56AI(1)(aa). Paragraph 56BGA(1)(d) ensures the rules can\ngive the authorisation referred to in paragraph (b) of this subsection.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) This subsection covers CDR data for a person if:\n\n(a) the CDR data is information that relates to a CDR consumer\nfor a CDR action; and\n\n(b) the person is authorised by the consumer data rules to use or\ndisclose that information to prepare or give a valid\ninstruction for the performance of the CDR action on behalf\nof the CDR consumer.\nNote:\nThis CDR data is information that is CDR data because of\nparagraph 56AI(1)(aa). Paragraph 56BGA(1)(d) ensures the rules can\ngive the authorisation referred to in paragraph (b) of this subsection.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ak"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ak-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ak-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "af74c4bfcd9b4521b7a36b7329641f1acabd827ddb0aa6cea6eb1f740c8a7c6e",
      "skos:note": "Authorisation required for using or disclosing CDR data"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56ak-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56AK(2) Meaning of accredited data recipient",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 50,
      "values:originalText": "(2) This subsection covers CDR data for a person if:\n\n(a) the CDR data is information that relates to a CDR consumer\nfor a CDR action; and\n\n(b) the person is authorised by the consumer data rules to use or\ndisclose that information to prepare or give a valid\ninstruction for the performance of the CDR action on behalf\nof the CDR consumer.\nNote:\nThis CDR data is information that is CDR data because of\nparagraph 56AI(1)(aa). Paragraph 56BGA(1)(d) ensures the rules can\ngive the authorisation referred to in paragraph (b) of this subsection."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ak-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
