      "skos:note": "Definition of CDR declaration for a type of CDR action Disclose chargeable CDR data in specified circumstances. Definition of voluntary action service provider for CDR actions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56am-ss-2",
