      "cml:logicSummary": "Class hierarchy",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::dl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The consumer data rules may include rules about accreditation...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...including about different levels of accreditation"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56am-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56AM(1) Meanings of chargeable CDR data, chargeable circumstances",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56am-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.52",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person is an action service provider, for a type of CDR action, if\nthe person:\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nConsumer data right  Part IVD\nPreliminary  Division 1\n\nSection 56AMC\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(a) is within a class of data holders (of CDR data) declared in the\nCDR declaration for that type of CDR action; or\n\n(b) is a voluntary action service provider for that type of CDR\naction.\nNote 1:\nA data holder covered by paragraph (a) has no choice about being an\naction service provider for CDR actions of that type.\nNote 2:\nA data holder covered by paragraph (a) for one or more types of CDR\nactions will not be an action service provider for any other type of\nCDR action unless the data holder chooses to apply to be a voluntary\naction service provider.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A person is an action service provider, for a type of CDR action, if\nthe person:\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nConsumer data right  Part IVD\nPreliminary  Division 1\n\nSection 56AMC\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(a) is within a class of data holders (of CDR data) declared in the\nCDR declaration for that type of CDR action; or\n\n(b) is a voluntary action service provider for that type of CDR\naction.\nNote 1:\nA data holder covered by paragraph (a) has no choice about being an\naction service provider for CDR actions of that type.\nNote 2:\nA data holder covered by paragraph (a) for one or more types of CDR\nactions will not be an action service provider for any other type of\nCDR action unless the data holder chooses to apply to be a voluntary\naction service provider.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56am"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56am-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56am-ss-1-logic-descriptionlogic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56am-ss-1-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56am-ss-1-logic-alleninterval-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56am-ss-1-logic-ltl-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56am-ss-1-logic-deontic-5"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56am-ss-1-logic-deontic-6"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56am-ss-1-logic-deontic-7"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56am-ss-1-logic-alleninterval-8"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56am-ss-1-logic-deontic-9"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56am-ss-1-logic-linearlogic-10"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56am-ss-1-logic-alleninterval-11"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56am-ss-1-logic-argumentation-12"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56am-ss-1-logic-diffusion-13"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bb2386a90d89c34c2f610198667f659b3f70336cb68b1c0e3ebc9fb3e6052a84",
      "skos:note": "A person is an action service provider for a type of CDR action if the person meets certain conditions. CDR data is chargeable if specified in an instrument designation instrument Defines a CDR action as an action declared under section 56ACA."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56am-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56AM(1) Meanings of chargeable CDR data, chargeable circumstances",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 52,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person is an action service provider, for a type of CDR action, if\nthe person:\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nConsumer data right  Part IVD\nPreliminary  Division 1\n\nSection 56AMC\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(a) is within a class of data holders (of CDR data) declared in the\nCDR declaration for that type of CDR action; or\n\n(b) is a voluntary action service provider for that type of CDR\naction.\nNote 1:\nA data holder covered by paragraph (a) has no choice about being an\naction service provider for CDR actions of that type.\nNote 2:\nA data holder covered by paragraph (a) for one or more types of CDR\nactions will not be an action service provider for any other type of\nCDR action unless the data holder chooses to apply to be a voluntary\naction service provider."
    },
