    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ao-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56AO(3) Extraterritorial operation of the CDR provisions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56ao-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.54",
      "values:originalText": "(3) To the extent that the CDR provisions have effect in relation to an\nact, or omission, relating to CDR data held outside Australia, the\nCDR provisions only apply if:\n\n(a) the act or omission is by (or on behalf of) an Australian\nperson; or\n\n(b) the act or omission occurs wholly or partly in Australia, or\nwholly or partly on board an Australian aircraft or an\nAustralian ship; or\n\n(c) the act or omission occurs wholly outside Australia, and an\nAustralian person suffers, or is likely to suffer, financial or\nother disadvantage as a result of the act or omission.\nCDR provisions apply for CDR actions to be performed inside\nAustralia",
      "skos:definition": "(3) To the extent that the CDR provisions have effect in relation to an\nact, or omission, relating to CDR data held outside Australia, the\nCDR provisions only apply if:\n\n(a) the act or omission is by (or on behalf of) an Australian\nperson; or\n\n(b) the act or omission occurs wholly or partly in Australia, or\nwholly or partly on board an Australian aircraft or an\nAustralian ship; or\n\n(c) the act or omission occurs wholly outside Australia, and an\nAustralian person suffers, or is likely to suffer, financial or\nother disadvantage as a result of the act or omission.\nCDR provisions apply for CDR actions to be performed inside\nAustralia",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ao"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ao-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ao-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
