          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ao-ss-3-logic-deontic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ao-ss-3-logic-deontic-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c085e2a912bd6c0fa6c7e4ec51efe2838a1311c87c5aa0b6bd2952f129d943b3",
      "skos:note": "CDR provisions apply to acts or omissions by Australian persons, within Australia, or causing financial disadvantage outside Australia."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56ao-ss-3",
