      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) the act or omission is by (or on behalf of) an Australian person",
      "cml:conclusionText": "CDR provisions apply"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ao-ss-3-logic-deontic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "if-then",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Conditional obligation",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) the act or omission occurs wholly or partly in Australia, or wholly or partly on board an Australian aircraft or an Australian ship",
      "cml:conclusionText": "CDR provisions apply"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ao-ss-3-logic-deontic-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "if-then",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Conditional obligation",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(c) the act or omission occurs wholly outside Australia, and an Australian person suffers, or is likely to suffer, financial or other disadvantage as a result of the act or omission",
      "cml:conclusionText": "CDR provisions apply"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ao-ss-3a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56AO(3A) Extraterritorial operation of the CDR provisions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56ao-ss-3a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.54",
      "values:originalText": "(3A) To the extent that the CDR provisions have effect in relation to a\nCDR action to be performed within Australia, the CDR provisions\napply in relation to all persons (including foreign persons).\nExample: Requirements in the consumer data rules relating to giving a valid\ninstruction for the performance of a CDR action within Australia can\napply to the accredited action initiator for the CDR action even if the\naccredited action initiator is a foreign person.\nCDR provisions can apply for CDR actions to be performed\noutside Australia",
      "skos:definition": "(3A) To the extent that the CDR provisions have effect in relation to a\nCDR action to be performed within Australia, the CDR provisions\napply in relation to all persons (including foreign persons).\nExample: Requirements in the consumer data rules relating to giving a valid\ninstruction for the performance of a CDR action within Australia can\napply to the accredited action initiator for the CDR action even if the\naccredited action initiator is a foreign person.\nCDR provisions can apply for CDR actions to be performed\noutside Australia",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ao"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ao-ss-3a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ao-ss-3a-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0a594d27fdb2ee942684f73cf32840bda0dc4c390a1149ebf9472bbdd6cfd705",
      "skos:note": "CDR provisions apply to all persons, including foreign persons, within Australia."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56ao-ss-3a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56AO(3A) Extraterritorial operation of the CDR provisions",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 54,
      "values:originalText": "(3A) To the extent that the CDR provisions have effect in relation to a\nCDR action to be performed within Australia, the CDR provisions\napply in relation to all persons (including foreign persons).\nExample: Requirements in the consumer data rules relating to giving a valid\ninstruction for the performance of a CDR action within Australia can\napply to the accredited action initiator for the CDR action even if the\naccredited action initiator is a foreign person.\nCDR provisions can apply for CDR actions to be performed\noutside Australia"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ao-ss-3a-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
