    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ar",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56AR Government entities may participate under this Part",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56ar"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.57",
      "values:originalText": "Application to Commonwealth government entities\n\n(1) The CDR provisions apply in relation to an entity that:\n\n(a) is part of the Commonwealth; or\n\n(b) is a Commonwealth entity (within the meaning of the Public\nGovernance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013); or\n\n(c) is a body (whether or not incorporated) established by or\nunder a law of the Commonwealth; or\n\n(d) is:\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "Application to Commonwealth government entities\n\n(1) The CDR provisions apply in relation to an entity that:\n\n(a) is part of the Commonwealth; or\n\n(b) is a Commonwealth entity (within the meaning of the Public\nGovernance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013); or\n\n(c) is a body (whether or not incorporated) established by or\nunder a law of the Commonwealth; or\n\n(d) is:\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ar-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ar-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "cfbecea05f132eaff39870dcb0567363559da7f06f86ba33ddd3092f3c8c5074",
      "skos:note": "Entities subject to CDR provisions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56ar",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56AR Government entities may participate under this Part",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 57,
      "values:originalText": "Application to Commonwealth government entities\n\n(1) The CDR provisions apply in relation to an entity that:\n\n(a) is part of the Commonwealth; or\n\n(b) is a Commonwealth entity (within the meaning of the Public\nGovernance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013); or\n\n(c) is a body (whether or not incorporated) established by or\nunder a law of the Commonwealth; or\n\n(d) is:\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc."
    },
    {
