    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56as",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56AS Participating government entities of a State or Territory—",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56as"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.59",
      "values:originalText": "declaration\n\n(1) The Minister may, by notifiable instrument, declare that an entity is\na participating entity, for a State or Territory, in one or more of the\nfollowing specified capacities:\n\n(a) as a data holder of CDR data;\n\n(b) as an accredited person;\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "declaration\n\n(1) The Minister may, by notifiable instrument, declare that an entity is\na participating entity, for a State or Territory, in one or more of the\nfollowing specified capacities:\n\n(a) as a data holder of CDR data;\n\n(b) as an accredited person;\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56as-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56as-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ee2dbfc1e034079a0fb7be01572a6e682092b8293e7d75c71827775fedfee03d",
      "skos:note": "The Minister may declare an entity as a participating entity."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56as",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56AS Participating government entities of a State or Territory—",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 59,
      "values:originalText": "declaration\n\n(1) The Minister may, by notifiable instrument, declare that an entity is\na participating entity, for a State or Territory, in one or more of the\nfollowing specified capacities:\n\n(a) as a data holder of CDR data;\n\n(b) as an accredited person;\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56as-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56as"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56as-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "may",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Declaration of participation is obligatory.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
