    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56at-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56AT(2) Participating government entities of a State or Territory—",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56at-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.60",
      "values:originalText": "(2) If a State or Territory requests in writing the Minister to revoke a\ndeclaration made under subsection 56AS(1) that an entity is a\nparticipating entity for the State or Territory, the Minister must,\nunder subsection (1) of this section, revoke the declaration as soon\nas practicable.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) If a State or Territory requests in writing the Minister to revoke a\ndeclaration made under subsection 56AS(1) that an entity is a\nparticipating entity for the State or Territory, the Minister must,\nunder subsection (1) of this section, revoke the declaration as soon\nas practicable.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56at"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56at-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56at-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "59e78dc72f38770876229c2a2ded7c39ca9edcd5dfc87ff93a18dd98669d648a",
      "skos:note": "Minister must revoke declaration as soon as practicable upon request."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56at-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56AT(2) Participating government entities of a State or Territory—",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 60,
      "values:originalText": "(2) If a State or Territory requests in writing the Minister to revoke a\ndeclaration made under subsection 56AS(1) that an entity is a\nparticipating entity for the State or Territory, the Minister must,\nunder subsection (1) of this section, revoke the declaration as soon\nas practicable."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56at-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
