    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56at-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56AT(3) Participating government entities of a State or Territory—",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56at-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.60",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If the Minister revokes a declaration made under\nsubsection 56AS(1) in relation to an entity, then, despite the\nrevocation, subsection 56AR(2) continues to apply to the entity in\nrelation to:\n\n(a) any right, privilege, obligation or liability acquired, accrued\nor incurred before the revocation; and\n\n(b) any investigation, legal proceeding or remedy in respect of\nany such right, privilege, obligation or liability;\nas if the declaration were still in force.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nConsumer data right  Part IVD\nPreliminary  Division 1\n\nSection 56AU\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nSubdivision F—Application to acts done by or in relation to\nagents etc. of CDR entities",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If the Minister revokes a declaration made under\nsubsection 56AS(1) in relation to an entity, then, despite the\nrevocation, subsection 56AR(2) continues to apply to the entity in\nrelation to:\n\n(a) any right, privilege, obligation or liability acquired, accrued\nor incurred before the revocation; and\n\n(b) any investigation, legal proceeding or remedy in respect of\nany such right, privilege, obligation or liability;\nas if the declaration were still in force.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nConsumer data right  Part IVD\nPreliminary  Division 1\n\nSection 56AU\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nSubdivision F—Application to acts done by or in relation to\nagents etc. of CDR entities",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56at"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56at-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56at-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56at-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56at-ss-3-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56at-ss-3-logic-deontic-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2f97a2c2453a8b03c00960d3a53103aed62ba6f94b8001d74781951e3f73bd76",
      "skos:note": "Continues to apply to entity in relation to acquired, accrued or incurred rights, privileges, obligations or liabilities after revocation of declaration."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56at-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56AT(3) Participating government entities of a State or Territory—",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 60,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If the Minister revokes a declaration made under\nsubsection 56AS(1) in relation to an entity, then, despite the\nrevocation, subsection 56AR(2) continues to apply to the entity in\nrelation to:\n\n(a) any right, privilege, obligation or liability acquired, accrued\nor incurred before the revocation; and\n\n(b) any investigation, legal proceeding or remedy in respect of\nany such right, privilege, obligation or liability;\nas if the declaration were still in force.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nConsumer data right  Part IVD\nPreliminary  Division 1\n\nSection 56AU\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nSubdivision F—Application to acts done by or in relation to\nagents etc. of CDR entities"
    },
