    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56au-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56AU(3) Acts done by or in relation to agents etc. of CDR entities",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56au-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.61",
      "values:originalText": "(3) In this section:\nCDR entity means any of the following:\n\n(a) a data holder of CDR data;\n\n(b) an accredited person;\n\n(c) a designated gateway for CDR data;\n\n(d) an action service provider for a type of CDR action.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) In this section:\nCDR entity means any of the following:\n\n(a) a data holder of CDR data;\n\n(b) an accredited person;\n\n(c) a designated gateway for CDR data;\n\n(d) an action service provider for a type of CDR action.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56au"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56au-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56au-ss-3-logic-descriptionlogic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3420c220a0d04e1556e9ec39b1b6468af4bbd2c86c1b8ccc353fcd58e8bd1fb0",
      "skos:note": "Definition of CDR entity"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56au-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56AU(3) Acts done by or in relation to agents etc. of CDR entities",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 61,
      "values:originalText": "(3) In this section:\nCDR entity means any of the following:\n\n(a) a data holder of CDR data;\n\n(b) an accredited person;\n\n(c) a designated gateway for CDR data;\n\n(d) an action service provider for a type of CDR action.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56au-ss-3-norm",
