    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ba-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56BA(2) Minister may make consumer data rules",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56ba-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.62",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), the consumer data rules may set\nout:\n\n(a) different rules for different designated sectors; or\n\n(b) different rules for different classes of CDR data; or\n\n(c) different rules for different classes of persons specified, as\ndescribed in paragraph 56AC(2)(b), in an instrument\ndesignating a sector under subsection 56AC(2); or\n\n(d) different rules for different classes of persons who are able to\nbe disclosed CDR data under the consumer data rules; or\n\n(e) different rules for different types of CDR actions; or\n\n(f) different rules for different classes of:\n\n(i) action service providers for types of CDR actions; or\n\n(ii) accredited persons; or\n\n(iii) CDR consumers for CDR actions.\n56BAA  Rules must include requirement to delete CDR data on\nrequest from CDR consumer\nRequirement to delete CDR data in response to request from CDR\nconsumer",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), the consumer data rules may set\nout:\n\n(a) different rules for different designated sectors; or\n\n(b) different rules for different classes of CDR data; or\n\n(c) different rules for different classes of persons specified, as\ndescribed in paragraph 56AC(2)(b), in an instrument\ndesignating a sector under subsection 56AC(2); or\n\n(d) different rules for different classes of persons who are able to\nbe disclosed CDR data under the consumer data rules; or\n\n(e) different rules for different types of CDR actions; or\n\n(f) different rules for different classes of:\n\n(i) action service providers for types of CDR actions; or\n\n(ii) accredited persons; or\n\n(iii) CDR consumers for CDR actions.\n56BAA  Rules must include requirement to delete CDR data on\nrequest from CDR consumer\nRequirement to delete CDR data in response to request from CDR\nconsumer",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ba"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ba-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ba-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ba-ss-2-logic-deontic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ba-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ba-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ba-ss-2-logic-ltl-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "59efa4212d5d0e0bd3e4834f0a62e4f7ac06024f98f51f728a658166a3c1f1f7",
      "skos:note": "Consumer data rules must include requirements for deleting CDR data on request from consumer Cannot delete CDR data under certain conditions",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56ba-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56BA(2) Minister may make consumer data rules",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 62,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), the consumer data rules may set\nout:\n\n(a) different rules for different designated sectors; or\n\n(b) different rules for different classes of CDR data; or\n\n(c) different rules for different classes of persons specified, as\ndescribed in paragraph 56AC(2)(b), in an instrument\ndesignating a sector under subsection 56AC(2); or\n\n(d) different rules for different classes of persons who are able to\nbe disclosed CDR data under the consumer data rules; or\n\n(e) different rules for different types of CDR actions; or\n\n(f) different rules for different classes of:\n\n(i) action service providers for types of CDR actions; or\n\n(ii) accredited persons; or\n\n(iii) CDR consumers for CDR actions.\n56BAA  Rules must include requirement to delete CDR data on\nrequest from CDR consumer\nRequirement to delete CDR data in response to request from CDR\nconsumer"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ba-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
