    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ba-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56BA(1) Minister may make consumer data rules",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56ba-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.62",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The consumer data rules must include a requirement on an\naccredited data recipient of CDR data to delete all or part of the\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nConsumer data right  Part IVD\nConsumer data right  Division 2\n\nSection 56BAA\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nCDR data if a CDR consumer for the CDR data validly requests\nthis.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The consumer data rules must include a requirement on an\naccredited data recipient of CDR data to delete all or part of the\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nConsumer data right  Part IVD\nConsumer data right  Division 2\n\nSection 56BAA\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nCDR data if a CDR consumer for the CDR data validly requests\nthis.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ba"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ba-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ba-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ba-ss-1-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "34e66e5591cec82b906c442f3cfe61a3b50835bb34ffa3918075c48cf981c338",
      "skos:note": "Minister must make consumer data rules including deletion of CDR data Minister has obligation to make consumer data rules."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56ba-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56BA(1) Minister may make consumer data rules",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 62,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The consumer data rules must include a requirement on an\naccredited data recipient of CDR data to delete all or part of the\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nConsumer data right  Part IVD\nConsumer data right  Division 2\n\nSection 56BAA\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nCDR data if a CDR consumer for the CDR data validly requests\nthis."
    },
