    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ba-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56BA(2) Minister may make consumer data rules",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56ba-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.62",
      "values:originalText": "(2) However, a rule described in subsection (1) must not require\ndeletion of all or part of the CDR data if:\n\n(a) the accredited data recipient is required to retain the CDR\ndata by or under an Australian law or a court/tribunal order;\nor\n\n(b) the CDR data relates to any current or anticipated:\n\n(i) legal proceedings; or\n\n(ii) dispute resolution proceedings;\n\nto which the accredited data recipient is a party; or\n\n(c) the CDR data relates to any current or anticipated:\n\n(i) legal proceedings; or\n\n(ii) dispute resolution proceedings;\n\nto which the CDR consumer is a party.\nConsumer data rules may include rules in relation to the\nrequirement",
      "skos:definition": "(2) However, a rule described in subsection (1) must not require\ndeletion of all or part of the CDR data if:\n\n(a) the accredited data recipient is required to retain the CDR\ndata by or under an Australian law or a court/tribunal order;\nor\n\n(b) the CDR data relates to any current or anticipated:\n\n(i) legal proceedings; or\n\n(ii) dispute resolution proceedings;\n\nto which the accredited data recipient is a party; or\n\n(c) the CDR data relates to any current or anticipated:\n\n(i) legal proceedings; or\n\n(ii) dispute resolution proceedings;\n\nto which the CDR consumer is a party.\nConsumer data rules may include rules in relation to the\nrequirement",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ba"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ba-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ba-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
