    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56bc-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56BC(2) Rules about disclosure, collection, use, accuracy, storage,",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 65,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Without limiting paragraph 56BB(a), the consumer data rules may\ninclude the following rules:\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56bc-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
