    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56bg-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56BG(3) Rules about designated gateways",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56bg-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.70",
      "values:originalText": "(3) For a designated gateway for CDR data for which there are one or\nmore CDR consumers, the consumer data rules:\n\n(a) can only include rules affecting the designated gateway\nrequiring or authorising the disclosure of the CDR data if\nsuch rules are as described in paragraph (1)(a) or (b); and\n\n(b) can only include rules affecting the designated gateway that\nrelate to the collection, use, accuracy, storage, security or\ndeletion of the CDR data if such rules also relate to a\ndisclosure described in paragraph (a) of this subsection.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) For a designated gateway for CDR data for which there are one or\nmore CDR consumers, the consumer data rules:\n\n(a) can only include rules affecting the designated gateway\nrequiring or authorising the disclosure of the CDR data if\nsuch rules are as described in paragraph (1)(a) or (b); and\n\n(b) can only include rules affecting the designated gateway that\nrelate to the collection, use, accuracy, storage, security or\ndeletion of the CDR data if such rules also relate to a\ndisclosure described in paragraph (a) of this subsection.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56bg"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56bg-ss-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1d65b0103defea453fa25bed6ca2c8724221272f802217a33fbf5192d9c4dd50",
      "skos:note": "Rules about designated gateways can only include rules affecting the designated gateway if they relate to a disclosure described in paragraph (a) of this subsection."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56bg-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56BG(3) Rules about designated gateways",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 70,
      "values:originalText": "(3) For a designated gateway for CDR data for which there are one or\nmore CDR consumers, the consumer data rules:\n\n(a) can only include rules affecting the designated gateway\nrequiring or authorising the disclosure of the CDR data if\nsuch rules are as described in paragraph (1)(a) or (b); and\n\n(b) can only include rules affecting the designated gateway that\nrelate to the collection, use, accuracy, storage, security or\ndeletion of the CDR data if such rules also relate to a\ndisclosure described in paragraph (a) of this subsection.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56bg-ss-3-norm",
