    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56bi",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56BI Rules about reporting, record keeping and auditing",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56bi"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.79",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Without limiting paragraph 56BB(e), the consumer data rules may\ninclude the following rules:\n\n(a) a power for a CDR consumer for CDR data to direct a CDR\nparticipant for the CDR data to give the consumer, or an\naccredited person, reports about:\n\n(i) the consumer’s valid requests to the CDR participant,\nunder rules like those described in\nparagraph 56BC(1)(a) or 56BG(1)(a), for the CDR data;\nand\n\n(ii) any disclosures made in response to such requests;\n\n(b) a power for a CDR consumer for CDR data to direct a CDR\nparticipant for the CDR data to give the consumer, or an\naccredited person, reports about:\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Without limiting paragraph 56BB(e), the consumer data rules may\ninclude the following rules:\n\n(a) a power for a CDR consumer for CDR data to direct a CDR\nparticipant for the CDR data to give the consumer, or an\naccredited person, reports about:\n\n(i) the consumer’s valid requests to the CDR participant,\nunder rules like those described in\nparagraph 56BC(1)(a) or 56BG(1)(a), for the CDR data;\nand\n\n(ii) any disclosures made in response to such requests;\n\n(b) a power for a CDR consumer for CDR data to direct a CDR\nparticipant for the CDR data to give the consumer, or an\naccredited person, reports about:\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56bi-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56bi-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "820c241fdb11e4e0c32ef897d077402b0c1116b842137ab645fe215552fe4529",
      "skos:note": "Power for CDR consumer to direct reports about valid requests and disclosures"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56bi",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56BI Rules about reporting, record keeping and auditing",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 79,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Without limiting paragraph 56BB(e), the consumer data rules may\ninclude the following rules:\n\n(a) a power for a CDR consumer for CDR data to direct a CDR\nparticipant for the CDR data to give the consumer, or an\naccredited person, reports about:\n\n(i) the consumer’s valid requests to the CDR participant,\nunder rules like those described in\nparagraph 56BC(1)(a) or 56BG(1)(a), for the CDR data;\nand\n\n(ii) any disclosures made in response to such requests;\n\n(b) a power for a CDR consumer for CDR data to direct a CDR\nparticipant for the CDR data to give the consumer, or an\naccredited person, reports about:\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56bi-norm",
      "@type": "values:Permission",
