    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56bp",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56BP Minister’s tasks before making the rules",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56bp"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.87",
      "values:originalText": "Before making consumer data rules under subsection 56BA(1), the\nMinister must:\n\n(a) consider the kinds of matters referred to in paragraphs\n56AD(1)(a) and (b) in relation to the making of the rules; and\n\n(aa) consider the following kinds of matters in relation to making\na rule described in subsection 56BGA(2) (about fees at the\ninstruction layer) for a type of CDR action:\n\n(i) whether performers of actions of that type currently\ncharge fees for processing instructions to perform such\nactions;\n\n(ii) whether the incentive to perform actions of that type\nwould be reduced if fees could not be charged for\nprocessing such instructions;\n\n(iii) the marginal cost of processing such instructions in\naccordance with the consumer data rules; and\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "Before making consumer data rules under subsection 56BA(1), the\nMinister must:\n\n(a) consider the kinds of matters referred to in paragraphs\n56AD(1)(a) and (b) in relation to the making of the rules; and\n\n(aa) consider the following kinds of matters in relation to making\na rule described in subsection 56BGA(2) (about fees at the\ninstruction layer) for a type of CDR action:\n\n(i) whether performers of actions of that type currently\ncharge fees for processing instructions to perform such\nactions;\n\n(ii) whether the incentive to perform actions of that type\nwould be reduced if fees could not be charged for\nprocessing such instructions;\n\n(iii) the marginal cost of processing such instructions in\naccordance with the consumer data rules; and\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56bp-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56bp-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56bp-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5b5b2e4bb2b01cf9c483928da3c76d3477a2fa5c637d35fd1aeb9f20b6da124b",
      "skos:note": "Consider certain matters before making consumer data rules."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56bp",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56BP Minister’s tasks before making the rules",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 87,
      "values:originalText": "Before making consumer data rules under subsection 56BA(1), the\nMinister must:\n\n(a) consider the kinds of matters referred to in paragraphs\n56AD(1)(a) and (b) in relation to the making of the rules; and\n\n(aa) consider the following kinds of matters in relation to making\na rule described in subsection 56BGA(2) (about fees at the\ninstruction layer) for a type of CDR action:\n\n(i) whether performers of actions of that type currently\ncharge fees for processing instructions to perform such\nactions;\n\n(ii) whether the incentive to perform actions of that type\nwould be reduced if fees could not be charged for\nprocessing such instructions;\n\n(iii) the marginal cost of processing such instructions in\naccordance with the consumer data rules; and\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56bp-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56bp"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56bp-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation to consider matters",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The Minister must:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56bp-logic-descriptionlogic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:DescriptionLogic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "IS_A",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Consider kinds of matters",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::dl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Paragraphs 56AD(1)(a) and (b)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56bq",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56BQ Secretary must arrange for consultation and report before the",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56bq"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.88",
      "values:originalText": "rules are made\n\nThe Secretary of the Department complies with this section in\nrelation to the making of consumer data rules if the Secretary\narranges for all of the following:\n\n(a) an analysis of the kinds of matters referred to in paragraphs\n56BP(a) and (aa) in relation to the making of the rules;\n\n(b) public consultation about the making of the rules:\n\n(i) for at least 28 days; and\n\n(ii) in one or more ways that includes making information\navailable on the Department’s website and inviting the\npublic to comment;\n\n(c) consultation with each of the following about the making of\nthe rules:\n\n(i) the Commission;\n\n(ii) the Information Commissioner;\n\n(iii) the person or body (if any) that the Secretary believes to\nbe the primary regulator of the sector;\n\n(iv) any person or body prescribed by the regulations;\n\n(d) the preparation of a report for the Minister about that analysis\nand consultation.",
      "skos:definition": "rules are made\n\nThe Secretary of the Department complies with this section in\nrelation to the making of consumer data rules if the Secretary\narranges for all of the following:\n\n(a) an analysis of the kinds of matters referred to in paragraphs\n56BP(a) and (aa) in relation to the making of the rules;\n\n(b) public consultation about the making of the rules:\n\n(i) for at least 28 days; and\n\n(ii) in one or more ways that includes making information\navailable on the Department’s website and inviting the\npublic to comment;\n\n(c) consultation with each of the following about the making of\nthe rules:\n\n(i) the Commission;\n\n(ii) the Information Commissioner;\n\n(iii) the person or body (if any) that the Secretary believes to\nbe the primary regulator of the sector;\n\n(iv) any person or body prescribed by the regulations;\n\n(d) the preparation of a report for the Minister about that analysis\nand consultation.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56bq-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56bq-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56bq-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5b8a766b2d3d4194da4620742c0fea6250845ca4cdf4694e7ef3100080726a52",
      "skos:note": "Secretary must arrange for consultation and report before making rules."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56bq",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56BQ Secretary must arrange for consultation and report before the",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 88,
      "values:originalText": "rules are made\n\nThe Secretary of the Department complies with this section in\nrelation to the making of consumer data rules if the Secretary\narranges for all of the following:\n\n(a) an analysis of the kinds of matters referred to in paragraphs\n56BP(a) and (aa) in relation to the making of the rules;\n\n(b) public consultation about the making of the rules:\n\n(i) for at least 28 days; and\n\n(ii) in one or more ways that includes making information\navailable on the Department’s website and inviting the\npublic to comment;\n\n(c) consultation with each of the following about the making of\nthe rules:\n\n(i) the Commission;\n\n(ii) the Information Commissioner;\n\n(iii) the person or body (if any) that the Secretary believes to\nbe the primary regulator of the sector;\n\n(iv) any person or body prescribed by the regulations;\n\n(d) the preparation of a report for the Minister about that analysis\nand consultation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56bq-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
