      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Subsection 56CA(1)",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Application for review"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ce",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56CE Register of Accredited Persons",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56ce"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.102",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Accreditation Registrar must establish and maintain a register\nfor the purposes of this Part, to be known as the Register of\nAccredited Persons.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nConsumer data right  Part IVD\nAccreditation etc.  Division 3\n\nSection 56CF\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(2) The Accreditation Registrar must maintain the register by\nelectronic means.\n\n(3) The register is not a legislative instrument.\n\n(4) The consumer data rules may make provision for or in relation to\nthe following:\n\n(a) the inclusion in the register of entries for accredited persons;\n\n(b) the correction of entries in the register;\n\n(c) the publication or availability of all or part of the register, or\nof specified information in the register;\n\n(d) any other matter relating to the content, administration or\noperation of the register.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Accreditation Registrar must establish and maintain a register\nfor the purposes of this Part, to be known as the Register of\nAccredited Persons.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nConsumer data right  Part IVD\nAccreditation etc.  Division 3\n\nSection 56CF\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(2) The Accreditation Registrar must maintain the register by\nelectronic means.\n\n(3) The register is not a legislative instrument.\n\n(4) The consumer data rules may make provision for or in relation to\nthe following:\n\n(a) the inclusion in the register of entries for accredited persons;\n\n(b) the correction of entries in the register;\n\n(c) the publication or availability of all or part of the register, or\nof specified information in the register;\n\n(d) any other matter relating to the content, administration or\noperation of the register.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ce-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ce-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ce-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ce-ss-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "877506a573c08742f99c7553810337b654d070e3c6d5093cea51e3493c9efbe2"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56ce",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56CE Register of Accredited Persons",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 102,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Accreditation Registrar must establish and maintain a register\nfor the purposes of this Part, to be known as the Register of\nAccredited Persons.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nConsumer data right  Part IVD\nAccreditation etc.  Division 3\n\nSection 56CF\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(2) The Accreditation Registrar must maintain the register by\nelectronic means.\n\n(3) The register is not a legislative instrument.\n\n(4) The consumer data rules may make provision for or in relation to\nthe following:\n\n(a) the inclusion in the register of entries for accredited persons;\n\n(b) the correction of entries in the register;\n\n(c) the publication or availability of all or part of the register, or\nof specified information in the register;\n\n(d) any other matter relating to the content, administration or\noperation of the register."
    },
