    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ce-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56CE(4) Register of Accredited Persons",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56ce-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.102",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The consumer data rules may make provision for or in relation to\nthe following:\n\n(a) the inclusion in the register of entries for accredited persons;\n\n(b) the correction of entries in the register;\n\n(c) the publication or availability of all or part of the register, or\nof specified information in the register;\n\n(d) any other matter relating to the content, administration or\noperation of the register.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The consumer data rules may make provision for or in relation to\nthe following:\n\n(a) the inclusion in the register of entries for accredited persons;\n\n(b) the correction of entries in the register;\n\n(c) the publication or availability of all or part of the register, or\nof specified information in the register;\n\n(d) any other matter relating to the content, administration or\noperation of the register.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ce"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ce-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ce-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1ef40fd35255254aafe25e886be68b459d07e737720bfaf9725f8a9b751d09d4",
      "skos:note": "The consumer data rules may make provision for or in relation to the inclusion of entries for accredited persons."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56ce-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56CE(4) Register of Accredited Persons",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 102,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The consumer data rules may make provision for or in relation to\nthe following:\n\n(a) the inclusion in the register of entries for accredited persons;\n\n(b) the correction of entries in the register;\n\n(c) the publication or availability of all or part of the register, or\nof specified information in the register;\n\n(d) any other matter relating to the content, administration or\noperation of the register."
    },
