      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) To avoid doubt, for a person who is the Accreditation Registrar",
      "cml:conclusionText": "both: (a) the person’s functions and powers in their capacity other than as the Accreditation Registrar; and (b) if the person is not a body corporate—the functions that may be performed, and the powers that may be exercised by anyone appointed under a Commonwealth law to act as the person in that primary capacity"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56cl-ss-3-logic-ltl-3",
