      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.107",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Accreditation Registrar may delegate any or all of the\nAccreditation Registrar’s functions or powers to:\n\n(a) an SES employee, or an acting SES employee, in the\nDepartment, in the Commission or in the Commonwealth\nentity appointed under paragraph 56CK(1)(b) (if any); or\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Accreditation Registrar may delegate any or all of the\nAccreditation Registrar’s functions or powers to:\n\n(a) an SES employee, or an acting SES employee, in the\nDepartment, in the Commission or in the Commonwealth\nentity appointed under paragraph 56CK(1)(b) (if any); or\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "cml:asserts": [
