        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "762960fb9ab18bb0f6c37cf1ea57eec9889e9817991ccc5bc825b5898da4f00b",
      "skos:note": "Delegation of Accreditation Registrar's functions or powers"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56cn",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56CN Delegation",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 107,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Accreditation Registrar may delegate any or all of the\nAccreditation Registrar’s functions or powers to:\n\n(a) an SES employee, or an acting SES employee, in the\nDepartment, in the Commission or in the Commonwealth\nentity appointed under paragraph 56CK(1)(b) (if any); or\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc."
    },
    {
