      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.112",
      "values:originalText": "(5) Apart from paragraphs (4)(aa) to (d), this Division does not affect\nhow the Australian Privacy Principles apply to:\n\n(aa) an accredited person who does not become an accredited data\nrecipient of the CDR data; or\n\n(a) a data holder of CDR data in relation to the CDR data; or\n\n(b) a designated gateway for CDR data in relation to the CDR\ndata; or\n\n(c) a person as an action service provider, for a type of CDR\naction, in relation to CDR data.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) Apart from paragraphs (4)(aa) to (d), this Division does not affect\nhow the Australian Privacy Principles apply to:\n\n(aa) an accredited person who does not become an accredited data\nrecipient of the CDR data; or\n\n(a) a data holder of CDR data in relation to the CDR data; or\n\n(b) a designated gateway for CDR data in relation to the CDR\ndata; or\n\n(c) a person as an action service provider, for a type of CDR\naction, in relation to CDR data.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "values:partOf": {
