    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ed-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56ED(3) Privacy safeguard 1—open and transparent management of",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56ed-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.114",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The CDR entity must have and maintain a clearly expressed and\nup-to-date policy that:\n\n(a) is about the CDR entity’s management of CDR data; and\n\n(b) is in a form approved in accordance with the consumer data\nrules; and\n\n(c) contains the information required by subsections (4), (5), (6)\nand (6A) (as applicable).\nNote:\nThis subsection is a civil penalty provision (see section 56EU).",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The CDR entity must have and maintain a clearly expressed and\nup-to-date policy that:\n\n(a) is about the CDR entity’s management of CDR data; and\n\n(b) is in a form approved in accordance with the consumer data\nrules; and\n\n(c) contains the information required by subsections (4), (5), (6)\nand (6A) (as applicable).\nNote:\nThis subsection is a civil penalty provision (see section 56EU).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ed"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ed-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ed-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ed-ss-3-logic-deontic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ed-ss-3-logic-deontic-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8bb8ae631ef6fc1dda87a716d5918bad6c1b857f669014b0b2154ec804839cde",
      "skos:note": "Must have and maintain a clearly expressed policy on CDR data management",
      "dc:description": "(a) is about the CDR entity’s management of CDR data; (b) is in a form approved in accordance with the consumer data rules; (c) contains the information required by subsections (4), (5), (6) and (6A)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56ed-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56ED(3) Privacy safeguard 1—open and transparent management of",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 114,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The CDR entity must have and maintain a clearly expressed and\nup-to-date policy that:\n\n(a) is about the CDR entity’s management of CDR data; and\n\n(b) is in a form approved in accordance with the consumer data\nrules; and\n\n(c) contains the information required by subsections (4), (5), (6)\nand (6A) (as applicable).\nNote:\nThis subsection is a civil penalty provision (see section 56EU)."
    },
