    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ed-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56ED(4) Privacy safeguard 1—open and transparent management of",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56ed-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.114",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the CDR entity is a data holder of any CDR data, the CDR\nentity’s policy must contain the following information:\n\n(a) how a CDR consumer for the CDR data may access the CDR\ndata and seek the correction of the CDR data;\n\n(b) how a CDR consumer for the CDR data may complain about\na failure of the CDR entity to comply with this Part or the\nconsumer data rules, and how the CDR entity will deal with\nsuch a complaint.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If the CDR entity is a data holder of any CDR data, the CDR\nentity’s policy must contain the following information:\n\n(a) how a CDR consumer for the CDR data may access the CDR\ndata and seek the correction of the CDR data;\n\n(b) how a CDR consumer for the CDR data may complain about\na failure of the CDR entity to comply with this Part or the\nconsumer data rules, and how the CDR entity will deal with\nsuch a complaint.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ed"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ed-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ed-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8ea88a1acfcc181e0528a698887e5decea1943b6ed14177cc6107f61d822e07f",
      "skos:note": "Mandatory disclosure of CDR data access and complaint procedures",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56ed-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56ED(4) Privacy safeguard 1—open and transparent management of",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 114,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the CDR entity is a data holder of any CDR data, the CDR\nentity’s policy must contain the following information:\n\n(a) how a CDR consumer for the CDR data may access the CDR\ndata and seek the correction of the CDR data;\n\n(b) how a CDR consumer for the CDR data may complain about\na failure of the CDR entity to comply with this Part or the\nconsumer data rules, and how the CDR entity will deal with\nsuch a complaint."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ed-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ed-ss-4"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
