    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ef-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56EF(2) Privacy safeguard 3—soliciting CDR data from participants",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56ef-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.118",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Subsection (1) applies whether the collection is directly or\nindirectly from the person covered by column 2 of the table.\nNote:\nThe collection (whether direct or indirect) would need to be under the\nconsumer data rules for subsection (1) to apply.\nExample: The valid request referred to in column 3 of item 1 of the table could\nbe given under the consumer data rules through a designated gateway\n(see section 56BG).",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Subsection (1) applies whether the collection is directly or\nindirectly from the person covered by column 2 of the table.\nNote:\nThe collection (whether direct or indirect) would need to be under the\nconsumer data rules for subsection (1) to apply.\nExample: The valid request referred to in column 3 of item 1 of the table could\nbe given under the consumer data rules through a designated gateway\n(see section 56BG).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ef"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ef-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ef-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ef-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "af52fe97e18083791542e01c6eaeb38cc35900ab76269701a764c27e1636bde5",
      "skos:note": "Collection of CDR data from participants must comply with consumer data rules."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56ef-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56EF(2) Privacy safeguard 3—soliciting CDR data from participants",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 118,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Subsection (1) applies whether the collection is directly or\nindirectly from the person covered by column 2 of the table.\nNote:\nThe collection (whether direct or indirect) would need to be under the\nconsumer data rules for subsection (1) to apply.\nExample: The valid request referred to in column 3 of item 1 of the table could\nbe given under the consumer data rules through a designated gateway\n(see section 56BG)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ef-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
