      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ep-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ep-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ep-ss-1-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e251116546ae166e0bf65b016e84f1d7c871ab95efa3168346c7dfcc270a79c8",
      "skos:note": "The Information Commissioner has certain functions related to privacy safeguards. CDR entity must respond to request to correct CDR data"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56ep-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56EP(1) Privacy safeguard 13—correction of CDR data",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 130,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Information Commissioner has the following functions:\n\n(a) making guidelines for the avoidance of acts or practices that\nmay breach the privacy safeguards;\n\n(b) promoting an understanding and acceptance of the privacy\nsafeguards;\n\n(c) undertaking educational programs for the purposes of\npromoting the protection of CDR data.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ep-ss-1-norm",
