      "cml:integrityHash": "a27f271ddb62a95a013464b8412f086778f4848e3225d52df4c99c549f4c6d1e",
      "skos:note": "Each privacy safeguard penalty provision is enforceable under Part 4 of the Regulatory Powers Act."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56eu-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56EU(2) Civil penalty provisions",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 139,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Each privacy safeguard penalty provision is enforceable under\nPart 4 of the Regulatory Powers Act.\nNote:\nPart 4 of the Regulatory Powers Act allows a civil penalty provision to\nbe enforced by obtaining an order for a person to pay a pecuniary\npenalty for the contravention of the provision.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc."
    },
