      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.141",
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of subsection (1), the maximum penalty amount\nfor a contravention by a person other than a body corporate of a\nprivacy safeguard penalty provision is $500,000.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) For the purposes of subsection (1), the maximum penalty amount\nfor a contravention by a person other than a body corporate of a\nprivacy safeguard penalty provision is $500,000.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
