      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of Part 6 of the Regulatory Powers Act, each of\nthe following courts is a relevant court in relation to each provision\nreferred to in subsection (1):\n\n(a) the Federal Court;\n\n(b) the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia\n(Division 2);\n\n(c) a court of a State or Territory that has jurisdiction in relation\nto the matter.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) For the purposes of Part 6 of the Regulatory Powers Act, each of\nthe following courts is a relevant court in relation to each provision\nreferred to in subsection (1):\n\n(a) the Federal Court;\n\n(b) the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia\n(Division 2);\n\n(c) a court of a State or Territory that has jurisdiction in relation\nto the matter.",
