    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fa-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56FA(2) Making data standards",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56fa-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.147",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Data Standards Chair must comply with the consumer data\nrules when:\n\n(a) making a data standard; or\n\n(b) varying or revoking a data standard;\nincluding complying with any related requirements specified in\nthose rules about approval, consultation and the formation of\ncommittees, advisory panels and consultative groups.\nNote:\nThe rules could, for example, require a proposed data standard to be\napproved by the Commission before it is made.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Data Standards Chair must comply with the consumer data\nrules when:\n\n(a) making a data standard; or\n\n(b) varying or revoking a data standard;\nincluding complying with any related requirements specified in\nthose rules about approval, consultation and the formation of\ncommittees, advisory panels and consultative groups.\nNote:\nThe rules could, for example, require a proposed data standard to be\napproved by the Commission before it is made.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
