        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "A contract is taken to be in force between:\n\n(a) a data holder of CDR data to which a binding data standard applies;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(d) agrees to engage in conduct that the person is required by the standard to engage in."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fd-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56FD(2) Legal effect of data standards",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56fd-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.149",
      "values:originalText": "(2) If there is a designated gateway for CDR data to which a binding\ndata standard applies, a contract is taken to be in force between:\n\n(a) a data holder of the CDR data; and\n\n(b) the designated gateway for the CDR data; and\n\n(c) each accredited person;\nunder which each of those persons:\n\n(d) agrees to observe the standard to the extent that the standard\napplies to the person; and\n\n(e) agrees to engage in conduct that the person is required by the\nstandard to engage in.\nNote:\nThis means the data holder will be taken to have a separate 3-party\ncontract with the designated gateway and each accredited person.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) If there is a designated gateway for CDR data to which a binding\ndata standard applies, a contract is taken to be in force between:\n\n(a) a data holder of the CDR data; and\n\n(b) the designated gateway for the CDR data; and\n\n(c) each accredited person;\nunder which each of those persons:\n\n(d) agrees to observe the standard to the extent that the standard\napplies to the person; and\n\n(e) agrees to engage in conduct that the person is required by the\nstandard to engage in.\nNote:\nThis means the data holder will be taken to have a separate 3-party\ncontract with the designated gateway and each accredited person.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fd"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fd-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fd-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
