      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.150",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If a person who is under an obligation to comply with a binding\ndata standard fails to meet that obligation, an application to the\nCourt may be made by:\n\n(a) the Commission; or\n\n(b) a person aggrieved by the failure.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If a person who is under an obligation to comply with a binding\ndata standard fails to meet that obligation, an application to the\nCourt may be made by:\n\n(a) the Commission; or\n\n(b) a person aggrieved by the failure.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fe"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fe-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fe-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "29fb020e7b082813c4c09c01e14ee57c99984145a4638dedb1e1019742c3ea24",
      "skos:note": "Failure to comply with binding data standard obligation"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56fe-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56FE(1) Enforcement of binding data standards",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 150,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If a person who is under an obligation to comply with a binding\ndata standard fails to meet that obligation, an application to the\nCourt may be made by:\n\n(a) the Commission; or\n\n(b) a person aggrieved by the failure."
    },
