    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fe-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56FE(3) Enforcement of binding data standards",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56fe-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.150",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Without limiting subsection (1), an obligation to comply with a\nbinding data standard includes an obligation arising under a\ncontract referred to in section 56FD.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nConsumer data right  Part IVD\nData standards etc.  Division 6\n\nSection 56FF\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nSubdivision B—Data Standards Chair",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Without limiting subsection (1), an obligation to comply with a\nbinding data standard includes an obligation arising under a\ncontract referred to in section 56FD.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nConsumer data right  Part IVD\nData standards etc.  Division 6\n\nSection 56FF\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nSubdivision B—Data Standards Chair",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fe"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fe-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fe-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fe-ss-3-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b74078b08f620c74f1c3c780ebecd17dbdcccc70e62bb55a9d8e47e10c5b7752",
      "skos:note": "An obligation to comply with a binding data standard includes an obligation arising under a contract."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56fe-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56FE(3) Enforcement of binding data standards",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 150,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Without limiting subsection (1), an obligation to comply with a\nbinding data standard includes an obligation arising under a\ncontract referred to in section 56FD.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nConsumer data right  Part IVD\nData standards etc.  Division 6\n\nSection 56FF\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nSubdivision B—Data Standards Chair"
    },
