        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.151",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Data Standards Chair holds office for the period specified in\nthe instrument of appointment. The period must not exceed 3 years.\nNote 1:\nThe Minister will be the Data Standards Chair in the absence of an\nappointment under this section (see the definition of Data Standards\nChair in subsection 4(1)).\nNote 2:\nThe Data Standards Chair may be reappointed (see section 33AA of\nthe Acts Interpretation Act 1901).",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Data Standards Chair holds office for the period specified in\nthe instrument of appointment. The period must not exceed 3 years.\nNote 1:\nThe Minister will be the Data Standards Chair in the absence of an\nappointment under this section (see the definition of Data Standards\nChair in subsection 4(1)).\nNote 2:\nThe Data Standards Chair may be reappointed (see section 33AA of\nthe Acts Interpretation Act 1901).",
