    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fh",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56FH Functions and powers of the Data Standards Chair",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56fh"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.151",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The functions of the Data Standards Chair are:\n\n(a) to make standards under Subdivision A; and\n\n(b) to review those standards regularly; and\n\n(c) such other functions as are prescribed by the regulations.\n\n(2) The Data Standards Chair has the following powers:\n\n(a) the power to establish committees, advisory panels and\nconsultative groups;\n\n(b) the power to do all other things necessary or convenient to be\ndone for or in connection with the performance of the Chair’s\nfunctions.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The functions of the Data Standards Chair are:\n\n(a) to make standards under Subdivision A; and\n\n(b) to review those standards regularly; and\n\n(c) such other functions as are prescribed by the regulations.\n\n(2) The Data Standards Chair has the following powers:\n\n(a) the power to establish committees, advisory panels and\nconsultative groups;\n\n(b) the power to do all other things necessary or convenient to be\ndone for or in connection with the performance of the Chair’s\nfunctions.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fh-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fh-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "df4f5b53344b9408ac052d9367956cecd938671e3e904b3b3d0e266a052f2550"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56fh",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56FH Functions and powers of the Data Standards Chair",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 151,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The functions of the Data Standards Chair are:\n\n(a) to make standards under Subdivision A; and\n\n(b) to review those standards regularly; and\n\n(c) such other functions as are prescribed by the regulations.\n\n(2) The Data Standards Chair has the following powers:\n\n(a) the power to establish committees, advisory panels and\nconsultative groups;\n\n(b) the power to do all other things necessary or convenient to be\ndone for or in connection with the performance of the Chair’s\nfunctions."
    },
