      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.151",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, give written directions\nto the Data Standards Chair about the performance of the Chair’s\nfunctions and the exercise of the Chair’s powers.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, give written directions\nto the Data Standards Chair about the performance of the Chair’s\nfunctions and the exercise of the Chair’s powers.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
