      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.154",
      "values:originalText": "(2) If the Data Standards Chair is appointed on a full-time basis, the\nMinister may grant the Data Standards Chair leave of absence,\nother than recreation leave, on the terms and conditions as to\nremuneration or otherwise that the Minister determines.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) If the Data Standards Chair is appointed on a full-time basis, the\nMinister may grant the Data Standards Chair leave of absence,\nother than recreation leave, on the terms and conditions as to\nremuneration or otherwise that the Minister determines.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fo"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fo-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fo-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "47b8e5d3980fef971820955057e11b7c27ab9f9b7150117740be5fcd917279c9",
      "skos:note": "Must include information about performance and exercise of Data Standards Chair's functions in annual report. Minister may grant Data Standards Chair leave of absence",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
