      "values:originalText": "(2) The Secretary of the Department, when preparing the Department’s\nannual report under section 46 of the Public Governance,\nPerformance and Accountability Act 2013 for a period, must\ninclude information in that report about:\n\n(a) the performance of the Data Standards Chair’s functions; and\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nConsumer data right  Part IVD\nData standards etc.  Division 6\n\nSection 56FQ\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(b) the exercise of the Data Standards Chair’s powers;\nduring the period.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Secretary of the Department, when preparing the Department’s\nannual report under section 46 of the Public Governance,\nPerformance and Accountability Act 2013 for a period, must\ninclude information in that report about:\n\n(a) the performance of the Data Standards Chair’s functions; and\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nConsumer data right  Part IVD\nData standards etc.  Division 6\n\nSection 56FQ\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(b) the exercise of the Data Standards Chair’s powers;\nduring the period.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fo"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fo-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fo-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d1a8d09ae0c86865df0aaa26251c4cdea5b22cfc6726d1972fca4e9a79fa2043",
      "skos:note": "Must include information about performance and exercise of Data Standards Chair's functions in annual report. Minister may grant Data Standards Chair leave of absence",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56fo-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56FO(2) Leave",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 154,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Secretary of the Department, when preparing the Department’s\nannual report under section 46 of the Public Governance,\nPerformance and Accountability Act 2013 for a period, must\ninclude information in that report about:\n\n(a) the performance of the Data Standards Chair’s functions; and\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nConsumer data right  Part IVD\nData standards etc.  Division 6\n\nSection 56FQ\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(b) the exercise of the Data Standards Chair’s powers;\nduring the period."
    },
