    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fo-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56FO(3) Leave",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56fo-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.154",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If at any time the Data Standards Chair is the Minister then:\n\n(a) subsections (1) and (2) do not apply; and\n\n(b) the Department’s annual report under section 46 of that Act\nfor the period that includes that time must include\ninformation about the performance of the Data Standards\nChair’s functions, and the exercise of the Data Standards\nChair’s powers, at that time.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If at any time the Data Standards Chair is the Minister then:\n\n(a) subsections (1) and (2) do not apply; and\n\n(b) the Department’s annual report under section 46 of that Act\nfor the period that includes that time must include\ninformation about the performance of the Data Standards\nChair’s functions, and the exercise of the Data Standards\nChair’s powers, at that time.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fo"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fo-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fo-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fo-ss-3-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fo-ss-3-logic-deontic-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "688c3de202c6d22a7caa47579f4ecd5cf7c85b6fe34c8d926ad0a6515730603a",
      "skos:note": "Annual report must include information about the Data Standards Chair's functions and powers. Secretary may grant leave of absence to Data Standards Chair on terms and conditions determined by Secretary.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56fo-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56FO(3) Leave",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 154,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If at any time the Data Standards Chair is the Minister then:\n\n(a) subsections (1) and (2) do not apply; and\n\n(b) the Department’s annual report under section 46 of that Act\nfor the period that includes that time must include\ninformation about the performance of the Data Standards\nChair’s functions, and the exercise of the Data Standards\nChair’s powers, at that time."
    },
