      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.155",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Data Standards Chair may resign the Data Standards Chair’s\nappointment by giving the Minister a written resignation.\n\n(2) The resignation takes effect on the day it is received by the\nMinister or, if a later day is specified in the resignation, on that\nlater day.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Data Standards Chair may resign the Data Standards Chair’s\nappointment by giving the Minister a written resignation.\n\n(2) The resignation takes effect on the day it is received by the\nMinister or, if a later day is specified in the resignation, on that\nlater day.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fq-ss-1"
        },
