    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fr",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56FR Termination of appointment",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56fr"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.155",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister may terminate the appointment of the Data Standards\nChair:\n\n(a) for misbehaviour; or\n\n(b) if the Data Standards Chair is unable to perform the duties of\nthe Data Standards Chair’s office because of physical or\nmental incapacity.\n\n(2) The Minister may terminate the appointment of the Data Standards\nChair if:\n\n(a) the Data Standards Chair:\n\n(i) becomes bankrupt; or\n\n(ii) applies to take the benefit of any law for the relief of\nbankrupt or insolvent debtors; or\n\n(iii) compounds with the Data Standards Chair’s creditors;\nor\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Minister may terminate the appointment of the Data Standards\nChair:\n\n(a) for misbehaviour; or\n\n(b) if the Data Standards Chair is unable to perform the duties of\nthe Data Standards Chair’s office because of physical or\nmental incapacity.\n\n(2) The Minister may terminate the appointment of the Data Standards\nChair if:\n\n(a) the Data Standards Chair:\n\n(i) becomes bankrupt; or\n\n(ii) applies to take the benefit of any law for the relief of\nbankrupt or insolvent debtors; or\n\n(iii) compounds with the Data Standards Chair’s creditors;\nor\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fr-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56fr-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e1052a2dc9b94621cf2ebe9eb980c56492ffa4d925b33f3cc7b774c1b2565098"
    },
    {
