      "values:originalText": "(2) The Minister may terminate the appointment of the Data Standards\nChair if:\n\n(a) the Data Standards Chair:\n\n(i) becomes bankrupt; or\n\n(ii) applies to take the benefit of any law for the relief of\nbankrupt or insolvent debtors; or\n\n(iii) compounds with the Data Standards Chair’s creditors;\nor\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc."
    },
