    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ga-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56GA(2) CDR functions of the Information Commissioner",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56ga-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.158",
      "values:originalText": "(2) In performing a delegated function or exercising a delegated\npower, the delegate must comply with any written directions of the\nSecretary.\n56GAB  Concurrent operation of other laws\n\nThe CDR provisions are not intended to exclude or limit the\noperation of a law of the Commonwealth, or of a State or Territory,\nthat is capable of operating concurrently with the CDR provisions.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) In performing a delegated function or exercising a delegated\npower, the delegate must comply with any written directions of the\nSecretary.\n56GAB  Concurrent operation of other laws\n\nThe CDR provisions are not intended to exclude or limit the\noperation of a law of the Commonwealth, or of a State or Territory,\nthat is capable of operating concurrently with the CDR provisions.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ga"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ga-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ga-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56ga-ss-2-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6240c4641fe8d0531168aeac7e12efcd6aedb6ad93a589c05175c17bab1ed120",
      "skos:note": "Request or initiative for performing functions Delegate must comply with written directions of the Secretary."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56ga-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56GA(2) CDR functions of the Information Commissioner",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 158,
      "values:originalText": "(2) In performing a delegated function or exercising a delegated\npower, the delegate must comply with any written directions of the\nSecretary.\n56GAB  Concurrent operation of other laws\n\nThe CDR provisions are not intended to exclude or limit the\noperation of a law of the Commonwealth, or of a State or Territory,\nthat is capable of operating concurrently with the CDR provisions."
    },
