    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56gb",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56GB Referring to instruments as in force from time to time",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56gb"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.159",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies to the following instruments:\n\n(a) designations under section 56AC (about designated sectors);\n\n(aa) CDR declarations for types of CDR actions;\n\n(b) regulations made for the purposes of a provision of this Part;\n\n(c) the consumer data rules;\n\n(d) data standards.\n\n(2) An instrument to which this section applies may make provision in\nrelation to a matter by applying, adopting or incorporating (with or\nwithout modification) any matter contained in any other instrument\nor writing:\n\n(a) as in force or existing at a particular time; or\n\n(b) as in force or existing from time to time.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies to the following instruments:\n\n(a) designations under section 56AC (about designated sectors);\n\n(aa) CDR declarations for types of CDR actions;\n\n(b) regulations made for the purposes of a provision of this Part;\n\n(c) the consumer data rules;\n\n(d) data standards.\n\n(2) An instrument to which this section applies may make provision in\nrelation to a matter by applying, adopting or incorporating (with or\nwithout modification) any matter contained in any other instrument\nor writing:\n\n(a) as in force or existing at a particular time; or\n\n(b) as in force or existing from time to time.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56gb-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56gb-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c02cbfd3718be90b7571f2c792319c273948fa8324902bac53b70db5d7f74349"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56gb",
