      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.159",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies to the following instruments:\n\n(a) designations under section 56AC (about designated sectors);\n\n(aa) CDR declarations for types of CDR actions;\n\n(b) regulations made for the purposes of a provision of this Part;\n\n(c) the consumer data rules;\n\n(d) data standards.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies to the following instruments:\n\n(a) designations under section 56AC (about designated sectors);\n\n(aa) CDR declarations for types of CDR actions;\n\n(b) regulations made for the purposes of a provision of this Part;\n\n(c) the consumer data rules;\n\n(d) data standards.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56gb"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56gb-ss-1-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ad74b4958dcbc2c802e3531275134dd7289afd455433ce255d2e02ffa0bec8cc",
      "skos:note": "List of instruments subject to this section"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56gb-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56GB(1) Referring to instruments as in force from time to time",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 159,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies to the following instruments:\n\n(a) designations under section 56AC (about designated sectors);\n\n(aa) CDR declarations for types of CDR actions;\n\n(b) regulations made for the purposes of a provision of this Part;\n\n(c) the consumer data rules;\n\n(d) data standards."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56gb-ss-1-norm",
