    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56gb-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56GB(2) Referring to instruments as in force from time to time",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56gb-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.159",
      "values:originalText": "(2) An instrument to which this section applies may make provision in\nrelation to a matter by applying, adopting or incorporating (with or\nwithout modification) any matter contained in any other instrument\nor writing:\n\n(a) as in force or existing at a particular time; or\n\n(b) as in force or existing from time to time.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) An instrument to which this section applies may make provision in\nrelation to a matter by applying, adopting or incorporating (with or\nwithout modification) any matter contained in any other instrument\nor writing:\n\n(a) as in force or existing at a particular time; or\n\n(b) as in force or existing from time to time.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56gb"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56gb-ss-2-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a0954f7f661eac6f8647279e9fc3b9a60cb92e7eaaab6837334263638a4a71b1",
      "skos:note": "Allows instruments to incorporate or adopt provisions from other instruments or writings."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56gb-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56GB(2) Referring to instruments as in force from time to time",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 159,
      "values:originalText": "(2) An instrument to which this section applies may make provision in\nrelation to a matter by applying, adopting or incorporating (with or\nwithout modification) any matter contained in any other instrument\nor writing:\n\n(a) as in force or existing at a particular time; or\n\n(b) as in force or existing from time to time.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56gb-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56gb-ss-2"
