      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-57bf",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "57BF Meaning of safety and security information",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-57bf"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.170",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Safety and security information, for a scheme vehicle, is either or\nboth of the following:\n\n(a) safety information;\n\n(b) security information.\nNote:\nRestrictions apply in relation to the supply of scheme information that\nis safety and security information: see section 57DB.\n\n(2) Safety information, for a scheme vehicle, is information relating to\nany of the following systems installed in the vehicle, of a kind\nprescribed by the scheme rules:\n\n(a) the hydrogen system;\n\n(b) the high voltage system;\n\n(c) the hybrid system;\n\n(d) the electric propulsion system;\n\n(e) another system prescribed by the scheme rules for the\npurposes of this paragraph.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nMotor vehicle service and repair information sharing scheme  Part IVE\nKey concepts  Division 2\n\nSection 57BG\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(3) Security information, for a scheme vehicle, is information relating\nto any of the following systems installed in the vehicle, of a kind\nprescribed by the scheme rules:\n\n(a) the vehicle’s mechanical and electrical security system;\n\n(b) another system prescribed by the scheme rules for the\npurposes of this paragraph.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Safety and security information, for a scheme vehicle, is either or\nboth of the following:\n\n(a) safety information;\n\n(b) security information.\nNote:\nRestrictions apply in relation to the supply of scheme information that\nis safety and security information: see section 57DB.\n\n(2) Safety information, for a scheme vehicle, is information relating to\nany of the following systems installed in the vehicle, of a kind\nprescribed by the scheme rules:\n\n(a) the hydrogen system;\n\n(b) the high voltage system;\n\n(c) the hybrid system;\n\n(d) the electric propulsion system;\n\n(e) another system prescribed by the scheme rules for the\npurposes of this paragraph.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nMotor vehicle service and repair information sharing scheme  Part IVE\nKey concepts  Division 2\n\nSection 57BG\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(3) Security information, for a scheme vehicle, is information relating\nto any of the following systems installed in the vehicle, of a kind\nprescribed by the scheme rules:\n\n(a) the vehicle’s mechanical and electrical security system;\n\n(b) another system prescribed by the scheme rules for the\npurposes of this paragraph.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-57bf-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-57bf-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-57bf-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "25ee120760e55bddbedcc75a0a34dfd494e3bdc04247440cc7ab7a499b98cdd3"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-57bf",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "57BF Meaning of safety and security information",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 170,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Safety and security information, for a scheme vehicle, is either or\nboth of the following:\n\n(a) safety information;\n\n(b) security information.\nNote:\nRestrictions apply in relation to the supply of scheme information that\nis safety and security information: see section 57DB.\n\n(2) Safety information, for a scheme vehicle, is information relating to\nany of the following systems installed in the vehicle, of a kind\nprescribed by the scheme rules:\n\n(a) the hydrogen system;\n\n(b) the high voltage system;\n\n(c) the hybrid system;\n\n(d) the electric propulsion system;\n\n(e) another system prescribed by the scheme rules for the\npurposes of this paragraph.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nMotor vehicle service and repair information sharing scheme  Part IVE\nKey concepts  Division 2\n\nSection 57BG\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(3) Security information, for a scheme vehicle, is information relating\nto any of the following systems installed in the vehicle, of a kind\nprescribed by the scheme rules:\n\n(a) the vehicle’s mechanical and electrical security system;\n\n(b) another system prescribed by the scheme rules for the\npurposes of this paragraph."
    },
