      "skos:definition": "(3) Security information, for a scheme vehicle, is information relating\nto any of the following systems installed in the vehicle, of a kind\nprescribed by the scheme rules:\n\n(a) the vehicle’s mechanical and electrical security system;\n\n(b) another system prescribed by the scheme rules for the\npurposes of this paragraph.",
