    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-57bg",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "57BG Supply of scheme information between related bodies",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-57bg"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.171",
      "values:originalText": "corporate\n\nTo avoid doubt, this Part applies in relation to a supply of scheme\ninformation about a scheme vehicle from a data provider to an\nAustralian repairer even if the data provider and the Australian\nrepairer are related bodies corporate.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "corporate\n\nTo avoid doubt, this Part applies in relation to a supply of scheme\ninformation about a scheme vehicle from a data provider to an\nAustralian repairer even if the data provider and the Australian\nrepairer are related bodies corporate.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-57bg-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-57bg-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "db12644cf408650af8c2a3204d1eb44812eb20ebf14d8ce18f11e4920b74314d",
      "skos:note": "Supply of scheme information between related bodies"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-57bg",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "57BG Supply of scheme information between related bodies",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 171,
      "values:originalText": "corporate\n\nTo avoid doubt, this Part applies in relation to a supply of scheme\ninformation about a scheme vehicle from a data provider to an\nAustralian repairer even if the data provider and the Australian\nrepairer are related bodies corporate.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-57bg-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-57bg"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
