    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-57ca-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "57CA(4) Scheme information—offer to supply to Australian repairers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-57ca-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.172",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The data provider must make a scheme offer for the supply of the\nscheme information in relation to a particular make, model or year\nof scheme vehicle at a price (the scheme price) that does not\nexceed the fair market value of the information, as determined by\nreference to matters including those covered by subsection (5).\nNote:\nA pecuniary penalty of up to $10,000,000 may be imposed for a\ncontravention of this subsection: see section 76.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The data provider must make a scheme offer for the supply of the\nscheme information in relation to a particular make, model or year\nof scheme vehicle at a price (the scheme price) that does not\nexceed the fair market value of the information, as determined by\nreference to matters including those covered by subsection (5).\nNote:\nA pecuniary penalty of up to $10,000,000 may be imposed for a\ncontravention of this subsection: see section 76.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-57ca"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-57ca-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-57ca-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e61a2a73dcfe3f7773da27f2b1d8e9448ccf82240c8b390ade0f932b4a136794",
      "skos:note": "Must provide scheme information at a fair market value price",
      "dc:description": "true"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-57ca-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "57CA(4) Scheme information—offer to supply to Australian repairers",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 172,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The data provider must make a scheme offer for the supply of the\nscheme information in relation to a particular make, model or year\nof scheme vehicle at a price (the scheme price) that does not\nexceed the fair market value of the information, as determined by\nreference to matters including those covered by subsection (5).\nNote:\nA pecuniary penalty of up to $10,000,000 may be imposed for a\ncontravention of this subsection: see section 76."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-57ca-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
