      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.178",
      "values:originalText": "(4) An amount payable by the data provider under subsection (3):\n\n(a) is a debt due by the data provider to the third party claimant;\nand\n\n(b) may be recovered by action in a court of competent\njurisdiction.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) An amount payable by the data provider under subsection (3):\n\n(a) is a debt due by the data provider to the third party claimant;\nand\n\n(b) may be recovered by action in a court of competent\njurisdiction.",
