      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.181",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The requirements covered by this subsection are that:\n\n(a) the safety and security information is solely for use by an\nindividual or individuals:\n\n(i) in the case of an Australian repairer—for the purposes\nof the Australian repairer’s business; or\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The requirements covered by this subsection are that:\n\n(a) the safety and security information is solely for use by an\nindividual or individuals:\n\n(i) in the case of an Australian repairer—for the purposes\nof the Australian repairer’s business; or\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
