    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-57dc",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "57DC Safety and security information—use or disclosure of sensitive",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-57dc"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.183",
      "values:originalText": "information\nScope\n\n(1) This section applies in relation to sensitive information if:\n\n(a) the information is about an individual mentioned in\nparagraph 57DB(2)(a); and\n\n(b) the information is obtained by a data provider for the purpose\nof determining whether the individual is a fit and proper\nperson to access and use safety and security information; and\n\n(c) the data provider is a small business operator within the\nmeaning of the Privacy Act 1988; and\n\n(d) that Act would not, apart from this section, apply to the data\nprovider in relation to the information about the individual.\nNote:\nThe Privacy Act 1988 generally does not apply in relation to small\nbusiness operators, except in relation to certain activities (see\nsections 6C to 6E of that Act).\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "information\nScope\n\n(1) This section applies in relation to sensitive information if:\n\n(a) the information is about an individual mentioned in\nparagraph 57DB(2)(a); and\n\n(b) the information is obtained by a data provider for the purpose\nof determining whether the individual is a fit and proper\nperson to access and use safety and security information; and\n\n(c) the data provider is a small business operator within the\nmeaning of the Privacy Act 1988; and\n\n(d) that Act would not, apart from this section, apply to the data\nprovider in relation to the information about the individual.\nNote:\nThe Privacy Act 1988 generally does not apply in relation to small\nbusiness operators, except in relation to certain activities (see\nsections 6C to 6E of that Act).\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-57dc-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-57dc-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-57dc-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-57dc-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-57dc-logic-deontic-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "cf28b53dd9ea20cb75b0a5935a81e3b7f2f701d73c3d691c827a970eee12896e",
      "skos:note": "Use or disclosure of sensitive information is restricted for certain individuals and small business operators."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-57dc",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "57DC Safety and security information—use or disclosure of sensitive",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 183,
      "values:originalText": "information\nScope\n\n(1) This section applies in relation to sensitive information if:\n\n(a) the information is about an individual mentioned in\nparagraph 57DB(2)(a); and\n\n(b) the information is obtained by a data provider for the purpose\nof determining whether the individual is a fit and proper\nperson to access and use safety and security information; and\n\n(c) the data provider is a small business operator within the\nmeaning of the Privacy Act 1988; and\n\n(d) that Act would not, apart from this section, apply to the data\nprovider in relation to the information about the individual.\nNote:\nThe Privacy Act 1988 generally does not apply in relation to small\nbusiness operators, except in relation to certain activities (see\nsections 6C to 6E of that Act).\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-57dc-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
