      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.186",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The parties must then try to resolve the dispute.\nNote:\nFor when a party is taken to have tried to resolve a dispute, see\nsection 57EE.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nMotor vehicle service and repair information sharing scheme  Part IVE\nDispute resolution  Division 5\n\nSection 57EE\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
