      "skos:definition": "(1) Division 2A of Part IVB applies in relation to an alleged\ncontravention of a civil penalty provision mentioned in an item in\nthe table in subsection (2) in the same way in which it applies in\nrelation to an alleged contravention of a civil penalty provision of\nan industry code (within the meaning of that Part).",
