    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-57gb-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "57GB(2) Infringement notices",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-57gb-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.192",
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of the application of Division 2A of Part IVB\nunder subsection (1), the penalty to be specified in an infringement\nnotice in relation to an alleged contravention of a provision\nmentioned in columns 1 and 2 of an item of the following table\nmust be a penalty equal to the applicable penalty for the\ncontravention mentioned in column 3 or 4 of that item.\n\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nMotor vehicle service and repair information sharing scheme  Part IVE\nMiscellaneous  Division 7\n\nSection 57GB\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nPenalties to be specified in infringement notices issued under this Part\nItem\nColumn 1\nColumn 2\nColumn 3\nColumn 4\n\nFor an\nalleged\ncontraven\ntion of the\nfollowing\nprovision:\nthat relates to:\nif the alleged\ncontravention\nis by a body\ncorporate—\nthe number of\npenalty units\nmust be:\nif the alleged\ncontravention\nis by a person\nother than a\nbody\ncorporate—\nthe number of\npenalty units\nmust be:\nsubsection\n57CA(3)\nthe choice of supply\nperiod in scheme offer\nsubsection\n57CA(6)\npublishing a scheme\noffer\nsubsection\n57CA(7)\nnotifying the scheme\nadviser about scheme\ninformation offered\nsubsection\n57CB(2)\nfailing to supply scheme\ninformation within the\nperiod covered by\nparagraph 57CB(2)(b)\nsubsection\n57CB(4)\nnotifying the scheme\nadviser of terms and\nconditions of supply\nsubsection\n57CC(2)\nprohibited terms or\nconditions in contracts of\nsupply\nSection 57\nDA\npackaging of scheme\ninformation\nsubsection\n57DB(1)\nrestrictions on supplying\nsafety and security\ninformation\nsubsection\n57DE(2)\nrequiring a data provider\nto keep records\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) For the purposes of the application of Division 2A of Part IVB\nunder subsection (1), the penalty to be specified in an infringement\nnotice in relation to an alleged contravention of a provision\nmentioned in columns 1 and 2 of an item of the following table\nmust be a penalty equal to the applicable penalty for the\ncontravention mentioned in column 3 or 4 of that item.\n\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nMotor vehicle service and repair information sharing scheme  Part IVE\nMiscellaneous  Division 7\n\nSection 57GB\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nPenalties to be specified in infringement notices issued under this Part\nItem\nColumn 1\nColumn 2\nColumn 3\nColumn 4\n\nFor an\nalleged\ncontraven\ntion of the\nfollowing\nprovision:\nthat relates to:\nif the alleged\ncontravention\nis by a body\ncorporate—\nthe number of\npenalty units\nmust be:\nif the alleged\ncontravention\nis by a person\nother than a\nbody\ncorporate—\nthe number of\npenalty units\nmust be:\nsubsection\n57CA(3)\nthe choice of supply\nperiod in scheme offer\nsubsection\n57CA(6)\npublishing a scheme\noffer\nsubsection\n57CA(7)\nnotifying the scheme\nadviser about scheme\ninformation offered\nsubsection\n57CB(2)\nfailing to supply scheme\ninformation within the\nperiod covered by\nparagraph 57CB(2)(b)\nsubsection\n57CB(4)\nnotifying the scheme\nadviser of terms and\nconditions of supply\nsubsection\n57CC(2)\nprohibited terms or\nconditions in contracts of\nsupply\nSection 57\nDA\npackaging of scheme\ninformation\nsubsection\n57DB(1)\nrestrictions on supplying\nsafety and security\ninformation\nsubsection\n57DE(2)\nrequiring a data provider\nto keep records\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-57gb"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-57gb-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-57gb-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4258ea830106bf70943c5e52486118dce23c37a23f3deb6325d62b5ad04a5586",
      "skos:note": "Specify penalty for infringement notices"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-57gb-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "57GB(2) Infringement notices",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 192,
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of the application of Division 2A of Part IVB\nunder subsection (1), the penalty to be specified in an infringement\nnotice in relation to an alleged contravention of a provision\nmentioned in columns 1 and 2 of an item of the following table\nmust be a penalty equal to the applicable penalty for the\ncontravention mentioned in column 3 or 4 of that item.\n\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nMotor vehicle service and repair information sharing scheme  Part IVE\nMiscellaneous  Division 7\n\nSection 57GB\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nPenalties to be specified in infringement notices issued under this Part\nItem\nColumn 1\nColumn 2\nColumn 3\nColumn 4\n\nFor an\nalleged\ncontraven\ntion of the\nfollowing\nprovision:\nthat relates to:\nif the alleged\ncontravention\nis by a body\ncorporate—\nthe number of\npenalty units\nmust be:\nif the alleged\ncontravention\nis by a person\nother than a\nbody\ncorporate—\nthe number of\npenalty units\nmust be:\nsubsection\n57CA(3)\nthe choice of supply\nperiod in scheme offer\nsubsection\n57CA(6)\npublishing a scheme\noffer\nsubsection\n57CA(7)\nnotifying the scheme\nadviser about scheme\ninformation offered\nsubsection\n57CB(2)\nfailing to supply scheme\ninformation within the\nperiod covered by\nparagraph 57CB(2)(b)\nsubsection\n57CB(4)\nnotifying the scheme\nadviser of terms and\nconditions of supply\nsubsection\n57CC(2)\nprohibited terms or\nconditions in contracts of\nsupply\nSection 57\nDA\npackaging of scheme\ninformation\nsubsection\n57DB(1)\nrestrictions on supplying\nsafety and security\ninformation\nsubsection\n57DE(2)\nrequiring a data provider\nto keep records\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc."
    },
