      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "That business or service is a regulated service of the regulated entity for the sector",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Obligation to provide a regulated service"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58ad-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "58AD(2) Regulated entities for regulated sectors and their regulated",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58ad-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.198",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Otherwise:\n\n(a) the regulated entities for a regulated sector; and\n\n(b) the regulated services of each of those regulated entities;\nare as set out in the following table:\n\nOther regulated entities, and their regulated services, for the regulated sector\nItem\nThis person is a regulated entity:\nfor this regulated service:\na corporation that carries on or\nprovides a business or service that is\npart of the regulated sector\nthat business or service.\na person to the extent that the person\nis both:\n(a) carrying on or providing a\nbusiness or service that is part of\nthe regulated sector; and\n(b) acting using a postal, telegraphic,\ntelephonic or other like service\n(within the meaning of\nparagraph 51(v) of the\nConstitution)\nso much of that business or service\nas relates to the person acting in that\nway.\na person to the extent that the person\nis both:\n(a) carrying on or providing a\nbusiness or service that is part of\nthe regulated sector; and\n(b) acting in the course of, or in\nrelation to, a kind of trade or\ncommerce mentioned in\nsubsection (3)\nso much of that business or service\nas relates to the person acting in that\nway.\nNote 1:\nFor the meaning of corporation, see section 4.\nNote 2:\nSections 58GA to 58GC extend the meaning of person for\npartnerships, unincorporated associations and trusts.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Otherwise:\n\n(a) the regulated entities for a regulated sector; and\n\n(b) the regulated services of each of those regulated entities;\nare as set out in the following table:\n\nOther regulated entities, and their regulated services, for the regulated sector\nItem\nThis person is a regulated entity:\nfor this regulated service:\na corporation that carries on or\nprovides a business or service that is\npart of the regulated sector\nthat business or service.\na person to the extent that the person\nis both:\n(a) carrying on or providing a\nbusiness or service that is part of\nthe regulated sector; and\n(b) acting using a postal, telegraphic,\ntelephonic or other like service\n(within the meaning of\nparagraph 51(v) of the\nConstitution)\nso much of that business or service\nas relates to the person acting in that\nway.\na person to the extent that the person\nis both:\n(a) carrying on or providing a\nbusiness or service that is part of\nthe regulated sector; and\n(b) acting in the course of, or in\nrelation to, a kind of trade or\ncommerce mentioned in\nsubsection (3)\nso much of that business or service\nas relates to the person acting in that\nway.\nNote 1:\nFor the meaning of corporation, see section 4.\nNote 2:\nSections 58GA to 58GC extend the meaning of person for\npartnerships, unincorporated associations and trusts.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58ad"
