      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.202",
      "values:originalText": "(4) However, the attempt is not a scam if the attempt is of a kind\nprescribed by the SPF rules.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) However, the attempt is not a scam if the attempt is of a kind\nprescribed by the SPF rules.",
      "values:partOf": {
