      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.202",
      "values:originalText": "(4) However, the person is not an SPF consumer of the regulated\nservice if a condition prescribed by the SPF rules applies to the\nperson in relation to regulated services of that kind.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) However, the person is not an SPF consumer of the regulated\nservice if a condition prescribed by the SPF rules applies to the\nperson in relation to regulated services of that kind.",
      "values:partOf": {
