      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.211",
      "values:originalText": "Each regulated entity for a regulated sector must take reasonable\nsteps to prevent scams.\nThe SPF code for the sector may include sector-specific provisions\nfor this principle.",
