    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bj",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "58BJ Taking reasonable steps to prevent scams from being",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58bj"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.211",
      "values:originalText": "committed—civil penalty provision\n\n(1) A regulated entity contravenes this subsection if the entity fails to\ntake reasonable steps to prevent another person from committing a\nscam relating to, connected with, or using a regulated service of the\nentity.\nNote:\nSections 58GA to 58GC extend the meaning of person for\npartnerships, unincorporated associations and trusts.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) is a civil penalty provision.\nNote:\nThis means subsection (1) is a civil penalty provision of an SPF\nprinciple for the purposes of section 58FJ (about civil penalties).\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "committed—civil penalty provision\n\n(1) A regulated entity contravenes this subsection if the entity fails to\ntake reasonable steps to prevent another person from committing a\nscam relating to, connected with, or using a regulated service of the\nentity.\nNote:\nSections 58GA to 58GC extend the meaning of person for\npartnerships, unincorporated associations and trusts.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) is a civil penalty provision.\nNote:\nThis means subsection (1) is a civil penalty provision of an SPF\nprinciple for the purposes of section 58FJ (about civil penalties).\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bj-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bj-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "75c3d65e3a5ac16749a0a8e84993f7a27af3593aa1d907c03472d3a5cfae1fd3"
    },
    {
