      "values:originalText": "(3) Without limiting subsection (1), the regulated entity fails to take\nreasonable steps to detect a scam relating to, connected with, or\nusing a regulated service of the entity if the entity fails to take\nreasonable steps to:\n\n(a) detect such a scam as it happens; or\n\n(b) detect such a scam after it happens.\nNote:\nFor further details about the meaning of reasonable steps, see\nsections 58BB and 58BP.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Without limiting subsection (1), the regulated entity fails to take\nreasonable steps to detect a scam relating to, connected with, or\nusing a regulated service of the entity if the entity fails to take\nreasonable steps to:\n\n(a) detect such a scam as it happens; or\n\n(b) detect such a scam after it happens.\nNote:\nFor further details about the meaning of reasonable steps, see\nsections 58BB and 58BP.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bm"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bm-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bm-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bm-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bm-ss-3-logic-ltl-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2764a88f4b6583918ebe3f82b80d9ec299fbbad89e2ebd60314cdfe62ef38154",
      "skos:note": "Fails to take reasonable steps to detect scams"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58bm-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "58BM(3) Taking reasonable steps to detect scams—civil penalty",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 213,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Without limiting subsection (1), the regulated entity fails to take\nreasonable steps to detect a scam relating to, connected with, or\nusing a regulated service of the entity if the entity fails to take\nreasonable steps to:\n\n(a) detect such a scam as it happens; or\n\n(b) detect such a scam after it happens.\nNote:\nFor further details about the meaning of reasonable steps, see\nsections 58BB and 58BP."
    },
