    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bv-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "58BV(2) SPF general regulator may share information relating to",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58bv-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.218",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The entities are as follows:\n\n(a) a regulated entity;\n\n(b) a Commonwealth agency or authority involved in developing\nGovernment policy relating to this Part;\n\n(c) a law enforcement agency of the Commonwealth, or of a\nState or Territory;\n\n(d) an agency of a foreign country, or of part of a foreign\ncountry, that:\n\n(i) is a law enforcement agency; or\n\n(ii) is a regulatory agency responsible for scam prevention;\n\nif subsection (3) applies to a disclosure of information to the\nagency.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The entities are as follows:\n\n(a) a regulated entity;\n\n(b) a Commonwealth agency or authority involved in developing\nGovernment policy relating to this Part;\n\n(c) a law enforcement agency of the Commonwealth, or of a\nState or Territory;\n\n(d) an agency of a foreign country, or of part of a foreign\ncountry, that:\n\n(i) is a law enforcement agency; or\n\n(ii) is a regulatory agency responsible for scam prevention;\n\nif subsection (3) applies to a disclosure of information to the\nagency.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bv"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bv-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bv-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1f159a8ab7044c66dd67ea28d4aed7624b0120cceb33a9478a251ca426b44db4",
      "skos:note": "Entities that may share information relating to SPF general regulator"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58bv-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "58BV(2) SPF general regulator may share information relating to",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 218,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The entities are as follows:\n\n(a) a regulated entity;\n\n(b) a Commonwealth agency or authority involved in developing\nGovernment policy relating to this Part;\n\n(c) a law enforcement agency of the Commonwealth, or of a\nState or Territory;\n\n(d) an agency of a foreign country, or of part of a foreign\ncountry, that:\n\n(i) is a law enforcement agency; or\n\n(ii) is a regulatory agency responsible for scam prevention;\n\nif subsection (3) applies to a disclosure of information to the\nagency."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bv-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bv-ss-2"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bv-ss-2-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "shares",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Sharing obligation",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Entities may share information",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Obligation to share"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bv-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "58BV(3) SPF general regulator may share information relating to",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58bv-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.218",
      "values:originalText": "(3) This subsection applies to a disclosure of information to a foreign\nagency if the SPF general regulator is satisfied that:\n\n(a) the agency has given an undertaking for the following:\n\n(i) controlling the storage and handling of the information;\n\n(ii) controlling the use that will be made of the information;\n\n(iii) ensuring that the information will be used only for the\npurpose for which it is disclosed to the agency; and\n\n(b) it is appropriate, in all the circumstances, to disclose the\ninformation to the agency.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) This subsection applies to a disclosure of information to a foreign\nagency if the SPF general regulator is satisfied that:\n\n(a) the agency has given an undertaking for the following:\n\n(i) controlling the storage and handling of the information;\n\n(ii) controlling the use that will be made of the information;\n\n(iii) ensuring that the information will be used only for the\npurpose for which it is disclosed to the agency; and\n\n(b) it is appropriate, in all the circumstances, to disclose the\ninformation to the agency.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bv"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bv-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bv-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0b15c5df6b3b689373dca593f0490d6f9fa0f86497754ff4ed58d0bd52833a78",
      "skos:note": "SPF general regulator may share information relating to a foreign agency if certain conditions are met."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58bv-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "58BV(3) SPF general regulator may share information relating to",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 218,
      "values:originalText": "(3) This subsection applies to a disclosure of information to a foreign\nagency if the SPF general regulator is satisfied that:\n\n(a) the agency has given an undertaking for the following:\n\n(i) controlling the storage and handling of the information;\n\n(ii) controlling the use that will be made of the information;\n\n(iii) ensuring that the information will be used only for the\npurpose for which it is disclosed to the agency; and\n\n(b) it is appropriate, in all the circumstances, to disclose the\ninformation to the agency."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bv-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bv-ss-3"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bv-ss-3-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "obligates",
      "cml:logicSummary": "The agency is obligated to control the storage and handling of the information.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bv-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "58BV(4) SPF general regulator may share information relating to",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58bv-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.218",
      "values:originalText": "(4) SPF personal information may be disclosed under subsection (1).\nHowever, for a disclosure to an entity mentioned in\nparagraph (2)(b) such information must be de-identified unless the\nSPF general regulator reasonably believes that doing so would not\nachieve the object of this Part.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) SPF personal information may be disclosed under subsection (1).\nHowever, for a disclosure to an entity mentioned in\nparagraph (2)(b) such information must be de-identified unless the\nSPF general regulator reasonably believes that doing so would not\nachieve the object of this Part.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bv"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bv-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bv-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "26f43e24097dea96b9972b81935b3dc43fdba818ba656dc752ba02fb3c5c2484",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure of personal information under certain conditions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58bv-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "58BV(4) SPF general regulator may share information relating to",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 218,
      "values:originalText": "(4) SPF personal information may be disclosed under subsection (1).\nHowever, for a disclosure to an entity mentioned in\nparagraph (2)(b) such information must be de-identified unless the\nSPF general regulator reasonably believes that doing so would not\nachieve the object of this Part.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bv-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bv-ss-4"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bv-ss-4-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "obligation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation to disclose personal information under certain conditions.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "SPF general regulator may share information relating to SPF personal information.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Disclosure of personal information must be made under subsection (1) unless de-identification is deemed necessary."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bw",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "58BW Simplified outline of this Subdivision",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58bw"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.220",
      "values:originalText": "Each regulated entity for a regulated sector must take reasonable\nsteps to:\n\n(a)\ndisrupt an activity that is the subject of actionable scam\nintelligence; and\n\n(b)\nprevent losses from such an activity.\nThe entity will also need to report to the SPF general regulator the\noutcomes of the entity’s investigation about whether such an\nactivity is a scam. The report may also need to describe any\ndisruptive actions the entity has taken in relation to the activity.\nThe entity is not liable for damages etc. in taking certain actions to\ndisrupt such an activity.\nThe SPF code for the sector may include sector-specific provisions\nfor this principle.",
      "skos:definition": "Each regulated entity for a regulated sector must take reasonable\nsteps to:\n\n(a)\ndisrupt an activity that is the subject of actionable scam\nintelligence; and\n\n(b)\nprevent losses from such an activity.\nThe entity will also need to report to the SPF general regulator the\noutcomes of the entity’s investigation about whether such an\nactivity is a scam. The report may also need to describe any\ndisruptive actions the entity has taken in relation to the activity.\nThe entity is not liable for damages etc. in taking certain actions to\ndisrupt such an activity.\nThe SPF code for the sector may include sector-specific provisions\nfor this principle.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bw-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bw-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e8549dd7cfddba7b5d8d937cac83414f798c53f31218bc04f8d5f983d3a45f53",
      "skos:note": "Must take reasonable steps to disrupt scam activities and prevent losses."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58bw",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "58BW Simplified outline of this Subdivision",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 220,
      "values:originalText": "Each regulated entity for a regulated sector must take reasonable\nsteps to:\n\n(a)\ndisrupt an activity that is the subject of actionable scam\nintelligence; and\n\n(b)\nprevent losses from such an activity.\nThe entity will also need to report to the SPF general regulator the\noutcomes of the entity’s investigation about whether such an\nactivity is a scam. The report may also need to describe any\ndisruptive actions the entity has taken in relation to the activity.\nThe entity is not liable for damages etc. in taking certain actions to\ndisrupt such an activity.\nThe SPF code for the sector may include sector-specific provisions\nfor this principle."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58bw-norm",
