      "skos:note": "The Minister may make a code for a regulated sector."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58cb",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "58CB Sector-specific codes (SPF codes)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 230,
      "values:originalText": "The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make a code (an SPF\ncode) for a regulated sector."
    },
    {
