      "values:originalText": "(1) An SPF code must:\n\n(a) be consistent with the SPF principles; and\n\n(b) deal with only:\n\n(i) the themes or matters covered by Subdivisions B, C, D,\nF and G of Division 2; and\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nScams Prevention Framework  Part IVF\nSector-specific codes for the Scams Prevention Framework  Division 3\n\nSection 58CC\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(ii) related or incidental matters; and\n\n(c) subject to paragraphs (a) and (b), include provisions about\nmatters of a kind (if any) prescribed by the SPF rules.\nRelated or incidental matters in SPF codes",
      "skos:definition": "(1) An SPF code must:\n\n(a) be consistent with the SPF principles; and\n\n(b) deal with only:\n\n(i) the themes or matters covered by Subdivisions B, C, D,\nF and G of Division 2; and\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nScams Prevention Framework  Part IVF\nSector-specific codes for the Scams Prevention Framework  Division 3\n\nSection 58CC\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(ii) related or incidental matters; and\n\n(c) subject to paragraphs (a) and (b), include provisions about\nmatters of a kind (if any) prescribed by the SPF rules.\nRelated or incidental matters in SPF codes",
