      "cml:premiseText": "(2) Without limiting subparagraph (1)(b)(ii), an SPF code for a regulated sector may include the following:",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Provisions regarding services and consumers"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58cc-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-2",
