    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58dc",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "58DC Content, including requirements, of a scheme that is not",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58dc"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.235",
      "values:originalText": "already authorised under a Commonwealth law\n\n(1) The SPF rules may prescribe the following requirements for a\nscheme for which paragraph 58DB(1)(b) is to apply:\n\n(a) organisational requirements for membership of the scheme;\n\n(b) requirements for the operator (the operator) of the scheme;\n\n(c) requirements for how the scheme is to operate;\n\n(d) requirements to be complied with by members of the scheme;\n\n(e) requirements for making changes to the scheme.\n\n(2) A scheme for which paragraph 58DB(1)(b) is to apply may also\ninclude provisions dealing with the following:\n\n(a) powers of one or more of the following under the scheme:\n\n(i) the Minister;\n\n(ii) an SPF regulator;\n\n(iii) a Commonwealth entity (within the meaning of the\nPublic Governance, Performance and Accountability\nAct 2013);\n\n(b) powers of the operator under the scheme, including powers\nto:\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "already authorised under a Commonwealth law\n\n(1) The SPF rules may prescribe the following requirements for a\nscheme for which paragraph 58DB(1)(b) is to apply:\n\n(a) organisational requirements for membership of the scheme;\n\n(b) requirements for the operator (the operator) of the scheme;\n\n(c) requirements for how the scheme is to operate;\n\n(d) requirements to be complied with by members of the scheme;\n\n(e) requirements for making changes to the scheme.\n\n(2) A scheme for which paragraph 58DB(1)(b) is to apply may also\ninclude provisions dealing with the following:\n\n(a) powers of one or more of the following under the scheme:\n\n(i) the Minister;\n\n(ii) an SPF regulator;\n\n(iii) a Commonwealth entity (within the meaning of the\nPublic Governance, Performance and Accountability\nAct 2013);\n\n(b) powers of the operator under the scheme, including powers\nto:\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58dc-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58dc-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3e9626b4f5634f7f369ce485b9ecd3f65c8f21c28c322a551e9a0ef7ef338e4f"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58dc",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "58DC Content, including requirements, of a scheme that is not",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 235,
      "values:originalText": "already authorised under a Commonwealth law\n\n(1) The SPF rules may prescribe the following requirements for a\nscheme for which paragraph 58DB(1)(b) is to apply:\n\n(a) organisational requirements for membership of the scheme;\n\n(b) requirements for the operator (the operator) of the scheme;\n\n(c) requirements for how the scheme is to operate;\n\n(d) requirements to be complied with by members of the scheme;\n\n(e) requirements for making changes to the scheme.\n\n(2) A scheme for which paragraph 58DB(1)(b) is to apply may also\ninclude provisions dealing with the following:\n\n(a) powers of one or more of the following under the scheme:\n\n(i) the Minister;\n\n(ii) an SPF regulator;\n\n(iii) a Commonwealth entity (within the meaning of the\nPublic Governance, Performance and Accountability\nAct 2013);\n\n(b) powers of the operator under the scheme, including powers\nto:\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc."
    },
