      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.237",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The SPF regulator may impose conditions to be complied with by\nthe operator in relation to the information.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The SPF regulator may impose conditions to be complied with by\nthe operator in relation to the information.",
      "values:partOf": {
