    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58de-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "58DE(3) Disclosing information to the operator of an SPF EDR scheme",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58de-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.237",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If an SPF regulator is to disclose SPF personal information under\nsubsection (1), the SPF regulator must de-identify the information\nunless the SPF regulator reasonably believes that doing so would\nnot achieve the object of this Part.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If an SPF regulator is to disclose SPF personal information under\nsubsection (1), the SPF regulator must de-identify the information\nunless the SPF regulator reasonably believes that doing so would\nnot achieve the object of this Part.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58de"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58de-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58de-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "522bc77c94b193a60a1e38290df3459a58737e45cf99b07c7ab0c2586ac7b1a0",
      "skos:note": "Must de-identify personal information unless reasonable belief that doing so would not achieve the object of this Part."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58de-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "58DE(3) Disclosing information to the operator of an SPF EDR scheme",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 237,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If an SPF regulator is to disclose SPF personal information under\nsubsection (1), the SPF regulator must de-identify the information\nunless the SPF regulator reasonably believes that doing so would\nnot achieve the object of this Part.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc."
    },
