    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58ec-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "58EC(3) Delegation of the SPF general regulator’s functions and",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 239,
      "values:originalText": "(3) This subsection applies to the following persons:\n\n(a) a member of the Commission;\n\n(b) person who is an employee of the Commission who:\n\n(i) is an SES employee or acting SES employee; or\n\n(ii) holds or performs the duties of an Executive Level 1 or\n2 position;\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc."
