    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58ef-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "58EF(3) Arrangements for regulating the Scams Prevention",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58ef-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.242",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The arrangement must include provisions relating to the matters (if\nany) prescribed by the SPF rules.\nNote:\nFor example, the SPF rules could require an SPF regulator that\nrequests a scam report under subsection 58BS(1) to:\n(a) notify each other SPF regulator of the request; and\n(b) give a copy of the scam report to any of those other SPF\nregulators that asks for one.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The arrangement must include provisions relating to the matters (if\nany) prescribed by the SPF rules.\nNote:\nFor example, the SPF rules could require an SPF regulator that\nrequests a scam report under subsection 58BS(1) to:\n(a) notify each other SPF regulator of the request; and\n(b) give a copy of the scam report to any of those other SPF\nregulators that asks for one.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58ef"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58ef-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58ef-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58ef-ss-3-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ed9d072fa812a7ffc200f2c70caa84a88d1421e441e8b456d16eeac56567f521",
      "skos:note": "The statement is not a legislative instrument. Provisions relating to matters prescribed by the SPF rules must be included in arrangements."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58ef-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "58EF(3) Arrangements for regulating the Scams Prevention",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 242,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The arrangement must include provisions relating to the matters (if\nany) prescribed by the SPF rules.\nNote:\nFor example, the SPF rules could require an SPF regulator that\nrequests a scam report under subsection 58BS(1) to:\n(a) notify each other SPF regulator of the request; and\n(b) give a copy of the scam report to any of those other SPF\nregulators that asks for one."
    },
