    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58ef-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "58EF(1) Arrangements for regulating the Scams Prevention",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58ef-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.242",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The SPF general regulator must publish a statement on its website\nsummarising, in general terms, the roles and responsibilities of:\n\n(a) each SPF regulator; and\n\n(b) each operator of an SPF EDR scheme; and\n\n(c) any other entity the SPF general regulator considers\nappropriate;\nwith respect to the regulation, enforcement and administration of\nthe SPF provisions.\nNote:\nThe purpose of the statement is to explain these matters at a high\nlevel.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The SPF general regulator must publish a statement on its website\nsummarising, in general terms, the roles and responsibilities of:\n\n(a) each SPF regulator; and\n\n(b) each operator of an SPF EDR scheme; and\n\n(c) any other entity the SPF general regulator considers\nappropriate;\nwith respect to the regulation, enforcement and administration of\nthe SPF provisions.\nNote:\nThe purpose of the statement is to explain these matters at a high\nlevel.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58ef"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58ef-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58ef-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58ef-ss-1-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5ce6ab55e6c84c6b86eeaba1cfbb567684cc36c3fbb5fe9d7260d7c53c2781c6",
      "skos:note": "SPF general regulator and sector regulators must enter into an arrangement for regulation and enforcement. Publish a statement on its website summarising roles and responsibilities."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58ef-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "58EF(1) Arrangements for regulating the Scams Prevention",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 242,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The SPF general regulator must publish a statement on its website\nsummarising, in general terms, the roles and responsibilities of:\n\n(a) each SPF regulator; and\n\n(b) each operator of an SPF EDR scheme; and\n\n(c) any other entity the SPF general regulator considers\nappropriate;\nwith respect to the regulation, enforcement and administration of\nthe SPF provisions.\nNote:\nThe purpose of the statement is to explain these matters at a high\nlevel."
    },
