      "values:originalText": "(2) However, the SPF regulator must not appoint a person as an\ninspector unless the SPF regulator is satisfied that the person has\nappropriate qualifications, training, skills or experience to exercise\nthe powers of an inspector.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) However, the SPF regulator must not appoint a person as an\ninspector unless the SPF regulator is satisfied that the person has\nappropriate qualifications, training, skills or experience to exercise\nthe powers of an inspector.",
      "values:partOf": {
