    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58fb-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "58FB(4) Appointment of inspectors",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58fb-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.247",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If (and while) no appointments under subsection (1) by an SPF\nregulator are in force for the purposes of a Subdivision of this\nDivision, the SPF regulator is an inspector of the SPF regulator for\nthe purposes of that Subdivision.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If (and while) no appointments under subsection (1) by an SPF\nregulator are in force for the purposes of a Subdivision of this\nDivision, the SPF regulator is an inspector of the SPF regulator for\nthe purposes of that Subdivision.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58fb"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58fb-ss-4-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b94ad3ff89702f81a8eefc0c465b8c90a250b431e38e37b8dc2f271115fc5d43",
      "skos:note": "SPF regulator acts as inspector if no appointments are in force"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58fb-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "58FB(4) Appointment of inspectors",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 247,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If (and while) no appointments under subsection (1) by an SPF\nregulator are in force for the purposes of a Subdivision of this\nDivision, the SPF regulator is an inspector of the SPF regulator for\nthe purposes of that Subdivision.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc."
    },
