      "values:originalText": "(4) The relevant chief executive may, in writing, delegate the powers\nand functions mentioned in subsection (5) to:\n\n(a) an SES employee, or acting SES employee, of the SPF sector\nregulator; or\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The relevant chief executive may, in writing, delegate the powers\nand functions mentioned in subsection (5) to:\n\n(a) an SES employee, or acting SES employee, of the SPF sector\nregulator; or\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58ff"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58ff-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58ff-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bb553ffddd8be6a1a82c94e4f0421538d9c61ccb8282f016be63309b980365e1",
      "skos:note": "Delegate powers and functions to an SES employee or acting SES employee of the SPF sector regulator"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58ff-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "58FF(4) Investigating compliance with an SPF code—default",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 250,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The relevant chief executive may, in writing, delegate the powers\nand functions mentioned in subsection (5) to:\n\n(a) an SES employee, or acting SES employee, of the SPF sector\nregulator; or\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc."
    },
