    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58fi-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "58FI(2) Monitoring or investigating—Minister may declare that",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58fi-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.255",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that specified\nalternative power provisions (that relate to a specified entity and\nspecified alternative regulatory provisions) also apply:\n\n(a) to the entity in the entity’s capacity as the SPF sector\nregulator for a regulated sector; and\n\n(b) in relation to specified provisions of the SPF code for the\nsector in a corresponding way to the way the alternative\npower provisions apply in relation to the alternative\nregulatory provisions.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that specified\nalternative power provisions (that relate to a specified entity and\nspecified alternative regulatory provisions) also apply:\n\n(a) to the entity in the entity’s capacity as the SPF sector\nregulator for a regulated sector; and\n\n(b) in relation to specified provisions of the SPF code for the\nsector in a corresponding way to the way the alternative\npower provisions apply in relation to the alternative\nregulatory provisions.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58fi"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58fi-ss-2-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d8b41d79a4e0eff6697edc8140c7d70f272c71a766197807fc69a3192c96616a",
      "skos:note": "Minister may declare alternative power provisions apply to entity in its capacity as sector regulator and in relation to specified provisions of the SPF code."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58fi-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "58FI(2) Monitoring or investigating—Minister may declare that",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 255,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that specified\nalternative power provisions (that relate to a specified entity and\nspecified alternative regulatory provisions) also apply:\n\n(a) to the entity in the entity’s capacity as the SPF sector\nregulator for a regulated sector; and\n\n(b) in relation to specified provisions of the SPF code for the\nsector in a corresponding way to the way the alternative\npower provisions apply in relation to the alternative\nregulatory provisions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58fi-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
