      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58fi-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "58FI(3) Monitoring or investigating—Minister may declare that",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58fi-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.255",
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of this additional application of the alternative\npower provisions, the instrument may specify modifications of one\nor more of those provisions to remove any doubt about how those\nprovisions apply in such a corresponding way in relation to the\nspecified provisions of the SPF code.\nNote:\nThe modifications are for this additional application of the alternative\npower provisions, and are not modifications of those provisions as\nthey ordinarily apply.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) For the purposes of this additional application of the alternative\npower provisions, the instrument may specify modifications of one\nor more of those provisions to remove any doubt about how those\nprovisions apply in such a corresponding way in relation to the\nspecified provisions of the SPF code.\nNote:\nThe modifications are for this additional application of the alternative\npower provisions, and are not modifications of those provisions as\nthey ordinarily apply.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58fi"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58fi-ss-3-norm"
