      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.257",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Despite subsection 82(5) of the Regulatory Powers Act, the\npecuniary penalty payable by a person:\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Despite subsection 82(5) of the Regulatory Powers Act, the\npecuniary penalty payable by a person:\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "cml:asserts": [
