    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58fr",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "58FR Effect of compliance with an SPF infringement notice",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58fr"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.261",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) an SPF infringement notice for an alleged contravention of a\ncivil penalty provision is issued to a person; and\n\n(b) the person pays the penalty specified in the notice within the\ninfringement notice compliance period and in accordance\nwith the notice; and\n\n(c) the notice is not withdrawn under section 58FU.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) an SPF infringement notice for an alleged contravention of a\ncivil penalty provision is issued to a person; and\n\n(b) the person pays the penalty specified in the notice within the\ninfringement notice compliance period and in accordance\nwith the notice; and\n\n(c) the notice is not withdrawn under section 58FU.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58fr-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58fr-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bc62b47b2d90366564515506d29c81f9010b6914b846ba839e46eab47ad7fdb0",
      "skos:note": "Compliance with an SPF infringement notice results in no further action."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58fr",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "58FR Effect of compliance with an SPF infringement notice",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 261,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) an SPF infringement notice for an alleged contravention of a\ncivil penalty provision is issued to a person; and\n\n(b) the person pays the penalty specified in the notice within the\ninfringement notice compliance period and in accordance\nwith the notice; and\n\n(c) the notice is not withdrawn under section 58FU.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc."
    },
    {
