      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.262",
      "values:originalText": "(4) A failure to give the person written notice of the extension does not\naffect the validity of the extension.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) A failure to give the person written notice of the extension does not\naffect the validity of the extension.",
      "values:partOf": {
