    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58ft-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "58FT(5) Infringement notice compliance period for infringement notice",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58ft-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.262",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If an infringement notice compliance period for an SPF\ninfringement notice is extended under this section, a reference in\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nScams Prevention Framework  Part IVF\nEnforcing the Scams Prevention Framework  Division 6\n\nSection 58FU\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nthis Subdivision to the infringement notice compliance period is\ntaken to be a reference to that period as so extended.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If an infringement notice compliance period for an SPF\ninfringement notice is extended under this section, a reference in\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nScams Prevention Framework  Part IVF\nEnforcing the Scams Prevention Framework  Division 6\n\nSection 58FU\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nthis Subdivision to the infringement notice compliance period is\ntaken to be a reference to that period as so extended.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58ft"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58ft-ss-5-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e8439163a14f4bf2d2f006a3bed3366b5e0d7e868d4cf687ae8f4e4d209f6720",
      "skos:note": "Reference to extended infringement notice compliance period"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58ft-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "58FT(5) Infringement notice compliance period for infringement notice",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 262,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If an infringement notice compliance period for an SPF\ninfringement notice is extended under this section, a reference in\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nScams Prevention Framework  Part IVF\nEnforcing the Scams Prevention Framework  Division 6\n\nSection 58FU\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nthis Subdivision to the infringement notice compliance period is\ntaken to be a reference to that period as so extended."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58ft-ss-5-norm",
