      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.265",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Court may, on application, grant an injunction in such terms as\nthe Court considers appropriate if the Court is satisfied that a\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Court may, on application, grant an injunction in such terms as\nthe Court considers appropriate if the Court is satisfied that a\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "cml:asserts": [
