        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The changes set out in this section apply to a partnership as if it were a person.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Partnerships must comply with the SPF provisions between the time they are classified as individuals and the time the provision takes effect."
    },
    {
