    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58gd-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "58GD(3) Compensation for acquisition of property",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58gd-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.284",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If the 2 persons do not agree on the amount of the compensation,\nthe person to whom compensation is payable may institute\nproceedings in:\n\n(a) the Federal Court; or\n\n(b) the Supreme Court of a State or Territory;\nfor the recovery from the other person of such reasonable amount\nof compensation as the Court determines.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nScams Prevention Framework  Part IVF\nOther provisions  Division 7\n\nSection 58GE\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If the 2 persons do not agree on the amount of the compensation,\nthe person to whom compensation is payable may institute\nproceedings in:\n\n(a) the Federal Court; or\n\n(b) the Supreme Court of a State or Territory;\nfor the recovery from the other person of such reasonable amount\nof compensation as the Court determines.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nScams Prevention Framework  Part IVF\nOther provisions  Division 7\n\nSection 58GE\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58gd"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58gd-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-58gd-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "deb66e8ad3960d6652bf56e14e8c3372dc475dd4b6c2e427473e2cb8cd2cf7c4",
      "skos:note": "Compensation for acquisition of property"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-58gd-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "58GD(3) Compensation for acquisition of property",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 284,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If the 2 persons do not agree on the amount of the compensation,\nthe person to whom compensation is payable may institute\nproceedings in:\n\n(a) the Federal Court; or\n\n(b) the Supreme Court of a State or Territory;\nfor the recovery from the other person of such reasonable amount\nof compensation as the Court determines.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nScams Prevention Framework  Part IVF\nOther provisions  Division 7\n\nSection 58GE\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026"
    },
