      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.285",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister must cause a review to be conducted of the operation\nof the SPF provisions.\n\n(2) The review must be conducted as soon as practicable after the end\nof the 3-year period starting on the day the first SPF code is made\nunder section 58CB.\n\n(3) The persons who conduct the review must give the Minister a\nwritten report of the review.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Minister must cause a review to be conducted of the operation\nof the SPF provisions.\n\n(2) The review must be conducted as soon as practicable after the end\nof the 3-year period starting on the day the first SPF code is made\nunder section 58CB.\n\n(3) The persons who conduct the review must give the Minister a\nwritten report of the review.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
