    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60d-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "60D(2) Notice to entity that is considered to have engaged in price",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-60d-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.297",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The notice must:\n\n(a) be expressed to be given under this section; and\n\n(b) identify:\n\n(i) the entity that made the supply; and\n\n(ii) the kind of supply made; and\n\n(iii) the circumstances in which the supply was made; and\n\n(c) state that, in the Commission’s opinion, the price for the\nsupply did not pass through all of the entity’s cost savings\nrelating to the supply that were directly or indirectly\nattributable to the carbon tax repeal.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The notice must:\n\n(a) be expressed to be given under this section; and\n\n(b) identify:\n\n(i) the entity that made the supply; and\n\n(ii) the kind of supply made; and\n\n(iii) the circumstances in which the supply was made; and\n\n(c) state that, in the Commission’s opinion, the price for the\nsupply did not pass through all of the entity’s cost savings\nrelating to the supply that were directly or indirectly\nattributable to the carbon tax repeal.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60d"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60d-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60d-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60d-ss-2-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "90af0f476a5aea57efb02064caff31f9fa9ec0d3dc3b91204bf2534c5b7055e1",
      "skos:note": "Entity must provide notice with specific details about supply made.",
      "dc:description": "true"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-60d-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "60D(2) Notice to entity that is considered to have engaged in price",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 297,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The notice must:\n\n(a) be expressed to be given under this section; and\n\n(b) identify:\n\n(i) the entity that made the supply; and\n\n(ii) the kind of supply made; and\n\n(iii) the circumstances in which the supply was made; and\n\n(c) state that, in the Commission’s opinion, the price for the\nsupply did not pass through all of the entity’s cost savings\nrelating to the supply that were directly or indirectly\nattributable to the carbon tax repeal."
    },
