      "values:originalText": "(4) The Commission may vary or revoke the notice on its own\ninitiative or on application made by the entity. The Commission\nmust give the entity written notice of the variation or revocation.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The Commission may vary or revoke the notice on its own\ninitiative or on application made by the entity. The Commission\nmust give the entity written notice of the variation or revocation.",
