      "skos:note": "Section does not limit Commission's general information-gathering powers."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-60fa-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "60FA(7) Carbon tax removal substantiation notices",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 300,
      "values:originalText": "(7) This section does not limit section 155 (which is about the general\ninformation-gathering powers of the Commission)."
    },
