      "values:originalText": "(1) An entity that is given a carbon tax removal substantiation notice\nmust comply with it within the applicable compliance period for\nthe notice.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60fc-norm",
