    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60fe-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "60FE(4) Statements for customers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-60fe-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.306",
      "values:originalText": "(4) An entity commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the entity is subject to a requirement under subsection (2) or\n(3); and\n\n(b) the entity is capable of complying with the requirement; and\n\n(c) the entity omits to do an act; and\n\n(d) the omission breaches the requirement.\nPenalty: 400 penalty units.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) An entity commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the entity is subject to a requirement under subsection (2) or\n(3); and\n\n(b) the entity is capable of complying with the requirement; and\n\n(c) the entity omits to do an act; and\n\n(d) the omission breaches the requirement.\nPenalty: 400 penalty units.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60fe"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60fe-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60fe-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60fe-ss-4-logic-ltl-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60fe-ss-4-logic-deontic-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "06994a754148700aa429bb0b655af913443201e239bb708763e9af1b33760ee6",
      "skos:note": "Entity commits an offence if it omits to comply with a requirement."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-60fe-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "60FE(4) Statements for customers",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 306,
      "values:originalText": "(4) An entity commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the entity is subject to a requirement under subsection (2) or\n(3); and\n\n(b) the entity is capable of complying with the requirement; and\n\n(c) the entity omits to do an act; and\n\n(d) the omission breaches the requirement.\nPenalty: 400 penalty units."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60fe-ss-4-norm",
