      "cml:premiseText": "(a) the entity is subject to a requirement under subsection (2) or (3); and (b) the entity is capable of complying with the requirement;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(c) the entity omits to do an act; and (d) the omission breaches the requirement."
    },
    {
