      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.308",
      "values:originalText": "(6) The Commission may monitor prices to assess the general effect of\nthe carbon tax scheme on prices charged by entities for supplies, in\nthe pre-repeal transition period, of relevant goods.\nNote 1:\nFor pre-repeal transition period, see subsection (13).\nNote 2:\nFor relevant goods, see subsection (11).",
      "skos:definition": "(6) The Commission may monitor prices to assess the general effect of\nthe carbon tax scheme on prices charged by entities for supplies, in\nthe pre-repeal transition period, of relevant goods.\nNote 1:\nFor pre-repeal transition period, see subsection (13).\nNote 2:\nFor relevant goods, see subsection (11).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60g"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60g-ss-6-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8d06eeb03f6e15afb93397da56d8e104c6fbb0640702f1c38f65827b6dea95c3",
      "skos:note": "The Commission may monitor prices to assess the general effect of the carbon tax scheme on prices charged by entities for supplies."
    },
    {
