      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "60G(6) Commission may monitor prices in relation to the carbon tax",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 308,
      "values:originalText": "(6) The Commission may monitor prices to assess the general effect of\nthe carbon tax scheme on prices charged by entities for supplies, in\nthe pre-repeal transition period, of relevant goods.\nNote 1:\nFor pre-repeal transition period, see subsection (13).\nNote 2:\nFor relevant goods, see subsection (11)."
