    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60j-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "60J(4) Reporting",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-60j-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.312",
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of this section, a quarter is a period of 3 months:\n\n(a) that occurs wholly or partly during the carbon tax repeal\ntransition period; and\n\n(b) that starts on any of the following days in a year:\n\n(i) 1 January;\n\n(ii) 1 April;\n\n(iii) 1 July;\n\n(iv) 1 October.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) For the purposes of this section, a quarter is a period of 3 months:\n\n(a) that occurs wholly or partly during the carbon tax repeal\ntransition period; and\n\n(b) that starts on any of the following days in a year:\n\n(i) 1 January;\n\n(ii) 1 April;\n\n(iii) 1 July;\n\n(iv) 1 October.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60j"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60j-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60j-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60j-ss-4-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d62b95a4faffa82b4d20bb48d38204708db849a1210624cf243d19bbeb856145",
      "skos:note": "Defines a quarter as a 3-month period during the carbon tax repeal transition period or on specific dates."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-60j-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "60J(4) Reporting",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 312,
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of this section, a quarter is a period of 3 months:\n\n(a) that occurs wholly or partly during the carbon tax repeal\ntransition period; and\n\n(b) that starts on any of the following days in a year:\n\n(i) 1 January;\n\n(ii) 1 April;\n\n(iii) 1 July;\n\n(iv) 1 October."
    },
