    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60j-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "60J(6) Reporting",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-60j-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.312",
      "values:originalText": "(6) If this section commences during a quarter (but not on the first day\nof a quarter):\n\n(a) no report is to be made at the end of the quarter; but\n\n(b) the report made at the end of the next quarter is also to\ninclude the information required by subsections (1) and (2) in\nrelation to the previous quarter.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nCarbon tax price reduction obligation  Part V\nFalse or misleading representations about the effect of the carbon tax repeal etc. on\nprices  Division 4\n\nSection 60K\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(6) If this section commences during a quarter (but not on the first day\nof a quarter):\n\n(a) no report is to be made at the end of the quarter; but\n\n(b) the report made at the end of the next quarter is also to\ninclude the information required by subsections (1) and (2) in\nrelation to the previous quarter.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nCarbon tax price reduction obligation  Part V\nFalse or misleading representations about the effect of the carbon tax repeal etc. on\nprices  Division 4\n\nSection 60K\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60j"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60j-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60j-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4607ff053432c051a6f2911fa09613c6fa72aa824ae49400dbf4b48105199796",
      "skos:note": "Reporting obligation if section commences during a quarter",
      "dc:description": "Report at the end of each quarter"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-60j-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "60J(6) Reporting",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 312,
      "values:originalText": "(6) If this section commences during a quarter (but not on the first day\nof a quarter):\n\n(a) no report is to be made at the end of the quarter; but\n\n(b) the report made at the end of the next quarter is also to\ninclude the information required by subsections (1) and (2) in\nrelation to the previous quarter.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nCarbon tax price reduction obligation  Part V\nFalse or misleading representations about the effect of the carbon tax repeal etc. on\nprices  Division 4\n\nSection 60K\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026"
    },
