    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60k",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "60K False or misleading representations about the effect of the",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-60k"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.313",
      "values:originalText": "carbon tax repeal etc. on prices\n\nAn entity must not, in trade or commerce, in connection with:\n\n(a) the supply or possible supply of goods or services; or\n\n(b) the promotion by any means of the supply or use of goods or\nservices;\nmake a false or misleading representation, during the carbon tax\nrepeal transition period, concerning the effect of:\n\n(c) the carbon tax repeal or a part of the carbon tax repeal; or\n\n(d) the carbon tax scheme or a part of the carbon tax scheme;\non the price for the supply of the goods or services.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "carbon tax repeal etc. on prices\n\nAn entity must not, in trade or commerce, in connection with:\n\n(a) the supply or possible supply of goods or services; or\n\n(b) the promotion by any means of the supply or use of goods or\nservices;\nmake a false or misleading representation, during the carbon tax\nrepeal transition period, concerning the effect of:\n\n(c) the carbon tax repeal or a part of the carbon tax repeal; or\n\n(d) the carbon tax scheme or a part of the carbon tax scheme;\non the price for the supply of the goods or services.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60k-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60k-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60k-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9b00d16d741a5c55fb6fbe32f4dae689b1d3336c4f7efac7fc4b6be186c1a3e5",
      "skos:note": "False or misleading representations about the effect of the carbon tax repeal on prices"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-60k",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "60K False or misleading representations about the effect of the",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 313,
      "values:originalText": "carbon tax repeal etc. on prices\n\nAn entity must not, in trade or commerce, in connection with:\n\n(a) the supply or possible supply of goods or services; or\n\n(b) the promotion by any means of the supply or use of goods or\nservices;\nmake a false or misleading representation, during the carbon tax\nrepeal transition period, concerning the effect of:\n\n(c) the carbon tax repeal or a part of the carbon tax repeal; or\n\n(d) the carbon tax scheme or a part of the carbon tax scheme;\non the price for the supply of the goods or services.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc."
    },
