    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60l-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "60L(5) Issuing an infringement notice",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-60l-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.314",
      "values:originalText": "(5) The penalty to be specified in an infringement notice that is to be\nissued to a person in relation to an alleged contravention of an\ninfringement notice provision must be:\n\n(a) if the person is a listed corporation—600 penalty units; or\n\n(b) if the person is a body corporate other than a listed\ncorporation—60 penalty units; or\n\n(c) if the person is not a body corporate—12 penalty units.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) The penalty to be specified in an infringement notice that is to be\nissued to a person in relation to an alleged contravention of an\ninfringement notice provision must be:\n\n(a) if the person is a listed corporation—600 penalty units; or\n\n(b) if the person is a body corporate other than a listed\ncorporation—60 penalty units; or\n\n(c) if the person is not a body corporate—12 penalty units.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60l"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60l-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-60l-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ba20dd89bc70432d9ff1f91af2624a1003595eeedaa7c73f4b6ae14e7fc3fc77",
      "skos:note": "Penalty for issuing an infringement notice"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-60l-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "60L(5) Issuing an infringement notice",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 314,
      "values:originalText": "(5) The penalty to be specified in an infringement notice that is to be\nissued to a person in relation to an alleged contravention of an\ninfringement notice provision must be:\n\n(a) if the person is a listed corporation—600 penalty units; or\n\n(b) if the person is a body corporate other than a listed\ncorporation—60 penalty units; or\n\n(c) if the person is not a body corporate—12 penalty units."
    },
    {
