      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.316",
      "values:originalText": "(7) If the Commission extends the infringement notice compliance\nperiod for an infringement notice, a reference in this Division to\nthe infringement notice compliance period for an infringement\nnotice is taken to be a reference to the infringement notice\ncompliance period as so extended.",
      "skos:definition": "(7) If the Commission extends the infringement notice compliance\nperiod for an infringement notice, a reference in this Division to\nthe infringement notice compliance period for an infringement\nnotice is taken to be a reference to the infringement notice\ncompliance period as so extended.",
      "values:partOf": {
