    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-76",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "76 Pecuniary penalties",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-76"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.321",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If the Court is satisfied that a person:\n\n(a) has contravened any of the following provisions:\n\n(i) a provision of Part IV (other than section 45AF or\n45AG);\n\n(iaa) a provision of Part IVBA specified in subsection (4A);\n\n(iab) subsection 53ZQ(1), (2) or (3), section 53ZV,\nsubsection 53ZW(1) or a civil penalty provision of a gas\nmarket instrument; or\n\n(ia) section 55B;\n\n(ib) subsection 56BO(1) or 56BU(1), section 56BZA,\n56BZB or 56BZC, subsection 56BZD(1), section 56BZJ\nor a civil penalty provision of the consumer data rules;\n\n(ic) a provision of Part IVE;\n\n(ii) section 60C;\n\n(iia) section 60K;\n\n(iii) section 92;\n\n(iiia) a provision of Division 2 of Part XICA;\n\n(iiib) subsection 153ZEL(2);\n\n(iiic) paragraph 155(5)(b);\n\n(iv) a civil penalty provision of an industry code; or\n\n(b) has attempted to contravene such a provision; or\n\n(c) has aided, abetted, counselled or procured a person to\ncontravene such a provision; or\n\n(d) has induced, or attempted to induce, a person, whether by\nthreats or promises or otherwise, to contravene such a\nprovision; or\n\n(e) has been in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly\nconcerned in, or party to, the contravention by a person of\nsuch a provision; or\n\nChapter 5  Enforcement and remedies",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If the Court is satisfied that a person:\n\n(a) has contravened any of the following provisions:\n\n(i) a provision of Part IV (other than section 45AF or\n45AG);\n\n(iaa) a provision of Part IVBA specified in subsection (4A);\n\n(iab) subsection 53ZQ(1), (2) or (3), section 53ZV,\nsubsection 53ZW(1) or a civil penalty provision of a gas\nmarket instrument; or\n\n(ia) section 55B;\n\n(ib) subsection 56BO(1) or 56BU(1), section 56BZA,\n56BZB or 56BZC, subsection 56BZD(1), section 56BZJ\nor a civil penalty provision of the consumer data rules;\n\n(ic) a provision of Part IVE;\n\n(ii) section 60C;\n\n(iia) section 60K;\n\n(iii) section 92;\n\n(iiia) a provision of Division 2 of Part XICA;\n\n(iiib) subsection 153ZEL(2);\n\n(iiic) paragraph 155(5)(b);\n\n(iv) a civil penalty provision of an industry code; or\n\n(b) has attempted to contravene such a provision; or\n\n(c) has aided, abetted, counselled or procured a person to\ncontravene such a provision; or\n\n(d) has induced, or attempted to induce, a person, whether by\nthreats or promises or otherwise, to contravene such a\nprovision; or\n\n(e) has been in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly\nconcerned in, or party to, the contravention by a person of\nsuch a provision; or\n\nChapter 5  Enforcement and remedies",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-76-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-76-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "49f837138f82ca28d8b0d9ed88d0b3c7b4d320d2f175411dc13bd3925df27711",
      "skos:note": "Contravention of specific provisions is prohibited."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-76",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "76 Pecuniary penalties",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 321,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If the Court is satisfied that a person:\n\n(a) has contravened any of the following provisions:\n\n(i) a provision of Part IV (other than section 45AF or\n45AG);\n\n(iaa) a provision of Part IVBA specified in subsection (4A);\n\n(iab) subsection 53ZQ(1), (2) or (3), section 53ZV,\nsubsection 53ZW(1) or a civil penalty provision of a gas\nmarket instrument; or\n\n(ia) section 55B;\n\n(ib) subsection 56BO(1) or 56BU(1), section 56BZA,\n56BZB or 56BZC, subsection 56BZD(1), section 56BZJ\nor a civil penalty provision of the consumer data rules;\n\n(ic) a provision of Part IVE;\n\n(ii) section 60C;\n\n(iia) section 60K;\n\n(iii) section 92;\n\n(iiia) a provision of Division 2 of Part XICA;\n\n(iiib) subsection 153ZEL(2);\n\n(iiic) paragraph 155(5)(b);\n\n(iv) a civil penalty provision of an industry code; or\n\n(b) has attempted to contravene such a provision; or\n\n(c) has aided, abetted, counselled or procured a person to\ncontravene such a provision; or\n\n(d) has induced, or attempted to induce, a person, whether by\nthreats or promises or otherwise, to contravene such a\nprovision; or\n\n(e) has been in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly\nconcerned in, or party to, the contravention by a person of\nsuch a provision; or\n\nChapter 5  Enforcement and remedies"
    },
    {
