      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.325",
      "values:originalText": "(1C) For the purposes of item 9 of the table in subsection (1A), the\namounts are as follows:\n\n(a) $10,000,000;\n\nChapter 5  Enforcement and remedies",
      "skos:definition": "(1C) For the purposes of item 9 of the table in subsection (1A), the\namounts are as follows:\n\n(a) $10,000,000;\n\nChapter 5  Enforcement and remedies",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10"
      },
