    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-77a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "77A Indemnification of officers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-77a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.329",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A body corporate (the first body), or a body corporate related to the\nfirst body, must not indemnify a person (whether by agreement or\nby making a payment and whether directly or through an\ninterposed entity) against any of the following liabilities incurred\nas an officer of the first body:\n\n(a) a civil liability;\n\nChapter 5  Enforcement and remedies",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A body corporate (the first body), or a body corporate related to the\nfirst body, must not indemnify a person (whether by agreement or\nby making a payment and whether directly or through an\ninterposed entity) against any of the following liabilities incurred\nas an officer of the first body:\n\n(a) a civil liability;\n\nChapter 5  Enforcement and remedies",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-77a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-77a-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "971354f86b7ce10ff547181aeb1764a9d8ac9ab856cf097391e38fbd060003d1",
      "skos:note": "Body corporate cannot indemnify certain liabilities incurred as an officer."
    },
    {
