    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-77c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "77C Application of section 77A to a person other than a body",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-77c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.330",
      "values:originalText": "corporate\n\nIf, as a result of the operation of Part 2.4 of the Criminal Code, a\nperson other than a body corporate is:\n\n(a) convicted of an offence (the relevant offence) against\nsubsection 77A(1) of this Act; or\n\n(b) convicted of an offence (the relevant offence) against\nsection 11.4 of the Criminal Code in relation to an offence\nreferred to in subsection 77A(1) of this Act;\nthe relevant offence is taken to be punishable on conviction by a\nfine not exceeding 5 penalty units.\n\nEnforcement and remedies  Chapter 5\nEnforcement and remedies  Part VI\nOrders relating to acquisitions  Division 3\n\nSection 77D\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "skos:definition": "corporate\n\nIf, as a result of the operation of Part 2.4 of the Criminal Code, a\nperson other than a body corporate is:\n\n(a) convicted of an offence (the relevant offence) against\nsubsection 77A(1) of this Act; or\n\n(b) convicted of an offence (the relevant offence) against\nsection 11.4 of the Criminal Code in relation to an offence\nreferred to in subsection 77A(1) of this Act;\nthe relevant offence is taken to be punishable on conviction by a\nfine not exceeding 5 penalty units.\n\nEnforcement and remedies  Chapter 5\nEnforcement and remedies  Part VI\nOrders relating to acquisitions  Division 3\n\nSection 77D\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-77c-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-77c-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-77c-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d856523fb350eab5d2b70294d061cca1ec5d744a0fa7d615c6eb5b0498483d5a",
      "skos:note": "A person other than a body corporate is punishable by a fine not exceeding 5 penalty units if convicted of an offence against subsection 77A(1) or section 11.4 of the Criminal Code."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-77c",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "77C Application of section 77A to a person other than a body",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 330,
      "values:originalText": "corporate\n\nIf, as a result of the operation of Part 2.4 of the Criminal Code, a\nperson other than a body corporate is:\n\n(a) convicted of an offence (the relevant offence) against\nsubsection 77A(1) of this Act; or\n\n(b) convicted of an offence (the relevant offence) against\nsection 11.4 of the Criminal Code in relation to an offence\nreferred to in subsection 77A(1) of this Act;\nthe relevant offence is taken to be punishable on conviction by a\nfine not exceeding 5 penalty units.\n\nEnforcement and remedies  Chapter 5\nEnforcement and remedies  Part VI\nOrders relating to acquisitions  Division 3\n\nSection 77D\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026"
    },
