    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-79",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "79 Offences against section 45AF or 45AG",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-79"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.333",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person who:\n\n(aa) attempts to contravene; or\n\n(a) aids, abets, counsels or procures a person to contravene; or\n\n(b) induces, or attempts to induce, a person (whether by threats\nor promises or otherwise) to contravene; or\n\n(c) is in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in,\nor party to, the contravention by a person of; or\n\n(d) conspires with others to contravene;\na cartel offence provision is taken to have contravened that\nprovision and is punishable:\n\n(e) in a case where:\n\n(i) the provision is a cartel offence provision; and\n\n(ii) the person is not a body corporate;\n\nChapter 5  Enforcement and remedies",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A person who:\n\n(aa) attempts to contravene; or\n\n(a) aids, abets, counsels or procures a person to contravene; or\n\n(b) induces, or attempts to induce, a person (whether by threats\nor promises or otherwise) to contravene; or\n\n(c) is in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in,\nor party to, the contravention by a person of; or\n\n(d) conspires with others to contravene;\na cartel offence provision is taken to have contravened that\nprovision and is punishable:\n\n(e) in a case where:\n\n(i) the provision is a cartel offence provision; and\n\n(ii) the person is not a body corporate;\n\nChapter 5  Enforcement and remedies",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-79-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-79-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-79-logic-deontic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-79-logic-deontic-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-79-logic-deontic-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "80dc24f0c0419293315f20e5f4b449ab67dc88449bc87bfcb005885a38c9fe92",
      "skos:note": "Aiding, abetting, or inducing a person to contravene a provision is punishable."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-79",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "79 Offences against section 45AF or 45AG",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 333,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person who:\n\n(aa) attempts to contravene; or\n\n(a) aids, abets, counsels or procures a person to contravene; or\n\n(b) induces, or attempts to induce, a person (whether by threats\nor promises or otherwise) to contravene; or\n\n(c) is in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in,\nor party to, the contravention by a person of; or\n\n(d) conspires with others to contravene;\na cartel offence provision is taken to have contravened that\nprovision and is punishable:\n\n(e) in a case where:\n\n(i) the provision is a cartel offence provision; and\n\n(ii) the person is not a body corporate;\n\nChapter 5  Enforcement and remedies"
    },
