      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.342",
      "values:originalText": "(2) An order staying the operation of the injunction may be expressed\nto have effect for a specified period and may be varied or rescinded\nby the Court at any time.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) An order staying the operation of the injunction may be expressed\nto have effect for a specified period and may be varied or rescinded\nby the Court at any time.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-80ab"
