      "skos:note": "Court may vary or rescind order staying injunction operation"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-80ab-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "80AB(2) Stay of injunctions",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 342,
      "values:originalText": "(2) An order staying the operation of the injunction may be expressed\nto have effect for a specified period and may be varied or rescinded\nby the Court at any time."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-80ab-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
