      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.344",
      "values:originalText": "false or misleading information\n\nIf, on the application of the Commission, the Federal Court is\nsatisfied that:\n\n(a) a person is proposing to put an acquisition into effect; and\n\n(b) the Commission made an acquisition determination under\nparagraph 51ABZE(1)(a) or 51ABZW(1)(a) in respect of a\nnotification of the acquisition on the basis of information that\nwas false or misleading in a material particular; and\n\n(c) the information was material to the Commission making the\ndetermination; and\n\n(d) that information was given by:\n\n(i) the person; or\n\n(ii) if the person is a body corporate—a body corporate that\nwas related to the person; and\n\n(e) apart from the determination, putting the acquisition into\neffect would contravene Subdivision B of Division 1A of",
      "skos:definition": "false or misleading information\n\nIf, on the application of the Commission, the Federal Court is\nsatisfied that:\n\n(a) a person is proposing to put an acquisition into effect; and\n\n(b) the Commission made an acquisition determination under\nparagraph 51ABZE(1)(a) or 51ABZW(1)(a) in respect of a\nnotification of the acquisition on the basis of information that\nwas false or misleading in a material particular; and\n\n(c) the information was material to the Commission making the\ndetermination; and\n\n(d) that information was given by:\n\n(i) the person; or\n\n(ii) if the person is a body corporate—a body corporate that\nwas related to the person; and\n\n(e) apart from the determination, putting the acquisition into\neffect would contravene Subdivision B of Division 1A of",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-80ad-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-80ad-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f8be8e72058f3d8611985ab1daf96bdf78f0185ce3789f1d63ba299ea65b5542",
      "skos:note": "Acquisition into effect if Commission made determination based on false or misleading information"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-80ad",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "80AD Injunctions if acquisition determinations made on the basis of",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 344,
      "values:originalText": "false or misleading information\n\nIf, on the application of the Commission, the Federal Court is\nsatisfied that:\n\n(a) a person is proposing to put an acquisition into effect; and\n\n(b) the Commission made an acquisition determination under\nparagraph 51ABZE(1)(a) or 51ABZW(1)(a) in respect of a\nnotification of the acquisition on the basis of information that\nwas false or misleading in a material particular; and\n\n(c) the information was material to the Commission making the\ndetermination; and\n\n(d) that information was given by:\n\n(i) the person; or\n\n(ii) if the person is a body corporate—a body corporate that\nwas related to the person; and\n\n(e) apart from the determination, putting the acquisition into\neffect would contravene Subdivision B of Division 1A of"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-80ad-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-80ad"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
