      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Acquirer must ensure that the acquisition would not have contravened section 50 without the authorization.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Apart from the authorisation, the acquisition would have contravened section 50.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The acquirer must ensure that the acquisition would not have contravened section 50."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-81a-ss-1-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Court must ensure that the authorisation would not have been granted without the false information.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "If that information had not been given, the authorisation would not have been granted.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The Court must ensure that the authorisation would not have been granted."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-81a-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "81A(2) Divestiture where merger done under authorisation granted on",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-81a-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.346",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Court may, on the application of the Commission, by order,\ngive directions for the purpose of securing the disposal of all or any\nof those shares or assets by the acquirer, the related body corporate\nor any other body corporate that is related to the acquirer.\nDeclaration that acquisition void—when vendor involved",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Court may, on the application of the Commission, by order,\ngive directions for the purpose of securing the disposal of all or any\nof those shares or assets by the acquirer, the related body corporate\nor any other body corporate that is related to the acquirer.\nDeclaration that acquisition void—when vendor involved",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-81a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-81a-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-81a-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6d2b4df2bcccaa6b1188e2d1d2ad6689b977d392bb9caa76286a5abf6753e554",
      "skos:note": "Court may give directions for securing disposal of shares or assets."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-81a-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "81A(2) Divestiture where merger done under authorisation granted on",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 346,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Court may, on the application of the Commission, by order,\ngive directions for the purpose of securing the disposal of all or any\nof those shares or assets by the acquirer, the related body corporate\nor any other body corporate that is related to the acquirer.\nDeclaration that acquisition void—when vendor involved"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-81a-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-81a-ss-2"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
