      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-81a-ss-2-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "may",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Implies obligation",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-81a-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "81A(4) Divestiture where merger done under authorisation granted on",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-81a-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.346",
      "values:originalText": "(4) In addition to being satisfied of the matters in subsection (1), if the\nCourt, or another court, has found that the person (the vendor)\nfrom whom the acquirer acquired the shares or assets was involved\nin the contravention referred to in paragraph (1)(d), then the Court\nmay, on the application of the Commission, by order, declare that\nthe acquisition, in so far as it relates to those shares or assets, is\nvoid as from the day on which it occurred.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) In addition to being satisfied of the matters in subsection (1), if the\nCourt, or another court, has found that the person (the vendor)\nfrom whom the acquirer acquired the shares or assets was involved\nin the contravention referred to in paragraph (1)(d), then the Court\nmay, on the application of the Commission, by order, declare that\nthe acquisition, in so far as it relates to those shares or assets, is\nvoid as from the day on which it occurred.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-81a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-81a-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-81a-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "710a740686e3b11b7d5dc5658ac9bbf3275e447488cf7ba0bdb87d40d89f2180",
      "skos:note": "Acquisition of shares or assets void if vendor involved in contravention"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-81a-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "81A(4) Divestiture where merger done under authorisation granted on",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 346,
      "values:originalText": "(4) In addition to being satisfied of the matters in subsection (1), if the\nCourt, or another court, has found that the person (the vendor)\nfrom whom the acquirer acquired the shares or assets was involved\nin the contravention referred to in paragraph (1)(d), then the Court\nmay, on the application of the Commission, by order, declare that\nthe acquisition, in so far as it relates to those shares or assets, is\nvoid as from the day on which it occurred."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-81a-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-81a-ss-4"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-81a-ss-4-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibit",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibits acquisition of shares or assets",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Vendor involved in contravention",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Acquisition void"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-81a-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "81A(5) Divestiture where merger done under authorisation granted on",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-81a-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.346",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If the Court makes an order under subsection (4), then:\n\n(a) the shares or assets to which the declaration relates are taken\nnot to have been disposed of by the vendor; and\n\n(b) the vendor must refund to the acquirer any amount paid to\nthe vendor for acquiring the shares or assets.\nAlternative to orders under subsections (2) and (4)",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If the Court makes an order under subsection (4), then:\n\n(a) the shares or assets to which the declaration relates are taken\nnot to have been disposed of by the vendor; and\n\n(b) the vendor must refund to the acquirer any amount paid to\nthe vendor for acquiring the shares or assets.\nAlternative to orders under subsections (2) and (4)",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-81a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-81a-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-81a-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6ac6d1c847f860a19d17ea9e15f53183b468de6431a72359d117fad52bef4e02",
      "skos:note": "Vendor must refund amount paid to acquirer for acquired shares or assets."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-81a-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "81A(5) Divestiture where merger done under authorisation granted on",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 346,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If the Court makes an order under subsection (4), then:\n\n(a) the shares or assets to which the declaration relates are taken\nnot to have been disposed of by the vendor; and\n\n(b) the vendor must refund to the acquirer any amount paid to\nthe vendor for acquiring the shares or assets.\nAlternative to orders under subsections (2) and (4)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-81a-ss-5-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
