      "values:originalText": "(1) A person who suffers loss or damage by conduct of another person\nthat was done in contravention of:\n\n(a) a provision of Part IV, IVB, IVBA, IVBB or IVE; or\n\n(b) section 55B, 60C or 60K; or\n\n(c) subsection 56BN(1), 56BO(1) or 56BU(1), section 56BZA,\n56BZB or 56BZC, subsection 56BZD(1) or 56BZI(1) or\nsection 56BZJ; or\n\nEnforcement and remedies  Chapter 5\nEnforcement and remedies  Part VI\nOther provisions  Division 5\n\nSection 82\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(ca) a civil penalty provision of a gas market instrument; or\n\n(d) a civil penalty provision of the consumer data rules;\nmay recover the amount of the loss or damage by action against\nthat other person or against any person involved in the\ncontravention."
