    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-86",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "86 Jurisdiction of courts",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-86"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.355",
      "values:originalText": "(1AA) A reference in this section to this Act, or to a Part, Division or\nsection of this Act, is a reference to this Act, or to that Part,\nDivision or section, as it has effect as a law of the Commonwealth.\n\n(1) Jurisdiction is conferred on the Federal Court in any matter arising\nunder this Act, a gas market instrument or the consumer data rules\nin respect of which a civil proceeding has, whether before or after\nthe commencement of this section, been instituted under this Part.\n\n(1A) Jurisdiction is conferred on the Federal Circuit and Family Court of\nAustralia (Division 2) in any matter arising under section 46,\nPart IVB or IVBB, section 55B, subsection 56BO(1) or 56BU(1),\nsection 56BZA, 56BZB or 56BZC, subsection 56BZD(1),\nsection 56BZJ, Part IVE, a civil penalty provision of a gas market\n\nChapter 5  Enforcement and remedies",
      "skos:definition": "(1AA) A reference in this section to this Act, or to a Part, Division or\nsection of this Act, is a reference to this Act, or to that Part,\nDivision or section, as it has effect as a law of the Commonwealth.\n\n(1) Jurisdiction is conferred on the Federal Court in any matter arising\nunder this Act, a gas market instrument or the consumer data rules\nin respect of which a civil proceeding has, whether before or after\nthe commencement of this section, been instituted under this Part.\n\n(1A) Jurisdiction is conferred on the Federal Circuit and Family Court of\nAustralia (Division 2) in any matter arising under section 46,\nPart IVB or IVBB, section 55B, subsection 56BO(1) or 56BU(1),\nsection 56BZA, 56BZB or 56BZC, subsection 56BZD(1),\nsection 56BZJ, Part IVE, a civil penalty provision of a gas market\n\nChapter 5  Enforcement and remedies",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-86-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-86-ss-1a"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "61f000da8615c2ad0e68a9274e7b0246ccc3b61892903104f6cad1bdf0e935a7"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-86",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "86 Jurisdiction of courts",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 355,
      "values:originalText": "(1AA) A reference in this section to this Act, or to a Part, Division or\nsection of this Act, is a reference to this Act, or to that Part,\nDivision or section, as it has effect as a law of the Commonwealth.\n\n(1) Jurisdiction is conferred on the Federal Court in any matter arising\nunder this Act, a gas market instrument or the consumer data rules\nin respect of which a civil proceeding has, whether before or after\nthe commencement of this section, been instituted under this Part.\n\n(1A) Jurisdiction is conferred on the Federal Circuit and Family Court of\nAustralia (Division 2) in any matter arising under section 46,\nPart IVB or IVBB, section 55B, subsection 56BO(1) or 56BU(1),\nsection 56BZA, 56BZB or 56BZC, subsection 56BZD(1),\nsection 56BZJ, Part IVE, a civil penalty provision of a gas market\n\nChapter 5  Enforcement and remedies"
    },
