      "skos:definition": "(1) Jurisdiction is conferred on the Federal Court in any matter arising\nunder this Act, a gas market instrument or the consumer data rules\nin respect of which a civil proceeding has, whether before or after\nthe commencement of this section, been instituted under this Part.",
