    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-86e",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "86E Order disqualifying a person from managing corporations",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-86e"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.361",
      "values:originalText": "(1) On application by the Commission, the Court may make an order\ndisqualifying a person from managing corporations for a period\nthat the Court considers appropriate if:\n\n(a) the Court is satisfied that the person has contravened, has\nattempted to contravene or has been involved in a\ncontravention of Part IV or IVE, subsection 56BN(1),\n56BO(1) or 56BU(1), section 56BZA, 56BZB or 56BZC,\nsubsection 56BZD(1) or 56BZI(1), section 56BZJ, a civil\npenalty provision of a gas market instrument, a civil penalty\nprovision of Part 5 of the Water Act 2007 or of the Water\nMarkets Intermediaries Code within the meaning of that Act,\nor a civil penalty provision of the consumer data rules; and\n\n(b) the Court is satisfied that the disqualification is justified.\n\nChapter 5  Enforcement and remedies",
      "skos:definition": "(1) On application by the Commission, the Court may make an order\ndisqualifying a person from managing corporations for a period\nthat the Court considers appropriate if:\n\n(a) the Court is satisfied that the person has contravened, has\nattempted to contravene or has been involved in a\ncontravention of Part IV or IVE, subsection 56BN(1),\n56BO(1) or 56BU(1), section 56BZA, 56BZB or 56BZC,\nsubsection 56BZD(1) or 56BZI(1), section 56BZJ, a civil\npenalty provision of a gas market instrument, a civil penalty\nprovision of Part 5 of the Water Act 2007 or of the Water\nMarkets Intermediaries Code within the meaning of that Act,\nor a civil penalty provision of the consumer data rules; and\n\n(b) the Court is satisfied that the disqualification is justified.\n\nChapter 5  Enforcement and remedies",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-86e-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-86e-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-86e-logic-deontic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-86e-logic-linearlogic-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "65a3d59f0f09288d43ad98e43714c3662cf06f968ddb1316c1606669d4743162",
      "skos:note": "Disqualification from managing corporations for contravention of certain laws."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-86e",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "86E Order disqualifying a person from managing corporations",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 361,
      "values:originalText": "(1) On application by the Commission, the Court may make an order\ndisqualifying a person from managing corporations for a period\nthat the Court considers appropriate if:\n\n(a) the Court is satisfied that the person has contravened, has\nattempted to contravene or has been involved in a\ncontravention of Part IV or IVE, subsection 56BN(1),\n56BO(1) or 56BU(1), section 56BZA, 56BZB or 56BZC,\nsubsection 56BZD(1) or 56BZI(1), section 56BZJ, a civil\npenalty provision of a gas market instrument, a civil penalty\nprovision of Part 5 of the Water Act 2007 or of the Water\nMarkets Intermediaries Code within the meaning of that Act,\nor a civil penalty provision of the consumer data rules; and\n\n(b) the Court is satisfied that the disqualification is justified.\n\nChapter 5  Enforcement and remedies"
    },
    {
