      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.378",
      "values:originalText": "smoking has the same meaning as in the Public Health (Tobacco\nand Other Products) Act 2023.\n\nEnforcement and remedies  Chapter 5\nClaims for damages or compensation for death or personal injury  Part VIB\nIntroduction  Division 1\n\nSection 87E\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\ntobacco product has the same meaning as in the Public Health\n(Tobacco and Other Products) Act 2023.",
      "skos:definition": "smoking has the same meaning as in the Public Health (Tobacco\nand Other Products) Act 2023.\n\nEnforcement and remedies  Chapter 5\nClaims for damages or compensation for death or personal injury  Part VIB\nIntroduction  Division 1\n\nSection 87E\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\ntobacco product has the same meaning as in the Public Health\n(Tobacco and Other Products) Act 2023.",
      "cml:asserts": [
