      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.379",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This Part applies to proceedings taken under the Australian\nConsumer Law:\n\n(a) that relate to Part 2-2, 3-3, 3-4 or 3-5, or Division 2 of",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This Part applies to proceedings taken under the Australian\nConsumer Law:\n\n(a) that relate to Part 2-2, 3-3, 3-4 or 3-5, or Division 2 of",
