      "values:originalText": "(1) This Part applies to proceedings taken under the Australian\nConsumer Law:\n\n(a) that relate to Part 2-2, 3-3, 3-4 or 3-5, or Division 2 of"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-87e-norm",
