    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-87h-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "87H(3) Long-stop period",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-87h-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.383",
      "values:originalText": "(3) In considering whether to extend the period, the court must have\nregard to the justice of the case, and, in particular, must have\nregard to:\n\n(a) whether the passage of time has prejudiced a fair trial; and\n\n(b) the nature and extent of the person’s loss or damage; and\n\n(c) the nature of the defendant’s conduct alleged to have caused\nthe death or injury; and\n\n(d) the nature of the defendant’s conduct since the alleged act or\nomission.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) In considering whether to extend the period, the court must have\nregard to the justice of the case, and, in particular, must have\nregard to:\n\n(a) whether the passage of time has prejudiced a fair trial; and\n\n(b) the nature and extent of the person’s loss or damage; and\n\n(c) the nature of the defendant’s conduct alleged to have caused\nthe death or injury; and\n\n(d) the nature of the defendant’s conduct since the alleged act or\nomission.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-87h"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-87h-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-87h-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-87h-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-87h-ss-3-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-87h-ss-3-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-87h-ss-3-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ffc1e0a13f6bf8c5f96e8f1e65b7a2266fe369b0f5a7c34e09839edfa417c3d9",
      "skos:note": "Court must consider justice of case when extending period."
    },
    {
