    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-87k-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "87K(2) The effect of close relationships",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-87k-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.384",
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of subparagraph (1)(b)(ii), a person is taken to be\nin a close relationship with a parent or guardian of the victim if the\nperson’s relationship with the parent or guardian is such that:\n\n(a) the person might influence the parent or guardian not to bring\na claim on behalf of the victim against the person; or\n\n(b) the victim might be unwilling to disclose to the parent or\nguardian the acts, omissions or events in respect of which the\ncause of action is founded.\n\nEnforcement and remedies  Chapter 5\nClaims for damages or compensation for death or personal injury  Part VIB\nLimits on personal injury damages for non-economic loss  Division 3\n\nSection 87L\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(2) For the purposes of subparagraph (1)(b)(ii), a person is taken to be\nin a close relationship with a parent or guardian of the victim if the\nperson’s relationship with the parent or guardian is such that:\n\n(a) the person might influence the parent or guardian not to bring\na claim on behalf of the victim against the person; or\n\n(b) the victim might be unwilling to disclose to the parent or\nguardian the acts, omissions or events in respect of which the\ncause of action is founded.\n\nEnforcement and remedies  Chapter 5\nClaims for damages or compensation for death or personal injury  Part VIB\nLimits on personal injury damages for non-economic loss  Division 3\n\nSection 87L\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-87k"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-87k-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-87k-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-87k-ss-2-logic-deontic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-87k-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-87k-ss-2-logic-ltl-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-87k-ss-2-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e3ee9a4877dacb80fdd2592f64af2c8afb9f3fe8d0ef1a59eaaa6737b32a3dd2",
      "skos:note": "A person is taken to be in a close relationship with a parent or guardian if they might influence the parent or guardian not to bring a claim on behalf of the victim."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-87k-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "87K(2) The effect of close relationships",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 384,
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of subparagraph (1)(b)(ii), a person is taken to be\nin a close relationship with a parent or guardian of the victim if the\nperson’s relationship with the parent or guardian is such that:\n\n(a) the person might influence the parent or guardian not to bring\na claim on behalf of the victim against the person; or\n\n(b) the victim might be unwilling to disclose to the parent or\nguardian the acts, omissions or events in respect of which the\ncause of action is founded.\n\nEnforcement and remedies  Chapter 5\nClaims for damages or compensation for death or personal injury  Part VIB\nLimits on personal injury damages for non-economic loss  Division 3\n\nSection 87L\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-87k-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-87k-ss-2"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-87k-ss-2-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Might",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Influence or not to influence",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Person's relationship with parent or guardian might affect the parent or guardian's decision.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The person is taken to be in a close relationship if they might influence the parent or guardian."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-87k-ss-2-logic-deontic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Might",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Victim's willingness to disclose",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The victim might be unwilling to disclose acts, omissions, or events to the parent or guardian.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The person is taken to be in a close relationship if the victim might be unwilling to disclose."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-87k-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Between",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Temporal interval between influence and disclosure",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "There is a temporal interval between when the person might influence the parent or guardian and when the victim might be unwilling to disclose.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The time period between these events is relevant to the classification of close relationships."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-87k-ss-2-logic-ltl-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Recurring",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Recurring trace of influence and disclosure",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "This pattern of influence and disclosure might be recurring in similar situations.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The person's actions might create a recurring trace that affects the classification of close relationships."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-87k-ss-2-logic-cogai-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:CogAI"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Recognizes",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Pattern recognition in influence and disclosure",
      "cml:executionSurface": "sparql_library::parsers::chk_parser",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "This pattern of influence and disclosure is recognized as relevant to the classification of close relationships.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The system recognizes this pattern as a key factor in determining close relationships."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-87l",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "87L Limits on damages for non-economic loss",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
