      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.385",
      "values:originalText": "A court must not, in a proceeding to which this Part applies, award\nas personal injury damages for non-economic loss an amount that\nexceeds the amount (if any) permitted under this Division.",
      "skos:definition": "A court must not, in a proceeding to which this Part applies, award\nas personal injury damages for non-economic loss an amount that\nexceeds the amount (if any) permitted under this Division.",
      "cml:asserts": [
