    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-87p-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "87P(2) Most extreme cases",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-87p-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.386",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The applicable percentage is the extent of the non-economic loss\nthe plaintiff suffers, expressed as a percentage of a most extreme\ncase.\n87R  Cases of 15% or more (but less than 33%) of a most extreme\ncase\n\nIf the non-economic loss the plaintiff suffers is at least 15%, but\nless than 33%, of a most extreme case, the court must not award as\npersonal injury damages for non-economic loss an amount that\nexceeds the amount set out in the following table:\n\nCases of 15% or more (but less than 33%) of a most extreme case\nItem\nSeverity of the non-economic\nloss (as a proportion of a most\nextreme case)\nDamages for non-economic loss (as a\nproportion of the maximum amount\nof damages for non-economic loss)\n15%\n1%\n16%",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The applicable percentage is the extent of the non-economic loss\nthe plaintiff suffers, expressed as a percentage of a most extreme\ncase.\n87R  Cases of 15% or more (but less than 33%) of a most extreme\ncase\n\nIf the non-economic loss the plaintiff suffers is at least 15%, but\nless than 33%, of a most extreme case, the court must not award as\npersonal injury damages for non-economic loss an amount that\nexceeds the amount set out in the following table:\n\nCases of 15% or more (but less than 33%) of a most extreme case\nItem\nSeverity of the non-economic\nloss (as a proportion of a most\nextreme case)\nDamages for non-economic loss (as a\nproportion of the maximum amount\nof damages for non-economic loss)\n15%\n1%\n16%",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-87p"
      },
