    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-89-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "89(2) Procedure for applications and the keeping of a register",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-89-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.400",
      "values:originalText": "(2) If the Commission receives an application referred to in\nsubsection (1), the Commission must cause notice of the receipt of\nthat application to be made public in such manner as it thinks fit.\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nAuthorisations and notifications  Part VII\nAuthorisations  Division 1\n\nSection 89\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(2) If the Commission receives an application referred to in\nsubsection (1), the Commission must cause notice of the receipt of\nthat application to be made public in such manner as it thinks fit.\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nAuthorisations and notifications  Part VII\nAuthorisations  Division 1\n\nSection 89\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-89"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-89-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-89-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8c1eaf2cf9d6e9a70605fc1860fd4a622bbbdecf5dc5175ad69ad78f6cdb097b",
      "skos:note": "Public notice of application receipt"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-89-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "89(2) Procedure for applications and the keeping of a register",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 400,
      "values:originalText": "(2) If the Commission receives an application referred to in\nsubsection (1), the Commission must cause notice of the receipt of\nthat application to be made public in such manner as it thinks fit.\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nAuthorisations and notifications  Part VII\nAuthorisations  Division 1\n\nSection 89\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-89-ss-2-norm",
