        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) If the Commission receives an application...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The Commission must cause notice of the receipt of that application to be made public."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-89-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "89(3) Procedure for applications and the keeping of a register",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-89-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.400",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Commission must keep a register of:\n\n(a) applications for authorisations; and\n\n(b) applications for minor variations of authorisations; and\n\n(c) applications for, or the Commission’s proposals for, the\nrevocation of authorisations; and\n\n(d) applications for, or the Commission’s proposals for, the\nrevocation of authorisations and the substitution of other\nauthorisations;\nincluding applications that have been withdrawn or proposals that\nhave been abandoned.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Commission must keep a register of:\n\n(a) applications for authorisations; and\n\n(b) applications for minor variations of authorisations; and\n\n(c) applications for, or the Commission’s proposals for, the\nrevocation of authorisations; and\n\n(d) applications for, or the Commission’s proposals for, the\nrevocation of authorisations and the substitution of other\nauthorisations;\nincluding applications that have been withdrawn or proposals that\nhave been abandoned.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-89"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-89-ss-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "99ebe3192e3aa527ede9e9b51dccd8264877fb5d60fdc49734cfaefeb7b490b3",
      "skos:note": "Register of applications for authorisations and revocations."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-89-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "89(3) Procedure for applications and the keeping of a register",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 400,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Commission must keep a register of:\n\n(a) applications for authorisations; and\n\n(b) applications for minor variations of authorisations; and\n\n(c) applications for, or the Commission’s proposals for, the\nrevocation of authorisations; and\n\n(d) applications for, or the Commission’s proposals for, the\nrevocation of authorisations and the substitution of other\nauthorisations;\nincluding applications that have been withdrawn or proposals that\nhave been abandoned."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-89-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-89-ss-3"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-89-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "89(4) Procedure for applications and the keeping of a register",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-89-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.400",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Subject to this section, the register kept under subsection (3) shall\ninclude:\n\n(a) any document furnished to the Commission in relation to an\napplication or proposal referred to in subsection (3);\n\n(aa) any draft determination, and any summary of reasons, by the\nCommission that is furnished to a person under section 90A,\nor under that section as applied by section 91C;\n\n(ab) any record of a conference made in accordance with\nsubsection 90A(8), or with that subsection as applied by\nsection 91C, and any certificate in relation to a conference\ngiven under subsection 90A(9), or under that subsection as so\napplied;\n\n(b) particulars of any oral submission made to the Commission\nin relation to such an application or proposal; and\n\n(c) the determination of the Commission on such an application\nor proposal and the statement of the reasons given by the\nCommission for that determination.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Subject to this section, the register kept under subsection (3) shall\ninclude:\n\n(a) any document furnished to the Commission in relation to an\napplication or proposal referred to in subsection (3);\n\n(aa) any draft determination, and any summary of reasons, by the\nCommission that is furnished to a person under section 90A,\nor under that section as applied by section 91C;\n\n(ab) any record of a conference made in accordance with\nsubsection 90A(8), or with that subsection as applied by\nsection 91C, and any certificate in relation to a conference\ngiven under subsection 90A(9), or under that subsection as so\napplied;\n\n(b) particulars of any oral submission made to the Commission\nin relation to such an application or proposal; and\n\n(c) the determination of the Commission on such an application\nor proposal and the statement of the reasons given by the\nCommission for that determination.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-89"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-89-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-89-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "79aadb891c3fc8a48a2b5a7f51833699d95d6e3d82637a70f65df258406ab7a7",
      "skos:note": "The register must include certain documents and information.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-89-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "89(4) Procedure for applications and the keeping of a register",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 400,
      "values:originalText": "(4) Subject to this section, the register kept under subsection (3) shall\ninclude:\n\n(a) any document furnished to the Commission in relation to an\napplication or proposal referred to in subsection (3);\n\n(aa) any draft determination, and any summary of reasons, by the\nCommission that is furnished to a person under section 90A,\nor under that section as applied by section 91C;\n\n(ab) any record of a conference made in accordance with\nsubsection 90A(8), or with that subsection as applied by\nsection 91C, and any certificate in relation to a conference\ngiven under subsection 90A(9), or under that subsection as so\napplied;\n\n(b) particulars of any oral submission made to the Commission\nin relation to such an application or proposal; and\n\n(c) the determination of the Commission on such an application\nor proposal and the statement of the reasons given by the\nCommission for that determination."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-89-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
