      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.408",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If:\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nAuthorisations and notifications  Part VII\nAuthorisations  Division 1\n\nSection 90A\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(a) the draft determination provides for the granting of the\napplication unconditionally; and\n\n(b) no person has made a written submission to the Commission\nopposing the application;\neach notice by the Commission under subsection (2) shall inform\nthe person to whom the notice is sent that the draft determination\nso provides.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If:\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nAuthorisations and notifications  Part VII\nAuthorisations  Division 1\n\nSection 90A\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(a) the draft determination provides for the granting of the\napplication unconditionally; and\n\n(b) no person has made a written submission to the Commission\nopposing the application;\neach notice by the Commission under subsection (2) shall inform\nthe person to whom the notice is sent that the draft determination\nso provides.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-90a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-90a-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-90a-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3537957d8417c3af770a53da42cf78d0f6a6ec6310c841229584adaa8a528850",
      "skos:note": "Commission must inform applicant of draft determination"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-90a-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "90A(3) Commission to afford opportunity for conference before",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 408,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If:\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nAuthorisations and notifications  Part VII\nAuthorisations  Division 1\n\nSection 90A\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(a) the draft determination provides for the granting of the\napplication unconditionally; and\n\n(b) no person has made a written submission to the Commission\nopposing the application;\neach notice by the Commission under subsection (2) shall inform\nthe person to whom the notice is sent that the draft determination\nso provides."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-90a-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
