    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-90a-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "90A(5) Commission to afford opportunity for conference before",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-90a-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.408",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If each of the persons to whom a notice was sent under\nsubsection (2):\n\n(a) notifies the Commission within the period of 14 days\nmentioned in that subsection that he or she does not wish the\nCommission to hold a conference in relation to the draft\ndetermination; or\n\n(b) does not notify the Commission within that period that he or\nshe wishes the Commission to hold such a conference;\nthe Commission may make the determination at any time after the\nexpiration of that period.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If each of the persons to whom a notice was sent under\nsubsection (2):\n\n(a) notifies the Commission within the period of 14 days\nmentioned in that subsection that he or she does not wish the\nCommission to hold a conference in relation to the draft\ndetermination; or\n\n(b) does not notify the Commission within that period that he or\nshe wishes the Commission to hold such a conference;\nthe Commission may make the determination at any time after the\nexpiration of that period.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-90a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-90a-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-90a-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-90a-ss-5-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c95ddfcc7c9cd1418ab1c4f0402855b1bb7f6872eba7cbef1024c03d4ab0b1b1",
      "skos:note": "Failure to notify within 14 days allows Commission to make determination without conference."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-90a-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "90A(5) Commission to afford opportunity for conference before",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 408,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If each of the persons to whom a notice was sent under\nsubsection (2):\n\n(a) notifies the Commission within the period of 14 days\nmentioned in that subsection that he or she does not wish the\nCommission to hold a conference in relation to the draft\ndetermination; or\n\n(b) does not notify the Commission within that period that he or\nshe wishes the Commission to hold such a conference;\nthe Commission may make the determination at any time after the\nexpiration of that period.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions"
    },
    {
