      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-90b-ss-1-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "RelyOn",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Commission may rely on consultations undertaken by the AEMC.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) an application under section 88, 91A, 91B or 91C is made in\nrelation to the National Electricity Rules or a provision of the\nRules; and\n\n(b) the AEMC has done the following:\n\n(i) published the Rules or the provision and invited people\nto make submissions to it on the Rules or the provision;\n\n(ii) specified the effect of subsection (2) when it published\nthe Rules or the provision;\n\n(iii) considered any submissions that were received within\nthe time limit specified by it when it published the Rules\nor the provision.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) an application under section 88, 91A, 91B or 91C is made in\nrelation to the National Electricity Rules or a provision of the\nRules; and\n\n(b) the AEMC has done the following:\n\n(i) published the Rules or the provision and invited people\nto make submissions to it on the Rules or the provision;\n\n(ii) specified the effect of subsection (2) when it published\nthe Rules or the provision;\n\n(iii) considered any submissions that were received within\nthe time limit specified by it when it published the Rules\nor the provision."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-90b-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "90B(2) Commission may rely on consultations undertaken by the",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-90b-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.412",
      "values:originalText": "(2) In making a determination under section 90, 91A, 91B or 91C:\n\n(a) the Commission may rely on the process mentioned in\nparagraph (1)(b), instead of undertaking the process\nmentioned in section 90A, subsection 91A(2), 91B(2) or\n91C(2) or (5); and\n\n(b) the Commission may take into account:\n\n(i) any submissions mentioned in subparagraph (1)(b)(iii);\nand\n\n(ii) any submissions, in respect of the application, made by\nthe AEMC; and\n\n(c) despite subsection 90(6A), the Commission may disregard\nany submissions, in relation to the application, made by the\nCommonwealth, by a State or Territory, or by any other\nperson (other than the AEMC).",
      "skos:definition": "(2) In making a determination under section 90, 91A, 91B or 91C:\n\n(a) the Commission may rely on the process mentioned in\nparagraph (1)(b), instead of undertaking the process\nmentioned in section 90A, subsection 91A(2), 91B(2) or\n91C(2) or (5); and\n\n(b) the Commission may take into account:\n\n(i) any submissions mentioned in subparagraph (1)(b)(iii);\nand\n\n(ii) any submissions, in respect of the application, made by\nthe AEMC; and\n\n(c) despite subsection 90(6A), the Commission may disregard\nany submissions, in relation to the application, made by the\nCommonwealth, by a State or Territory, or by any other\nperson (other than the AEMC).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-90b"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-90b-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-90b-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a76b61b21667cc9379ef571024243a4c5f53bab4dd6bca27c229d1e69467dfb2",
      "skos:note": "Commission may rely on consultations undertaken by the AEMC."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-90b-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "90B(2) Commission may rely on consultations undertaken by the",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 412,
      "values:originalText": "(2) In making a determination under section 90, 91A, 91B or 91C:\n\n(a) the Commission may rely on the process mentioned in\nparagraph (1)(b), instead of undertaking the process\nmentioned in section 90A, subsection 91A(2), 91B(2) or\n91C(2) or (5); and\n\n(b) the Commission may take into account:\n\n(i) any submissions mentioned in subparagraph (1)(b)(iii);\nand\n\n(ii) any submissions, in respect of the application, made by\nthe AEMC; and\n\n(c) despite subsection 90(6A), the Commission may disregard\nany submissions, in relation to the application, made by the\nCommonwealth, by a State or Territory, or by any other\nperson (other than the AEMC)."
    },
