    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-90b-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "90B(3) Commission may rely on consultations undertaken by the",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-90b-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.412",
      "values:originalText": "(3) In this section:\nNational Electricity Rules means:\n\n(a) the National Electricity Rules, as in force from time to time,\nmade under the National Electricity Law set out in the\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nAuthorisations and notifications  Part VII\nAuthorisations  Division 1\n\nSection 91\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nSchedule to the National Electricity (South Australia)\nAct 1996 of South Australia; or\n\n(b) those Rules as they apply as a law of another State; or\n\n(c) those Rules as they apply as a law of a Territory; or\n\n(d) those Rules as they apply as a law of the Commonwealth.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) In this section:\nNational Electricity Rules means:\n\n(a) the National Electricity Rules, as in force from time to time,\nmade under the National Electricity Law set out in the\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nAuthorisations and notifications  Part VII\nAuthorisations  Division 1\n\nSection 91\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nSchedule to the National Electricity (South Australia)\nAct 1996 of South Australia; or\n\n(b) those Rules as they apply as a law of another State; or\n\n(c) those Rules as they apply as a law of a Territory; or\n\n(d) those Rules as they apply as a law of the Commonwealth.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-90b"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
