      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.418",
      "values:originalText": "(3A) Subsection 90(6) (other than paragraph 90(6)(a)) applies in relation\nto an application for a revocation of an authorisation in a\ncorresponding way to the way in which it applies in relation to an\napplication for an authorisation.",
      "skos:definition": "(3A) Subsection 90(6) (other than paragraph 90(6)(a)) applies in relation\nto an application for a revocation of an authorisation in a\ncorresponding way to the way in which it applies in relation to an\napplication for an authorisation.",
