    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-91b-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "91B(5) Revocation of an authorisation",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-91b-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.418",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If an objection to revoking the authorisation is included in any\nsubmission or information:\n\n(a) referred to in subsection (4); and\n\n(b) received by the Commission within the period (if any)\nreferred to in that subsection;\nthe Commission must not make a determination revoking the\nauthorisation unless the Commission is satisfied that it would, if\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If an objection to revoking the authorisation is included in any\nsubmission or information:\n\n(a) referred to in subsection (4); and\n\n(b) received by the Commission within the period (if any)\nreferred to in that subsection;\nthe Commission must not make a determination revoking the\nauthorisation unless the Commission is satisfied that it would, if\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-91b"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-91b-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-91b-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "657328d654cf1a7813237aab7dbe44f808e5e17937bb5cb27b88c5a1f491c479",
      "skos:note": "Commission must not make a determination revoking the authorisation unless satisfied."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-91b-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "91B(5) Revocation of an authorisation",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 418,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If an objection to revoking the authorisation is included in any\nsubmission or information:\n\n(a) referred to in subsection (4); and\n\n(b) received by the Commission within the period (if any)\nreferred to in that subsection;\nthe Commission must not make a determination revoking the\nauthorisation unless the Commission is satisfied that it would, if\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-91b-ss-5-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-91b-ss-5"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
