    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-91c-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "91C(4) Revocation of an authorisation and substitution of a",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-91c-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.420",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Commission may make a determination in writing revoking\nthe authorisation and granting a substitute authorisation that it\nconsiders appropriate, or deciding not to revoke the authorisation,\nafter taking into account the following:\n\n(a) if subsection (2) applies—the application;\n\n(b) any submissions that are received within the period specified\nunder paragraph (2)(c) or (3)(f);\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The Commission may make a determination in writing revoking\nthe authorisation and granting a substitute authorisation that it\nconsiders appropriate, or deciding not to revoke the authorisation,\nafter taking into account the following:\n\n(a) if subsection (2) applies—the application;\n\n(b) any submissions that are received within the period specified\nunder paragraph (2)(c) or (3)(f);\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-91c"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-91c-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-91c-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1f97ed3216008c39b61cc1516d2a6ca68e18bfc17c4c27feafdf4c74c7e45ff5",
      "skos:note": "Commission may revoke or substitute an authorisation after considering submissions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-91c-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "91C(4) Revocation of an authorisation and substitution of a",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 420,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Commission may make a determination in writing revoking\nthe authorisation and granting a substitute authorisation that it\nconsiders appropriate, or deciding not to revoke the authorisation,\nafter taking into account the following:\n\n(a) if subsection (2) applies—the application;\n\n(b) any submissions that are received within the period specified\nunder paragraph (2)(c) or (3)(f);\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-91c-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-91c-ss-4"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-91c-ss-4-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "may",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Permission to revoke or substitute an authorisation.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Commission has the authority to make a determination.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Revocation or substitution is permitted."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-92",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "92 Providing false or misleading information",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-92"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.423",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person must not give information to the Commission or Tribunal\nunder this Division or Part IX in connection with any of the\nfollowing if the person is negligent as to whether the information is\nfalse or misleading in a material particular:\n\n(a) an application for a merger authorisation;\n\n(b) an application for a minor variation of a merger\nauthorisation;\n\n(c) an application for, or the Commission’s proposal for, the\nrevocation of a merger authorisation;\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A person must not give information to the Commission or Tribunal\nunder this Division or Part IX in connection with any of the\nfollowing if the person is negligent as to whether the information is\nfalse or misleading in a material particular:\n\n(a) an application for a merger authorisation;\n\n(b) an application for a minor variation of a merger\nauthorisation;\n\n(c) an application for, or the Commission’s proposal for, the\nrevocation of a merger authorisation;\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-92-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-92-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "557068af69bc7ad1fee4156ab97d740a39c1c5ff6a882d30b4b69ecedf86afdf",
      "skos:note": "Providing false or misleading information in merger authorisation applications"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-92",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "92 Providing false or misleading information",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 423,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person must not give information to the Commission or Tribunal\nunder this Division or Part IX in connection with any of the\nfollowing if the person is negligent as to whether the information is\nfalse or misleading in a material particular:\n\n(a) an application for a merger authorisation;\n\n(b) an application for a minor variation of a merger\nauthorisation;\n\n(c) an application for, or the Commission’s proposal for, the\nrevocation of a merger authorisation;\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-92-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-92"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:NaturalPerson"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: NaturalPerson"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-92-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Must Not",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibition of providing false or misleading information",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Negligence in providing information",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Prohibition"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-92a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "92A Definitions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-92a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
