      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.428",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Commission must give the person who applied for the\nauthorisation written notice stating:\n\n(a) that the authorisation is varied; and\n\n(b) details of the variation; and\n\n(c) the date on which the variation takes effect.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The Commission must give the person who applied for the\nauthorisation written notice stating:\n\n(a) that the authorisation is varied; and\n\n(b) details of the variation; and\n\n(c) the date on which the variation takes effect.",
