    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-93-ss-1a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "93(1A) Notification of exclusive dealing or resale price maintenance",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-93-ss-1a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.431",
      "values:originalText": "(1A) To be valid, a notice under subsection (1) must:\n\n(a) be in a form approved by the Commission in writing and\ncontain the information required by the form; and\n\n(b) be accompanied by any other information or documents\nprescribed by the regulations; and\n\n(c) be accompanied by the fee (if any) prescribed by the\nregulations.",
      "skos:definition": "(1A) To be valid, a notice under subsection (1) must:\n\n(a) be in a form approved by the Commission in writing and\ncontain the information required by the form; and\n\n(b) be accompanied by any other information or documents\nprescribed by the regulations; and\n\n(c) be accompanied by the fee (if any) prescribed by the\nregulations.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-93"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-93-ss-1a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-93-ss-1a-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "efe134380e5d9d8aa5a3cf6484130a99d5af278ce4ce15a95015b89b67b5816c",
      "skos:note": "Requirements for a valid notice under subsection (1)",
      "dc:description": "The information required by the form and any other prescribed documents"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-93-ss-1a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "93(1A) Notification of exclusive dealing or resale price maintenance",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 431,
      "values:originalText": "(1A) To be valid, a notice under subsection (1) must:\n\n(a) be in a form approved by the Commission in writing and\ncontain the information required by the form; and\n\n(b) be accompanied by any other information or documents\nprescribed by the regulations; and\n\n(c) be accompanied by the fee (if any) prescribed by the\nregulations."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-93-ss-1a-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
