      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.438",
      "values:originalText": "(2) First, the corporation must have made, or propose to make, the\ninitial contract with 1 or more persons (the contracting parties)\nabout:\n\n(a) the supply of particular goods or services to; or\n\n(b) the acquisition of particular goods or services from;\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(2) First, the corporation must have made, or propose to make, the\ninitial contract with 1 or more persons (the contracting parties)\nabout:\n\n(a) the supply of particular goods or services to; or\n\n(b) the acquisition of particular goods or services from;\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-93ab"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
