    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-93ag-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "93AG(5) Stop notice for collective boycott conduct",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-93ag-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.450",
      "values:originalText": "(5) The stop notice ceases to be in force at the earliest of the following\ntimes:\n\n(a) at the end of the period provided under subsection (6);\n\n(b) if, before the end of that period, the Commission gives the\ncorporation an objection notice under subsection 93AC(1) or",
      "skos:definition": "(5) The stop notice ceases to be in force at the earliest of the following\ntimes:\n\n(a) at the end of the period provided under subsection (6);\n\n(b) if, before the end of that period, the Commission gives the\ncorporation an objection notice under subsection 93AC(1) or",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-93ag"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-93ag-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-93ag-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e12e3223d0f46bafc7f7645165cb2e971de206cf9a466c511093671afdb4a0b6",
      "skos:note": "Stop notice ceases at end of period or Commission objection notice"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-93ag-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "93AG(5) Stop notice for collective boycott conduct",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 450,
      "values:originalText": "(5) The stop notice ceases to be in force at the earliest of the following\ntimes:\n\n(a) at the end of the period provided under subsection (6);\n\n(b) if, before the end of that period, the Commission gives the\ncorporation an objection notice under subsection 93AC(1) or"
    },
