      "cml:logicSummary": "The Commission must send with each notice under subsection (2) a copy of the draft notice and a summary of the reasons why it proposes to give the notice.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "sparql_library::parsers::chk_parser",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-93a-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "93A(4) Commission to afford opportunity for conference before giving",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-93a-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.452",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If each of the persons to whom a notice was sent under\nsubsection (2):\n\n(a) notifies the Commission in writing within the period of\n14 days mentioned in that subsection that the person does not\nwish the Commission to hold a conference in relation to the\ndraft notice; or\n\n(b) does not notify the Commission within that period that he or\nshe wishes the Commission to hold such a conference;\nthe Commission must decide after the end of that period whether or\nnot to give the notice under subsection 93(3), (3A) or (3B) or\n93AC(1), (2) or (2A).",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If each of the persons to whom a notice was sent under\nsubsection (2):\n\n(a) notifies the Commission in writing within the period of\n14 days mentioned in that subsection that the person does not\nwish the Commission to hold a conference in relation to the\ndraft notice; or\n\n(b) does not notify the Commission within that period that he or\nshe wishes the Commission to hold such a conference;\nthe Commission must decide after the end of that period whether or\nnot to give the notice under subsection 93(3), (3A) or (3B) or\n93AC(1), (2) or (2A).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-93a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-93a-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-93a-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4a0e90c986e5e893db59f9087f279b2b76dccd6f1d0f4ca63b8d9c78531bab21",
      "skos:note": "Commission must decide whether to give notice after 14-day period of silence from persons notified."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-93a-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "93A(4) Commission to afford opportunity for conference before giving",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 452,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If each of the persons to whom a notice was sent under\nsubsection (2):\n\n(a) notifies the Commission in writing within the period of\n14 days mentioned in that subsection that the person does not\nwish the Commission to hold a conference in relation to the\ndraft notice; or\n\n(b) does not notify the Commission within that period that he or\nshe wishes the Commission to hold such a conference;\nthe Commission must decide after the end of that period whether or\nnot to give the notice under subsection 93(3), (3A) or (3B) or\n93AC(1), (2) or (2A)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-93a-ss-4-norm",
