    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-93a-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "93A(5) Commission to afford opportunity for conference before giving",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-93a-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.452",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If any of the persons to whom a notice was sent under\nsubsection (2) notifies the Commission in writing within the period\nof 14 days mentioned in that subsection that he or she wishes the\nCommission to hold a conference in relation to the draft notice, the\nCommission shall appoint a date (being not later than 30 days after\nthe expiration of that period), time and place for the holding of the\nconference and give notice of the date, time and place so appointed\nto each of the persons to whom a notice was sent under\nsubsection (2).",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If any of the persons to whom a notice was sent under\nsubsection (2) notifies the Commission in writing within the period\nof 14 days mentioned in that subsection that he or she wishes the\nCommission to hold a conference in relation to the draft notice, the\nCommission shall appoint a date (being not later than 30 days after\nthe expiration of that period), time and place for the holding of the\nconference and give notice of the date, time and place so appointed\nto each of the persons to whom a notice was sent under\nsubsection (2).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-93a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-93a-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-93a-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "350df392d5955bd3b9f6d08a64294a6cbf5c9387afe41857c63c81693ef195e1",
      "skos:note": "Commission must hold conference if requested within 14 days"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-93a-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "93A(5) Commission to afford opportunity for conference before giving",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 452,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If any of the persons to whom a notice was sent under\nsubsection (2) notifies the Commission in writing within the period\nof 14 days mentioned in that subsection that he or she wishes the\nCommission to hold a conference in relation to the draft notice, the\nCommission shall appoint a date (being not later than 30 days after\nthe expiration of that period), time and place for the holding of the\nconference and give notice of the date, time and place so appointed\nto each of the persons to whom a notice was sent under\nsubsection (2)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-93a-ss-5-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
