    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-93a-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "93A(6) Commission to afford opportunity for conference before giving",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-93a-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.452",
      "values:originalText": "(6) At the conference:\n\n(a) the Commission shall be represented by a member or\nmembers of the Commission (being a member or members\nwho participated in the preparation of the draft notice)\nnominated by the Chairperson; and\n\n(b) each person to whom a notice was sent under subsection (2)\nand any other interested person whose presence at the\nconference is considered by the Commission to be\nappropriate is entitled to attend and participate personally or,\nin the case of a body corporate, may be represented by a\nperson who, or by persons each of whom, is a director,\nofficer or employee of the body corporate; and\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(6) At the conference:\n\n(a) the Commission shall be represented by a member or\nmembers of the Commission (being a member or members\nwho participated in the preparation of the draft notice)\nnominated by the Chairperson; and\n\n(b) each person to whom a notice was sent under subsection (2)\nand any other interested person whose presence at the\nconference is considered by the Commission to be\nappropriate is entitled to attend and participate personally or,\nin the case of a body corporate, may be represented by a\nperson who, or by persons each of whom, is a director,\nofficer or employee of the body corporate; and\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-93a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-93a-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-93a-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "db634734a7377c085a71e752bce2a6214e58ca327237d6b94f4fe459a4991d45",
      "skos:note": "Commission must afford opportunity for conference before giving notice."
    },
    {
