    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95aa-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "95AA(4) Commission may determine class exemptions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95aa-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.459",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The determination:\n\n(a) enters into force on the day it is made or on such later day (if\nany) as is specified in the determination; and\n\n(b) ceases to be in force at the earlier of the following times:\n\n(i) if the determination is revoked—at the time the\nrevocation takes effect;\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The determination:\n\n(a) enters into force on the day it is made or on such later day (if\nany) as is specified in the determination; and\n\n(b) ceases to be in force at the earlier of the following times:\n\n(i) if the determination is revoked—at the time the\nrevocation takes effect;\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95aa"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95aa-ss-4-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "649840e995fc770db7050b139a8ffaa887de02d7a2a96d3bf3a7ff5f30c4e2a6",
      "skos:note": "Commission may determine class exemptions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95aa-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "95AA(4) Commission may determine class exemptions",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 459,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The determination:\n\n(a) enters into force on the day it is made or on such later day (if\nany) as is specified in the determination; and\n\n(b) ceases to be in force at the earlier of the following times:\n\n(i) if the determination is revoked—at the time the\nrevocation takes effect;\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95aa-ss-4-norm",
