    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95f",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "95F Simplified overview of this Part",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95f"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.471",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This Part deals with 3 main things.\nPrice inquiries\n\n(2) First, it provides for the Commission or another body to hold price\ninquiries in relation to the supply of goods or services.\n\n(3) These inquiries may relate to the supply of goods or services by a\nparticular person. If so, the person’s ability to increase the prices of\nthose goods or services during a particular period is restricted.\nHowever, there is a way for the person to increase prices during\nthat period.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This Part deals with 3 main things.\nPrice inquiries\n\n(2) First, it provides for the Commission or another body to hold price\ninquiries in relation to the supply of goods or services.\n\n(3) These inquiries may relate to the supply of goods or services by a\nparticular person. If so, the person’s ability to increase the prices of\nthose goods or services during a particular period is restricted.\nHowever, there is a way for the person to increase prices during\nthat period.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
