      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.473",
      "values:originalText": "(6) The Commission is to monitor prices, costs and profits in any\nindustry or business that the Minister directs it to monitor and is to\ngive the Minister a report on the results of such monitoring.\nGeneral",
      "skos:definition": "(6) The Commission is to monitor prices, costs and profits in any\nindustry or business that the Minister directs it to monitor and is to\ngive the Minister a report on the results of such monitoring.\nGeneral",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95g"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95g-ss-6-norm"
        },
