      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.473",
      "values:originalText": "(7) In exercising its powers and performing its functions under this\nPart, the Commission must, subject to any directions given under\nsection 95ZH, have particular regard to the following:\n\n(a) the need to maintain investment and employment, including\nthe influence of profitability on investment and employment;\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(7) In exercising its powers and performing its functions under this\nPart, the Commission must, subject to any directions given under\nsection 95ZH, have particular regard to the following:\n\n(a) the need to maintain investment and employment, including\nthe influence of profitability on investment and employment;\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95g"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95g-ss-7-norm"
        },
