      "skos:note": "Inquiry body must complete inquiry and give report within extended completion period."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95k-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "95K(4) Period for completing inquiry",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 477,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the Minister does so, the inquiry body must complete the inquiry\nand give its report within the completion period as so extended or\nfurther extended."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95k-ss-4-norm",
