      "skos:note": "Defines completion period for inquiry"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95k-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "95K(5) Period for completing inquiry",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 477,
      "values:originalText": "(5) In this section:\ncompletion period means the period within which the inquiry body\nis required by this section to complete an inquiry and to give its\nreport on the inquiry.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions"
    },
