    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95l",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "95L Notice of holding of inquiry",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95l"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.478",
      "values:originalText": "General notice\n\n(1) An inquiry body must, by notifiable instrument, give notice of an\ninquiry it is to hold.\nNotice to particular person or persons\n\n(3) If the inquiry is to be held in relation to the supply of goods or\nservices by a particular person or persons, the inquiry body must,\nas soon as practicable, give the person, or each of the persons, a\nnotice in writing.\nContent of notice\n\n(4) A notice under this section must:\n\n(a) state that the inquiry body is to hold the inquiry; and\n\n(b) specify the matter or matters in relation to which the inquiry\nis to be held; and\n\n(c) specify the time and place at which the inquiry is to start; and\n\n(d) in the case of a notice under subsection (3)—set out the effect\nof section 95N; and\n\n(e) specify any other matter prescribed by the regulations.",
      "skos:definition": "General notice\n\n(1) An inquiry body must, by notifiable instrument, give notice of an\ninquiry it is to hold.\nNotice to particular person or persons\n\n(3) If the inquiry is to be held in relation to the supply of goods or\nservices by a particular person or persons, the inquiry body must,\nas soon as practicable, give the person, or each of the persons, a\nnotice in writing.\nContent of notice\n\n(4) A notice under this section must:\n\n(a) state that the inquiry body is to hold the inquiry; and\n\n(b) specify the matter or matters in relation to which the inquiry\nis to be held; and\n\n(c) specify the time and place at which the inquiry is to start; and\n\n(d) in the case of a notice under subsection (3)—set out the effect\nof section 95N; and\n\n(e) specify any other matter prescribed by the regulations.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95l-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95l-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95l-ss-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "fd166def05b5535705d440f3ff7ee54b3e19e430e58c94a0df898a24809a7978"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95l",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "95L Notice of holding of inquiry",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 478,
      "values:originalText": "General notice\n\n(1) An inquiry body must, by notifiable instrument, give notice of an\ninquiry it is to hold.\nNotice to particular person or persons\n\n(3) If the inquiry is to be held in relation to the supply of goods or\nservices by a particular person or persons, the inquiry body must,\nas soon as practicable, give the person, or each of the persons, a\nnotice in writing.\nContent of notice\n\n(4) A notice under this section must:\n\n(a) state that the inquiry body is to hold the inquiry; and\n\n(b) specify the matter or matters in relation to which the inquiry\nis to be held; and\n\n(c) specify the time and place at which the inquiry is to start; and\n\n(d) in the case of a notice under subsection (3)—set out the effect\nof section 95N; and\n\n(e) specify any other matter prescribed by the regulations."
    },
