    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95r-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "95R(4) Public inquiries etc.",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95r-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.483",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If a statement is so given in an inquiry held in public, the inquiry\nbody must make available to the public in such manner as it thinks\nfit the contents of the statement other than any matter:\n\n(a) that the person who gave the evidence objects to being made\npublic; and\n\n(b) the evidence of which the body is satisfied would have been\ntaken in private if that evidence had been given orally and the\nperson had objected to giving it in public.\nWritten submissions",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If a statement is so given in an inquiry held in public, the inquiry\nbody must make available to the public in such manner as it thinks\nfit the contents of the statement other than any matter:\n\n(a) that the person who gave the evidence objects to being made\npublic; and\n\n(b) the evidence of which the body is satisfied would have been\ntaken in private if that evidence had been given orally and the\nperson had objected to giving it in public.\nWritten submissions",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95r"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95r-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95r-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0032e5a7066f01ab7dc1b27b802d337d861edaf12c29bb86b468cab533698727",
      "skos:note": "Make available to public certain statement contents under specific conditions.",
      "dc:description": "yes"
    },
    {
