    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95s",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "95S Taking of evidence on oath or affirmation",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95s"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.484",
      "values:originalText": "Evidence on oath or affirmation\n\n(1) An inquiry body may take evidence at an inquiry on oath or\naffirmation.\n\n(2) An oath or affirmation may be administered by:\n\n(a) in an inquiry by the Commission—a member of the\nCommission; or\n\n(b) in an external inquiry—the person presiding at the inquiry.\nSummons\n\n(3) The inquiry Chair may, by writing signed by him or her, summon a\nperson to appear at an inquiry to give evidence and to produce such\ndocuments (if any) as are specified in the summons.\n\n(4) In an inquiry by the Commission, the power conferred on the\ninquiry Chair by subsection (3) may, at his or her discretion, be\nexercised on the application of another person.\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nPrices surveillance  Part VIIA\nPrice inquiries  Division 3\n\nSection 95T\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "skos:definition": "Evidence on oath or affirmation\n\n(1) An inquiry body may take evidence at an inquiry on oath or\naffirmation.\n\n(2) An oath or affirmation may be administered by:\n\n(a) in an inquiry by the Commission—a member of the\nCommission; or\n\n(b) in an external inquiry—the person presiding at the inquiry.\nSummons\n\n(3) The inquiry Chair may, by writing signed by him or her, summon a\nperson to appear at an inquiry to give evidence and to produce such\ndocuments (if any) as are specified in the summons.\n\n(4) In an inquiry by the Commission, the power conferred on the\ninquiry Chair by subsection (3) may, at his or her discretion, be\nexercised on the application of another person.\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nPrices surveillance  Part VIIA\nPrice inquiries  Division 3\n\nSection 95T\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95s-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95s-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95s-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95s-ss-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "afdaea3531547e61718b6829b4d8db037d3af566ecc2a668958f15da30131188"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95s",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "95S Taking of evidence on oath or affirmation",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 484,
      "values:originalText": "Evidence on oath or affirmation\n\n(1) An inquiry body may take evidence at an inquiry on oath or\naffirmation.\n\n(2) An oath or affirmation may be administered by:\n\n(a) in an inquiry by the Commission—a member of the\nCommission; or\n\n(b) in an external inquiry—the person presiding at the inquiry.\nSummons\n\n(3) The inquiry Chair may, by writing signed by him or her, summon a\nperson to appear at an inquiry to give evidence and to produce such\ndocuments (if any) as are specified in the summons.\n\n(4) In an inquiry by the Commission, the power conferred on the\ninquiry Chair by subsection (3) may, at his or her discretion, be\nexercised on the application of another person.\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nPrices surveillance  Part VIIA\nPrice inquiries  Division 3\n\nSection 95T\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95s-ss-1",
