      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.484",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The inquiry Chair may, by writing signed by him or her, summon a\nperson to appear at an inquiry to give evidence and to produce such\ndocuments (if any) as are specified in the summons.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The inquiry Chair may, by writing signed by him or her, summon a\nperson to appear at an inquiry to give evidence and to produce such\ndocuments (if any) as are specified in the summons.",
