    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95u",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "95U Refusal to be sworn or to answer question",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95u"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.485",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person appearing as a witness at an inquiry must not:\n\n(a) refuse or fail to swear an oath or to make an affirmation if\nrequired to do so by:\n\n(i) in an inquiry by the Commission—a member of the\nCommission; or\n\n(ii) in an external inquiry—the person presiding at the\ninquiry; or\n\n(b) refuse or fail to answer a question that he or she is required to\nanswer by the inquiry Chair; or\n\n(c) refuse or fail to produce a document that he or she was\nrequired to produce by a summons under this Part given to\nhim or her.\nPenalty: 10 penalty units.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A person appearing as a witness at an inquiry must not:\n\n(a) refuse or fail to swear an oath or to make an affirmation if\nrequired to do so by:\n\n(i) in an inquiry by the Commission—a member of the\nCommission; or\n\n(ii) in an external inquiry—the person presiding at the\ninquiry; or\n\n(b) refuse or fail to answer a question that he or she is required to\nanswer by the inquiry Chair; or\n\n(c) refuse or fail to produce a document that he or she was\nrequired to produce by a summons under this Part given to\nhim or her.\nPenalty: 10 penalty units.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95u-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95u-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1e3184892a521501c9ad9b795a2a4cf035c208437c52df0dc4c061c402b292e0",
      "skos:note": "Refusal to be sworn or answer question"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95u",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "95U Refusal to be sworn or to answer question",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 485,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person appearing as a witness at an inquiry must not:\n\n(a) refuse or fail to swear an oath or to make an affirmation if\nrequired to do so by:\n\n(i) in an inquiry by the Commission—a member of the\nCommission; or\n\n(ii) in an external inquiry—the person presiding at the\ninquiry; or\n\n(b) refuse or fail to answer a question that he or she is required to\nanswer by the inquiry Chair; or\n\n(c) refuse or fail to produce a document that he or she was\nrequired to produce by a summons under this Part given to\nhim or her.\nPenalty: 10 penalty units.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95u-norm",
