      },
      "cml:conclusionText": "Refusal to be sworn or answer question"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95v",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "95V Protection of witnesses",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95v"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.486",
      "values:originalText": "Subject to this Part, a person summoned to attend or appearing as a\nwitness at an inquiry has the same protection, and is, in addition to\nthe penalties provided by this Part, subject to the same liabilities, in\nany civil or criminal proceedings as a witness in proceedings in the\nHigh Court.",
      "skos:definition": "Subject to this Part, a person summoned to attend or appearing as a\nwitness at an inquiry has the same protection, and is, in addition to\nthe penalties provided by this Part, subject to the same liabilities, in\nany civil or criminal proceedings as a witness in proceedings in the\nHigh Court.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95v-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "fd55297564941eba72f5b3e55b2c493be86ed0f2146be5b3d85d5b65f141d00b",
      "skos:note": "Protection of witnesses in civil or criminal proceedings"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95v",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "95V Protection of witnesses",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 486,
      "values:originalText": "Subject to this Part, a person summoned to attend or appearing as a\nwitness at an inquiry has the same protection, and is, in addition to\nthe penalties provided by this Part, subject to the same liabilities, in\nany civil or criminal proceedings as a witness in proceedings in the\nHigh Court."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95v-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95v"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95w",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "95W Allowances to witnesses",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95w"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.486",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A witness summoned under this Part to appear at an inquiry is\nentitled to be paid such allowances for his or her travelling, and\nsuch other expenses, as are prescribed by the regulations.\n\n(2) The witness is entitled to be paid by:\n\n(a) if the witness was summoned by the inquiry Chair—the\nCommonwealth; or\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nPrices surveillance  Part VIIA\nPrice inquiries  Division 3\n\nSection 95W\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(b) if the witness was summoned on the application of a\nperson—that person.\n\n(3) The regulations may provide for those allowances and expenses by\nreference to a scale of expenses for witnesses who attend before a\ncourt specified in the regulations.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A witness summoned under this Part to appear at an inquiry is\nentitled to be paid such allowances for his or her travelling, and\nsuch other expenses, as are prescribed by the regulations.\n\n(2) The witness is entitled to be paid by:\n\n(a) if the witness was summoned by the inquiry Chair—the\nCommonwealth; or\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nPrices surveillance  Part VIIA\nPrice inquiries  Division 3\n\nSection 95W\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(b) if the witness was summoned on the application of a\nperson—that person.\n\n(3) The regulations may provide for those allowances and expenses by\nreference to a scale of expenses for witnesses who attend before a\ncourt specified in the regulations.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95w-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95w-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95w-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f50f7884d385247dcd2ef169dc9ee7e7deac2b6ca864fb34f10b43af2df2b532"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95w",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "95W Allowances to witnesses",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 486,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A witness summoned under this Part to appear at an inquiry is\nentitled to be paid such allowances for his or her travelling, and\nsuch other expenses, as are prescribed by the regulations.\n\n(2) The witness is entitled to be paid by:\n\n(a) if the witness was summoned by the inquiry Chair—the\nCommonwealth; or\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nPrices surveillance  Part VIIA\nPrice inquiries  Division 3\n\nSection 95W\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(b) if the witness was summoned on the application of a\nperson—that person.\n\n(3) The regulations may provide for those allowances and expenses by\nreference to a scale of expenses for witnesses who attend before a\ncourt specified in the regulations.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions"
    },
