      "cml:integrityHash": "80237f31aca4a90279a12ab8cd81a12540e3a69968a49c0aee7b96189abe8ff4",
      "skos:note": "Witness entitled to payment by Commonwealth or summoning person."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95w-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "95W(2) Allowances to witnesses",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 486,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The witness is entitled to be paid by:\n\n(a) if the witness was summoned by the inquiry Chair—the\nCommonwealth; or\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nPrices surveillance  Part VIIA\nPrice inquiries  Division 3\n\nSection 95W\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(b) if the witness was summoned on the application of a\nperson—that person."
    },
