      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.486",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The regulations may provide for those allowances and expenses by\nreference to a scale of expenses for witnesses who attend before a\ncourt specified in the regulations.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The regulations may provide for those allowances and expenses by\nreference to a scale of expenses for witnesses who attend before a\ncourt specified in the regulations.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "values:partOf": {
