      "skos:note": "Declaration must specify when it ceases to have effect"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95x-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "95X(4) Declarations by Minister or Commission",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 488,
      "values:originalText": "(4) A declaration under subsection (2) must specify the time when it is\nto cease to have effect. Such a declaration ceases to have effect at\nthe time specified, unless it is revoked sooner.\nVariation or revocation"
    },
    {
