    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95y-ss-2-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Imply",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Supervision implies government notification",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) at least one Australian government has notified the State or Territory concerned...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...that there is effective supervision of the prices charged by the authority for the supply of those goods or services"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95y-ss-2-logic-deontic-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Imply",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Supervision implies impact on trade or commerce",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(c) the supply of those goods or services by the authority has a significant direct or indirect impact on qualifying trade or commerce",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...that there is effective supervision of the prices charged by the authority for the supply of those goods or services"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95y-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "95Y(3) Declarations in relation to State or Territory authorities",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95y-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.488",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Council must also not recommend a declaration of a State or\nTerritory authority in relation to goods or services if:\n\n(a) in the 5 year period before it received the current request, it\nwas satisfied (when considering a previous request) that there\nwas effective supervision of prices charged by the authority\nfor the supply of those goods or services; and\n\n(b) it is satisfied that there has not been a substantial change in\nthe mechanism for that supervision since it was satisfied as\nmentioned in paragraph (a).",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Council must also not recommend a declaration of a State or\nTerritory authority in relation to goods or services if:\n\n(a) in the 5 year period before it received the current request, it\nwas satisfied (when considering a previous request) that there\nwas effective supervision of prices charged by the authority\nfor the supply of those goods or services; and\n\n(b) it is satisfied that there has not been a substantial change in\nthe mechanism for that supervision since it was satisfied as\nmentioned in paragraph (a).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95y"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95y-ss-3-norm"
        },
