          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95y-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95y-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95y-ss-3-logic-deontic-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95y-ss-3-logic-ltl-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95y-ss-3-logic-deontic-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a4b6c9c8480b4aa1020f79d6f54719a8f7f8af7645a29a19a41018074138b404",
      "skos:note": "Council must not recommend declaration of State or Territory authority if effective supervision exists."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95y-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "95Y(3) Declarations in relation to State or Territory authorities",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 488,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Council must also not recommend a declaration of a State or\nTerritory authority in relation to goods or services if:\n\n(a) in the 5 year period before it received the current request, it\nwas satisfied (when considering a previous request) that there\nwas effective supervision of prices charged by the authority\nfor the supply of those goods or services; and\n\n(b) it is satisfied that there has not been a substantial change in\nthe mechanism for that supervision since it was satisfied as\nmentioned in paragraph (a)."
    },
