    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95za",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "95ZA Later notices modifying a locality notice",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95za"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.493",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If a person gives the Commission a locality notice, the person may\ngive the Commission one or more further notices in writing stating\nthat the locality notice is to have effect as if there were substituted\nfor the proposed price another specified price.\n\n(2) A price specified in a notice under subsection (1) must be:\n\n(a) less than the proposed price; and\n\n(b) less than the price specified in any previous notice under that\nsubsection in relation to the locality notice.\n\n(3) If a notice is given under subsection (1), the locality notice has\neffect accordingly.\n\n(4) In this section:\nproposed price has the meaning given by subsection 95Z(5).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If a person gives the Commission a locality notice, the person may\ngive the Commission one or more further notices in writing stating\nthat the locality notice is to have effect as if there were substituted\nfor the proposed price another specified price.\n\n(2) A price specified in a notice under subsection (1) must be:\n\n(a) less than the proposed price; and\n\n(b) less than the price specified in any previous notice under that\nsubsection in relation to the locality notice.\n\n(3) If a notice is given under subsection (1), the locality notice has\neffect accordingly.\n\n(4) In this section:\nproposed price has the meaning given by subsection 95Z(5).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95za-ss-1"
        },
