      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.493",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The applicable period in relation to a locality notice is the period\n(the price-freeze period) of 21 days starting on the day on which\nthe notice was given.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The applicable period in relation to a locality notice is the period\n(the price-freeze period) of 21 days starting on the day on which\nthe notice was given.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
