      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.494",
      "values:originalText": "If the Commission also gives the person a response notice, under\nsubsection (4), the applicable period instead of ending on 31 May ends\non 14 June.",
      "skos:definition": "If the Commission also gives the person a response notice, under\nsubsection (4), the applicable period instead of ending on 31 May ends\non 14 June.",
