      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.494",
      "values:originalText": "(5) The Commission may exclude the information if it is satisfied that\nthe claim is justified and is not of the opinion that disclosure of the\ninformation is necessary in the public interest.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) The Commission may exclude the information if it is satisfied that\nthe claim is justified and is not of the opinion that disclosure of the\ninformation is necessary in the public interest.",
      "values:partOf": {
