    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95zd",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "95ZD Delegation by Commission",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95zd"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.496",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Commission may, by writing, delegate to a member of the\nCommission:\n\n(a) the Commission’s price notification powers in relation to\nspecified locality notices; and\n\n(b) the Commission’s power under section 95ZJ relating to a\nnotice given by the member exercising (as a delegate) the\nCommission’s price notification powers.\n\n(2) In this section:\nprice notification powers means the Commission’s powers under\nparagraph 95Z(6)(b) or (c).\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nPrices surveillance  Part VIIA\nPrice monitoring  Division 5\n\nSection 95ZE\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Commission may, by writing, delegate to a member of the\nCommission:\n\n(a) the Commission’s price notification powers in relation to\nspecified locality notices; and\n\n(b) the Commission’s power under section 95ZJ relating to a\nnotice given by the member exercising (as a delegate) the\nCommission’s price notification powers.\n\n(2) In this section:\nprice notification powers means the Commission’s powers under\nparagraph 95Z(6)(b) or (c).\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nPrices surveillance  Part VIIA\nPrice monitoring  Division 5\n\nSection 95ZE\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95zd-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95zd-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "85f5142e98be7c88ba83820e47851204b360d205f7c57370898456515e25c07a"
    },
    {
