    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95zj",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "95ZJ Withdrawal of notices",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95zj"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.500",
      "values:originalText": "Commission\n\n(1) The Commission may give a person a notice (the withdrawal\nnotice) in writing withdrawing a notice it previously gave the\nperson under this Part (other than this section).\n\n(2) If the Commission does so, this Part has effect, from the time at\nwhich the withdrawal notice is given to the person, as if the other\nnotice had not been given to the person.\nOther bodies\n\n(3) The body holding an external inquiry may give a person a notice\n(the withdrawal notice) in writing withdrawing a notice it\npreviously gave the person under this Part (other than this section).\n\n(4) If the body does so, this Part has effect, from the time at which the\nwithdrawal notice is given to the person, as if the other notice had\nnot been given to the person.",
      "skos:definition": "Commission\n\n(1) The Commission may give a person a notice (the withdrawal\nnotice) in writing withdrawing a notice it previously gave the\nperson under this Part (other than this section).\n\n(2) If the Commission does so, this Part has effect, from the time at\nwhich the withdrawal notice is given to the person, as if the other\nnotice had not been given to the person.\nOther bodies\n\n(3) The body holding an external inquiry may give a person a notice\n(the withdrawal notice) in writing withdrawing a notice it\npreviously gave the person under this Part (other than this section).\n\n(4) If the body does so, this Part has effect, from the time at which the\nwithdrawal notice is given to the person, as if the other notice had\nnot been given to the person.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95zj-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95zj-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95zj-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95zj-ss-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3d41e1a66a7daeb8da761812e830ca56fe19dd3ec7c8e2e6b0ca2abeef1a2010"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95zj",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "95ZJ Withdrawal of notices",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 500,
      "values:originalText": "Commission\n\n(1) The Commission may give a person a notice (the withdrawal\nnotice) in writing withdrawing a notice it previously gave the\nperson under this Part (other than this section).\n\n(2) If the Commission does so, this Part has effect, from the time at\nwhich the withdrawal notice is given to the person, as if the other\nnotice had not been given to the person.\nOther bodies\n\n(3) The body holding an external inquiry may give a person a notice\n(the withdrawal notice) in writing withdrawing a notice it\npreviously gave the person under this Part (other than this section).\n\n(4) If the body does so, this Part has effect, from the time at which the\nwithdrawal notice is given to the person, as if the other notice had\nnot been given to the person."
    },
    {
