    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95zk-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "95ZK(2) Power to obtain information or documents",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95zk-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.500",
      "values:originalText": "(2) If:\n\n(a) an external inquiry is being held in relation to a person; and\n\n(b) the inquiry Chair has reason to believe that the person is\ncapable of giving information or producing documents\nrelevant to the inquiry;\nthe inquiry Chair may, by notice in writing signed by him or her\nand given to the person, require the person:\n\n(c) to give the body, by writing signed by the person or his or her\nagent or, in the case of a Commonwealth authority or a body\ncorporate, by a competent officer of the authority or body,\nwithin the specified period and in the specified manner,\nspecified information relating to the affairs of the person; or\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(2) If:\n\n(a) an external inquiry is being held in relation to a person; and\n\n(b) the inquiry Chair has reason to believe that the person is\ncapable of giving information or producing documents\nrelevant to the inquiry;\nthe inquiry Chair may, by notice in writing signed by him or her\nand given to the person, require the person:\n\n(c) to give the body, by writing signed by the person or his or her\nagent or, in the case of a Commonwealth authority or a body\ncorporate, by a competent officer of the authority or body,\nwithin the specified period and in the specified manner,\nspecified information relating to the affairs of the person; or\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95zk"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95zk-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95zk-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6babe10c028d28ae9f3c897989c053238826412ddf826b229452402ac921f264",
      "skos:note": "Require person to provide information or documents within a specified period and manner.",
      "dc:description": "true"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95zk-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "95ZK(2) Power to obtain information or documents",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 500,
      "values:originalText": "(2) If:\n\n(a) an external inquiry is being held in relation to a person; and\n\n(b) the inquiry Chair has reason to believe that the person is\ncapable of giving information or producing documents\nrelevant to the inquiry;\nthe inquiry Chair may, by notice in writing signed by him or her\nand given to the person, require the person:\n\n(c) to give the body, by writing signed by the person or his or her\nagent or, in the case of a Commonwealth authority or a body\ncorporate, by a competent officer of the authority or body,\nwithin the specified period and in the specified manner,\nspecified information relating to the affairs of the person; or\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95zk-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
