    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95zl-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "95ZL(5) Inspection of documents etc.",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95zl-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.504",
      "values:originalText": "(5) In an external inquiry, the person presiding at the inquiry, or a\nperson providing assistance in the inquiry to the body holding the\ninquiry, may:\n\n(a) inspect documents given to the body for the purposes of the\ninquiry; and\n\n(b) make copies of, or take extracts from, those documents.\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nPrices surveillance  Part VIIA\nOther provisions  Division 6\n\nSection 95ZM\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(5) In an external inquiry, the person presiding at the inquiry, or a\nperson providing assistance in the inquiry to the body holding the\ninquiry, may:\n\n(a) inspect documents given to the body for the purposes of the\ninquiry; and\n\n(b) make copies of, or take extracts from, those documents.\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nPrices surveillance  Part VIIA\nOther provisions  Division 6\n\nSection 95ZM\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95zl"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95zl-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95zl-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "91a0bfdca0cda343432287e400d41b980bbbda763d084c7891d7196a5adfbcec",
      "skos:note": "Inspect documents and make copies or extracts."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95zl-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "95ZL(5) Inspection of documents etc.",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 504,
      "values:originalText": "(5) In an external inquiry, the person presiding at the inquiry, or a\nperson providing assistance in the inquiry to the body holding the\ninquiry, may:\n\n(a) inspect documents given to the body for the purposes of the\ninquiry; and\n\n(b) make copies of, or take extracts from, those documents.\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nPrices surveillance  Part VIIA\nOther provisions  Division 6\n\nSection 95ZM\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95zl-ss-5-norm",
      "@type": "values:Permission",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95zl-ss-5"
      },
