      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 505,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The person otherwise entitled to possession of the document is\nentitled to be supplied, as soon as practicable, with a copy certified\nby the Commission or other body, as the case may be, to be a true\ncopy."
    },
