    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95zm-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "95ZM(4) Retention of documents",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95zm-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.505",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Until a certified copy is supplied, the Commission or other body,\nas the case may be, must, at such times and places as it thinks\nappropriate, permit the person otherwise entitled to possession of\nthe document, or a person authorised by that person, to inspect and\nmake copies of, or take extracts from, the document.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Until a certified copy is supplied, the Commission or other body,\nas the case may be, must, at such times and places as it thinks\nappropriate, permit the person otherwise entitled to possession of\nthe document, or a person authorised by that person, to inspect and\nmake copies of, or take extracts from, the document.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95zm"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95zm-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95zm-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f7aea5fca20df8aa02a579106fd993e2afc7ae60b165fe804a4a18bf968b71dc",
      "skos:note": "Must permit inspection and copying of documents under certain conditions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95zm-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "95ZM(4) Retention of documents",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 505,
      "values:originalText": "(4) Until a certified copy is supplied, the Commission or other body,\nas the case may be, must, at such times and places as it thinks\nappropriate, permit the person otherwise entitled to possession of\nthe document, or a person authorised by that person, to inspect and\nmake copies of, or take extracts from, the document."
    },
