    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95zn",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "95ZN Confidential information",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95zn"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.505",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if a person claims that disclosure of the\nfollowing information would damage the competitive position of\nthe person:\n\n(a) information made available, or to be made available, by or on\nbehalf of the person (whether in oral evidence or in a written\nstatement, submission or other document) at the hearing of an\ninquiry by the Commission or another body;\n\n(b) information given, or contained in a document produced, by\nthe person under section 95ZK to the Commission or another\nbody.\nCommission or other body to take confidentiality steps\n\n(2) If the Commission or other body, as the case may be:\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies if a person claims that disclosure of the\nfollowing information would damage the competitive position of\nthe person:\n\n(a) information made available, or to be made available, by or on\nbehalf of the person (whether in oral evidence or in a written\nstatement, submission or other document) at the hearing of an\ninquiry by the Commission or another body;\n\n(b) information given, or contained in a document produced, by\nthe person under section 95ZK to the Commission or another\nbody.\nCommission or other body to take confidentiality steps\n\n(2) If the Commission or other body, as the case may be:\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95zn-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95zn-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "46e4df2c507fbe9adeb85678599c035f2558c9ab56f8232c0b61dd94162f87ca"
    },
