    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95zo-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "95ZO(2) Immunity",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-95zo-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.506",
      "values:originalText": "(2) An entrusted person cannot be required to:\n\n(a) disclose any protected information to a court; or\n\n(b) produce all or part of a protected document to a court;\nunless that disclosure or production is necessary for the purpose of\ncarrying into effect the provisions of this Act.\nDefinitions",
      "skos:definition": "(2) An entrusted person cannot be required to:\n\n(a) disclose any protected information to a court; or\n\n(b) produce all or part of a protected document to a court;\nunless that disclosure or production is necessary for the purpose of\ncarrying into effect the provisions of this Act.\nDefinitions",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95zo"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95zo-ss-2-norm"
