    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-96-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "96(4) Acts constituting engaging in resale price maintenance",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-96-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.512",
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of subsection (3):\n\n(a) where a price is specified by another person on behalf of the\nsupplier, it shall be deemed to have been specified by the\nsupplier;\n\n(b) where the supplier makes it known, in respect of goods, that\nthe price below which those goods are not to be sold is a\nprice specified by another person in respect of those goods,\nor in respect of goods of a like description, that price shall be\ndeemed to have been specified, in respect of the\nfirst-mentioned goods, by the supplier;\n\n(c) where a formula is specified by or on behalf of the supplier\nand a price may be ascertained by calculation from, or by\nreference to, that formula, that price shall be deemed to have\nbeen specified by the supplier; and\n\n(d) where the supplier makes it known, in respect of goods, that\nthe price below which those goods are not to be sold is a\nprice ascertained by calculation from, or by reference to, a\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(4) For the purposes of subsection (3):\n\n(a) where a price is specified by another person on behalf of the\nsupplier, it shall be deemed to have been specified by the\nsupplier;\n\n(b) where the supplier makes it known, in respect of goods, that\nthe price below which those goods are not to be sold is a\nprice specified by another person in respect of those goods,\nor in respect of goods of a like description, that price shall be\ndeemed to have been specified, in respect of the\nfirst-mentioned goods, by the supplier;\n\n(c) where a formula is specified by or on behalf of the supplier\nand a price may be ascertained by calculation from, or by\nreference to, that formula, that price shall be deemed to have\nbeen specified by the supplier; and\n\n(d) where the supplier makes it known, in respect of goods, that\nthe price below which those goods are not to be sold is a\nprice ascertained by calculation from, or by reference to, a\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-96"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-96-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-96-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a4ba087ca6736bc025e89e0c6e24728cdf72efcd040d08a8b414150050107eda",
      "skos:note": "Supplier's specified price deemed to be their own if made known"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-96-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "96(4) Acts constituting engaging in resale price maintenance",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 512,
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of subsection (3):\n\n(a) where a price is specified by another person on behalf of the\nsupplier, it shall be deemed to have been specified by the\nsupplier;\n\n(b) where the supplier makes it known, in respect of goods, that\nthe price below which those goods are not to be sold is a\nprice specified by another person in respect of those goods,\nor in respect of goods of a like description, that price shall be\ndeemed to have been specified, in respect of the\nfirst-mentioned goods, by the supplier;\n\n(c) where a formula is specified by or on behalf of the supplier\nand a price may be ascertained by calculation from, or by\nreference to, that formula, that price shall be deemed to have\nbeen specified by the supplier; and\n\n(d) where the supplier makes it known, in respect of goods, that\nthe price below which those goods are not to be sold is a\nprice ascertained by calculation from, or by reference to, a\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions"
    },
