    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-96a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "96A Resale price maintenance in relation to services",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-96a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.515",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This Part applies to conduct in relation to services in a way that\ncorresponds to the way it applies to conduct in relation to goods.\n\n(2) For the purposes of subsection (1), this Part is to be read with\nappropriate modifications, including the following modifications:\n\n(a) references in this Part to goods are to be read as references to\nservices;\n\n(b) references to the sale of goods are to be read as references to\nthe re-supply of services.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This Part applies to conduct in relation to services in a way that\ncorresponds to the way it applies to conduct in relation to goods.\n\n(2) For the purposes of subsection (1), this Part is to be read with\nappropriate modifications, including the following modifications:\n\n(a) references in this Part to goods are to be read as references to\nservices;\n\n(b) references to the sale of goods are to be read as references to\nthe re-supply of services.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-96a-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-96a-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "12fe909b8d8ce8bd5f247155119edd968350ed554347113ca57ae88eb5da70a6"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-96a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "96A Resale price maintenance in relation to services",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 515,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This Part applies to conduct in relation to services in a way that\ncorresponds to the way it applies to conduct in relation to goods.\n\n(2) For the purposes of subsection (1), this Part is to be read with\nappropriate modifications, including the following modifications:\n\n(a) references in this Part to goods are to be read as references to\nservices;\n\n(b) references to the sale of goods are to be read as references to\nthe re-supply of services."
    },
