      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.515",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of paragraph 96(3)(d) or (e), the supplier shall be\ndeemed to withhold the supply of goods to another person if:\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of paragraph 96(3)(d) or (e), the supplier shall be\ndeemed to withhold the supply of goods to another person if:\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "cml:asserts": [
