      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-100m-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "100M(4) Tribunal not to review determinations while Commission",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-100m-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.524",
      "values:originalText": "(4) A day is not counted for the purposes of section 100P in relation to\nreview of an acquisition determination made under\nsubsection 51ABZE(1) in respect of a notification of an acquisition\nif the day occurs:\n\n(a) on or after the day a public benefit application is made in\nrelation to the notification; and\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(4) A day is not counted for the purposes of section 100P in relation to\nreview of an acquisition determination made under\nsubsection 51ABZE(1) in respect of a notification of an acquisition\nif the day occurs:\n\n(a) on or after the day a public benefit application is made in\nrelation to the notification; and\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-100m"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-100m-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-100m-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "08dede717196463e6c32eeed2974115b2992c15927054d4bd0296f5586440322",
      "skos:note": "No review of acquisition determination while public benefit application is made"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-100m-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "100M(4) Tribunal not to review determinations while Commission",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 524,
      "values:originalText": "(4) A day is not counted for the purposes of section 100P in relation to\nreview of an acquisition determination made under\nsubsection 51ABZE(1) in respect of a notification of an acquisition\nif the day occurs:\n\n(a) on or after the day a public benefit application is made in\nrelation to the notification; and\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-100m-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
