    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-100p-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "100P(5) Time within which Tribunal must make determination on",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-100p-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.527",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If, during the period within which the Tribunal must make its\ndetermination on the review (including that period as extended\nunder subsection (3)), the Tribunal is satisfied that the matter\ncannot be dealt with properly within the period because:\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If, during the period within which the Tribunal must make its\ndetermination on the review (including that period as extended\nunder subsection (3)), the Tribunal is satisfied that the matter\ncannot be dealt with properly within the period because:\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-100p"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-100p-ss-5-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4f1bfcbe639fc374bff5a011d1a0fd2991441b16ea44e4a2d38e16106b31191b",
      "skos:note": "Tribunal's period for making determination extended under subsection (3)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-100p-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "100P(5) Time within which Tribunal must make determination on",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 527,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If, during the period within which the Tribunal must make its\ndetermination on the review (including that period as extended\nunder subsection (3)), the Tribunal is satisfied that the matter\ncannot be dealt with properly within the period because:\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-100p-ss-5-norm",
