      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "May",
      "cml:logicSummary": "The Tribunal may do something.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-100r",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "100R Commission information",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-100r"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.528",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of a review under this Division, the member of\nthe Tribunal presiding at the review may require the Commission\nto give such information, make such reports and provide such other\nassistance to the Tribunal as the member specifies.\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nReview by Tribunal of decisions of Commission  Part IX\nApplications for review of acquisition determinations  Division 1B\n\nSection 100S\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(2) For the purposes of a review under this Division, the Tribunal may\nhave regard to any information furnished, documents produced or\nevidence given to the Commission in connection with the making\nof the determination to which the review relates.\n\n(3) Subsection (2) does not apply to information, documents or\nevidence to which the Commission was not permitted to have\nregard in making the determination.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of a review under this Division, the member of\nthe Tribunal presiding at the review may require the Commission\nto give such information, make such reports and provide such other\nassistance to the Tribunal as the member specifies.\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nReview by Tribunal of decisions of Commission  Part IX\nApplications for review of acquisition determinations  Division 1B\n\nSection 100S\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(2) For the purposes of a review under this Division, the Tribunal may\nhave regard to any information furnished, documents produced or\nevidence given to the Commission in connection with the making\nof the determination to which the review relates.\n\n(3) Subsection (2) does not apply to information, documents or\nevidence to which the Commission was not permitted to have\nregard in making the determination.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-100r-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-100r-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-100r-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "714a0a41df48ce9957b79973fc952c35bc134137f0f1ec44e7efb79972e1a3bc"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-100r",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "100R Commission information",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 528,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of a review under this Division, the member of\nthe Tribunal presiding at the review may require the Commission\nto give such information, make such reports and provide such other\nassistance to the Tribunal as the member specifies.\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nReview by Tribunal of decisions of Commission  Part IX\nApplications for review of acquisition determinations  Division 1B\n\nSection 100S\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(2) For the purposes of a review under this Division, the Tribunal may\nhave regard to any information furnished, documents produced or\nevidence given to the Commission in connection with the making\nof the determination to which the review relates.\n\n(3) Subsection (2) does not apply to information, documents or\nevidence to which the Commission was not permitted to have\nregard in making the determination."
    },
