      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of a review under this Division, the member of\nthe Tribunal presiding at the review may require the Commission\nto give such information, make such reports and provide such other\nassistance to the Tribunal as the member specifies.\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nReview by Tribunal of decisions of Commission  Part IX\nApplications for review of acquisition determinations  Division 1B\n\nSection 100S\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
