      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.528",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Subsection (2) does not apply to information, documents or\nevidence to which the Commission was not permitted to have\nregard in making the determination.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Subsection (2) does not apply to information, documents or\nevidence to which the Commission was not permitted to have\nregard in making the determination.",
      "values:partOf": {
