    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-103-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "103(3) Procedure generally",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-103-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.543",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The powers mentioned in subsection (2) may be exercised by a\npresidential member:\n\n(a) whether or not the Tribunal has been constituted under\nsection 37 in relation to the proceedings; and\n\n(b) once the Tribunal is so constituted—whether or not that\nmember is part of the Division of the Tribunal so constituted.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The powers mentioned in subsection (2) may be exercised by a\npresidential member:\n\n(a) whether or not the Tribunal has been constituted under\nsection 37 in relation to the proceedings; and\n\n(b) once the Tribunal is so constituted—whether or not that\nmember is part of the Division of the Tribunal so constituted.\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
