      "skos:definition": "(1) If the Tribunal is satisfied that it is appropriate to do so, the\nTribunal may order that a participant in proceedings for review\nunder Division 1A or 1B pay all or a specified part of the costs of\nanother participant in the proceedings.",
      "values:partOf": {
