      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.546",
      "values:originalText": "(2) If the Tribunal makes an order under subsection (1), it may make\nfurther orders that it believes appropriate in relation to the\nassessment or taxation of the costs.\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nReview by Tribunal of decisions of Commission  Part IX\nProcedure and Evidence  Division 2\n\nSection 112\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(2) If the Tribunal makes an order under subsection (1), it may make\nfurther orders that it believes appropriate in relation to the\nassessment or taxation of the costs.\n\nOther provisions  Chapter 6\nReview by Tribunal of decisions of Commission  Part IX\nProcedure and Evidence  Division 2\n\nSection 112\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
