      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.546",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make provision for\nand in relation to fees payable for the assessment or taxation of\ncosts ordered by the Tribunal to be paid.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make provision for\nand in relation to fees payable for the assessment or taxation of\ncosts ordered by the Tribunal to be paid.",
      "values:partOf": {
