    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-111-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "111(4) Tribunal may order costs be awarded",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-111-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.546",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If a participant (the first participant) is ordered to pay some or all\nof the costs of another participant under subsection (1), the amount\nof the costs may be recovered in the Federal Court as a debt due by\nthe first participant to the other participant.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If a participant (the first participant) is ordered to pay some or all\nof the costs of another participant under subsection (1), the amount\nof the costs may be recovered in the Federal Court as a debt due by\nthe first participant to the other participant.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-111"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-111-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-111-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e00beb83612a9537f32ce408c7c41990d78f2da84cc849dc543f579fce3585c9",
      "skos:note": "Participant must pay costs ordered by tribunal."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-111-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "111(4) Tribunal may order costs be awarded",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 546,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If a participant (the first participant) is ordered to pay some or all\nof the costs of another participant under subsection (1), the amount\nof the costs may be recovered in the Federal Court as a debt due by\nthe first participant to the other participant."
    },
    {
