      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.547",
      "values:originalText": "(5) A determination made under subsection (2) may do any or all of\nthe following:\n\n(a) determine fees in respect of a particular class or classes of\napplications, costs or proceedings;\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(5) A determination made under subsection (2) may do any or all of\nthe following:\n\n(a) determine fees in respect of a particular class or classes of\napplications, costs or proceedings;\n\nChapter 6  Other provisions",
